<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NUM" style="id">- Biblica® Open Asante Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">4 Mose (Numeri)</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mose Nwoma A Ɛtɔ So Ɛnan (Numeri)</para>
  <para style="toc2">4 Mose</para>
  <para style="toc3">4 Mose</para>
  <para style="mt3">Numeri</para>
  <para style="mt4">Anaasɛ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mose Nwoma A Ɛtɔ So Ɛnan</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NUM 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Nnipakan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 1:1"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kasa kyerɛɛ Mose wɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan a ɛwɔ Sinai anweatam so. Yei siiɛ wɔ mfeɛ mmienu a Israelfoɔ firii Misraim no akyi, ɔbosome a ɛtɔ so mmienu no no ɛda a ɛdi ɛkan. Ɔkaa sɛ: <verse eid="NUM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 1:2"/>“Gyina Israelfoɔ no mmusuakuo ne wɔn mmusua so kan wɔn nyinaa. Twerɛ ɔbarima biara din. <verse eid="NUM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 1:3"/>Wo ne Aaron na mobɛkan mmarima a wɔadi mfeɛ aduonu no ne deɛ ɛboro saa a wɔtumi kɔ ɔsa. <verse eid="NUM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 1:4"/>Ɔbarima a ɔfiri abusuakuo biara mu a ɔyɛ ntuanoni na ɔbɛboa mo.<verse eid="NUM 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 1:5"/>“Mmarima a wɔbɛboa mo no edin nie:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 1:5"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 1:5">“Ruben abusuakuo no ntuanoni yɛ Sedeur babarima Elisur;<verse eid="NUM 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 1:6"/>Simeon abusuakuo no ntuanoni yɛ Surisadai babarima Selumiel;<verse eid="NUM 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 1:7"/>Yuda abusuakuo no ntuanoni yɛ Aminadab babarima Nahson;<verse eid="NUM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 1:8"/>Isakar abusuakuo no ntuanoni yɛ Suar babarima Netanel;<verse eid="NUM 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 1:9"/>Sebulon abusuakuo no ntuanoni yɛ Helon babarima Eliab;<verse eid="NUM 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 1:10"/>Yosef mmammarima no:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:10">Efraim abusuakuo no ntuanoni yɛ Amihud babarima Elisama;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:10">Manase abusuakuo no ntuanoni yɛ Pedahsur babarima Gamaliel;<verse eid="NUM 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 1:11"/>Benyamin abusuakuo ntuanoni yɛ Gideoni babarima Abidan;<verse eid="NUM 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 1:12"/>Dan abusuakuo ntuanoni yɛ Amisadai babarima Ahieser;<verse eid="NUM 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 1:13"/>Aser abusuakuo ntuanoni yɛ Okran babarima Pagiel;<verse eid="NUM 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 1:14"/>Gad abusuakuo ntuanoni yɛ Deguel babarima Eliasaf;<verse eid="NUM 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 1:15"/>Naftali abusuakuo ntuanoni yɛ Enan babarima Ahira.”<verse eid="NUM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 1:16"/>Yeinom ne mmarima a wɔyii wɔn firii nnipa no mu, a wɔyɛ ntuanofoɔ ma wɔn agyanom mmusua no.<verse eid="NUM 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 1:17"/>Mose ne Aaron faa saa nnipa yi a wɔabobɔ wɔn edin yi, <verse eid="NUM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 1:18"/>na ɛda a ɛdi ɛkan wɔ ɔbosome a ɛtɔ so mmienu no mu no, wɔfrɛɛ ɔmanfoɔ no nyinaa. Nnipa no nam wɔn mmusuakuo ne wɔn mmusua so kyerɛɛ wɔn mmusuadua na wɔtwerɛɛ mmarima a wɔadi mfeɛ aduonu ne deɛ ɛboro saa no edin mmaako mmaako <verse eid="NUM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 1:19"/>sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ Mose no. Enti ɔkan wɔn wɔ Sinai ɛserɛ so.<verse eid="NUM 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 1:20"/>Ruben a ɔyɛ Israel abakan asefoɔ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:20">Mmarima a wɔadi mfeɛ aduonu ne deɛ ɛboro saa a wɔtumi kɔ ɔsa no, wɔtwerɛɛ wɔn edin mmaako mmaako sɛdeɛ wɔn mmusua teɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 1:21"/>Nnipa dodoɔ a wɔfiri Ruben abusuakuo mu yɛ mpem aduanan nsia ne ahanum (46,500).<verse eid="NUM 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 1:22"/>Simeon asefoɔ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:22">Mmarima a wɔadi mfeɛ aduonu ne deɛ ɛboro saa a wɔbɛtumi akɔ ɔsa no, wɔtwerɛɛ wɔn edin mmaako mmaako sɛdeɛ wɔn mmusua teɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 1:23"/>Nnipa dodoɔ a wɔfiri Simeon abusuakuo mu yɛ mpem aduonum nkron ne ahasa (59,300).<verse eid="NUM 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 1:24"/>Gad asefoɔ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:24">Mmarima a wɔadi mfeɛ aduonu ne deɛ ɛboro saa a wɔbɛtumi akɔ ɔsa no, wɔtwerɛɛ wɔn edin sɛdeɛ wɔn mmusua teɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 1:25"/>Nnipa dodoɔ a wɔfiri Gad abusuakuo mu yɛ mpem aduanan enum ahansia ne aduonum (45,650).<verse eid="NUM 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 1:26"/>Yuda asefoɔ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:26">Mmarima a wɔadi mfeɛ aduonu ne deɛ ɛboro saa a wɔbɛtumi akɔ ɔsa no, wɔtwerɛɛ wɔn edin sɛdeɛ wɔn mmusua teɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 1:27"/>Nnipa dodoɔ a wɔfiri Yuda abusuakuo mu yɛ mpem aduɔson ɛnan ne ahansia (74,600).<verse eid="NUM 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 1:28"/>Isakar asefoɔ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:28">Mmarima a wɔadi mfeɛ aduonu ne deɛ ɛboro saa a wɔbɛtumi akɔ ɔsa no, wɔtwerɛɛ wɔn edin sɛdeɛ wɔn mmusua teɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 1:29"/>Nnipa dodoɔ a wɔfiri Isakar abusuakuo no yɛ mpem aduonum ɛnan ne ahanan (54,400).<verse eid="NUM 1:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 1:30"/>Sebulon asefoɔ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:30">Mmarima a wɔadi mfeɛ aduonu ne deɛ ɛboro saa a wɔbɛtumi akɔ ɔsa no, wɔtwerɛɛ wɔn edin sɛdeɛ wɔn mmusua teɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 1:31"/>Nnipa dodoɔ a wɔfiri Sebulon abusuakuo no mu yɛ mpem aduonum nson ne ahanan (57,400).<verse eid="NUM 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 1:32"/>Yosef mmammarima no:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 1:32">Efraim asefoɔ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:32">Mmarima a wɔadi mfeɛ aduonu ne deɛ ɛboro saa a wɔbɛtumi akɔ ɔsa no, wɔtwerɛɛ wɔn edin sɛdeɛ wɔn mmusua teɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 1:33"/>Nnipa dodoɔ a wɔfiri Efraim abusuakuo no mu yɛ mpem aduanan ne ahanum (40,500).<verse eid="NUM 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 1:34"/>Manase asefoɔ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:34">Mmarima a wɔadi mfeɛ aduonu ne deɛ ɛboro saa a wɔbɛtumi akɔ ɔsa no, wɔtwerɛɛ wɔn edin sɛdeɛ wɔn mmusua teɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 1:35"/>Nnipa dodoɔ a wɔfiri Manase abusuakuo no mu yɛ mpem aduasa mmienu ne ahanu (32,200).<verse eid="NUM 1:35"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 1:36"/>Benyamin asefoɔ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:36">Mmarima a wɔadi mfeɛ aduonu ne deɛ ɛboro saa a wɔbɛtumi akɔ ɔsa no, wɔtwerɛɛ wɔn edin sɛdeɛ wɔn mmusua teɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 1:37"/>Nnipa dodoɔ a wɔfiri Benyamin abusuakuo no mu yɛ mpem aduasa enum ne ahanan (35,400).<verse eid="NUM 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 1:38"/>Dan asefoɔ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:38">Mmarima a wɔadi mfeɛ aduonu ne deɛ ɛboro saa a wɔbɛtumi akɔ ɔsa no, wɔtwerɛɛ wɔn edin sɛdeɛ wɔn mmusua teɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 1:39"/>Nnipa dodoɔ a wɔfiri Dan abusuakuo no mu yɛ mpem aduosia mmienu ne ahanson (62,700).<verse eid="NUM 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 1:40"/>Aser asefoɔ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:40">Mmarima a wɔadi mfeɛ aduonu ne deɛ ɛboro saa a wɔbɛtumi akɔ ɔsa no, wɔtwerɛɛ wɔn edin sɛdeɛ wɔn mmusua teɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 1:41"/>Nnipa dodoɔ a wɔfiri Aser abusuakuo no mu yɛ mpem aduanan baako ne ahanum (41,500).<verse eid="NUM 1:41"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 1:42"/>Naftali asefoɔ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 1:42">Mmarima a wɔadi mfeɛ aduonu ne deɛ ɛboro saa a wɔbɛtumi akɔ ɔsa no, wɔtwerɛɛ wɔn edin sɛdeɛ wɔn mmusua teɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 1:43"/>Nnipa dodoɔ a wɔfiri Naftali abusuakuo no mu yɛ mpem aduonum mmiɛnsa ne ahanan (53,400).<verse eid="NUM 1:43"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 1:44"/>Yeinom ne mmarima a Mose ne Aaron ne Israel mmusuakuo dumienu no ntuanofoɔ kan wɔn. <verse eid="NUM 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 1:45"/>Israelfoɔ a na wɔadi mfeɛ aduonu anaa deɛ ɛboro saa no a wɔbɛtumi adɔm Israel akodɔm no nso, wɔgyinaa wɔn mmusua so kan wɔn. <verse eid="NUM 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 1:46"/>Na wɔn nyinaa dodoɔ yɛ mpem ahansia ne mmiɛnsa ne ahanum aduonum (603,550).<verse eid="NUM 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 1:47"/>Mmusua a wɔwɔ Lewi abusuakuo no deɛ, wɔankan wɔn anka wɔn a aka no ho. <verse eid="NUM 1:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 1:48"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka akyerɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 1:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 1:49"/>“Nkan Lewifoɔ abusuakuo no, na mfa wɔn nka Israelfoɔ a wɔaka no ho. <verse eid="NUM 1:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 1:50"/>Fa Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no ho dwumadie hyɛ Lewifoɔ no nsa. Wɔnhwɛ nneɛma a wɔde asiesie mu ne deɛ ɛkeka ho nyinaa so. Wɔn na wɔbɛsoa Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no ne emu nneɛma, wɔbɛhwɛ so na wɔatenatena ho. <verse eid="NUM 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 1:51"/>Ɛberɛ biara a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔtu Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no, Lewifoɔ no na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔtutu, na baabiara a wɔde bɛsi no, wɔn na wɔbɛyɛ. Onipa foforɔ biara a ɔbɛbɛn ho no, wɔbɛkum no. <verse eid="NUM 1:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 1:52"/>Israel abusuakuo biara bɛnya nʼatenaeɛ ne ne frankaa. <verse eid="NUM 1:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 1:53"/>Lewifoɔ no bɛsisi wɔn ntomadan atwa Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no ho ahyia, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a Onyankopɔn abufuhyeɛ remma Israelfoɔ no so. Lewifoɔ no na wɔbɛhwɛ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no so.”<verse eid="NUM 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 1:54"/>Israelfoɔ no yɛɛ yeinom nyinaa sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ Mose no.<verse eid="NUM 1:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NUM 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Israel Mmusuakuo Atenaeɛ Ho Nhyehyɛeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 2:1"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose ne Aaron sɛ: <verse eid="NUM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 2:2"/>“Abusua biara bɛnya nʼafa wɔ atenaeɛ hɔ, na ekuo biara bɛtena nʼabusua frankaa ase. Na mmusua no atenaeɛ ahodoɔ no mfimfini na wɔde Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no bɛsi.”<verse eid="NUM 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 2:3"/>Apueeɛ fam,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 2:3">baabi a owia pue firi hɔ no na ɛsɛ sɛ Yuda nnipa nkyekyɛmu ahodoɔ no nyinaa bɔ wɔn atenaeɛ wɔ wɔn frankaa ase. Yudafoɔ ntuanoni ne Aminadab ba Nahson. <verse eid="NUM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 2:4"/>Na ne dɔm no ano si mpem aduɔson ɛnan ne ahansia (74,600).<verse eid="NUM 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 2:5"/>Isakar abusuakuo na wɔbɛdi so. Wɔn ntuanoni ne Suar babarima Netanel. <verse eid="NUM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 2:6"/>Na ne dɔm no ano si mpem aduonum ɛnan ne ahanan (54,400).<verse eid="NUM 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 2:7"/>Sebulon abusuakuo na wɔbɛdi so. Wɔn ntuanoni ne Helon babarima Eliab. <verse eid="NUM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 2:8"/>Na ne dɔm no ano si mpem aduonum nson ne ahanan (57,400).<verse eid="NUM 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 2:9"/>Enti na nnipa dodoɔ a wɔwɔ Yuda atenaeɛ no nyinaa sɛdeɛ wɔn nkyekyɛmu teɛ no ano si mpem ɔha aduɔwɔtwe nsia ne ahanan (186,400). Sɛ Israelfoɔ no tu a, saa mmusuakuo mmiɛnsa yi na ɛdi ɛkan.<verse eid="NUM 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 2:10"/>Anafoɔ fam na Ruben nnipa nkyekyɛmu ahodoɔ no nyinaa bɛbɔ wɔn atenaeɛ de wɔn frankaa asi. Wɔn ntuanoni ne Sedeur babarima Elisur. <verse eid="NUM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 2:11"/>Ne dɔm ano si mpem aduanan nsia ne ahanum (46,500).<verse eid="NUM 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 2:12"/>Simeon abusuakuo na wɔbɛdi so. Wɔn ntuanoni ne Surisadai babarima Selumiel. <verse eid="NUM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 2:13"/>Ne dɔm ano si mpem aduonum nkron ne ahasa (59,300).<verse eid="NUM 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 2:14"/>Gad abusuakuo na wɔbɛdi so. Wɔn ntuanoni ne Reuel babarima Eliasaf. <verse eid="NUM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 2:15"/>Na ne dɔm ano si mpem aduanan enum ahansia ne aduonum (45,650).<verse eid="NUM 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 2:16"/>Na mmarima a wɔwɔ Ruben atenaeɛ ne sɛdeɛ wɔn nkyekyɛmu teɛ no ano si mpem ɔha aduonum baako ahanan ne aduonum (151,450). Na sɛ Israelfoɔ tu a, wɔn na wɔtɔ so mmienu.<verse eid="NUM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 2:17"/>Afei Lewifoɔ no de Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan bɛfiri wɔn atenaeɛ mfimfini hɔ akɔ. Mmusuakuo no nyinaa bɛkɔ no nnidisoɔ sɛdeɛ wɔn atenaeɛ nhyehyɛeɛ teɛ, wɔ wɔn mmusuakuo mfrankaa akyi.<verse eid="NUM 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 2:18"/>Efraim abusuakuo bɛfa atenaeɛm hɔ atɔeɛ fam adi wɔn abusua frankaa akyi. Wɔn ntuanoni ne Amihud babarima Elisama. <verse eid="NUM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 2:19"/>Ne dɔm ano si mpem aduanan ne ahanum (40,500).<verse eid="NUM 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 2:20"/>Manase abusuakuo na wɔbɛdi so. Wɔn ntuanoni ne Pedahsur babarima Gamaliel. <verse eid="NUM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 2:21"/>Ne dɔm ano si mpem aduasa mmienu ne ahanum (32,200).<verse eid="NUM 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 2:22"/>Benyamin abusuakuo na wɔdi so. Wɔn ntuanoni ne Gideoni babarima Abidan. <verse eid="NUM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 2:23"/>Ne dɔm ano si mpem aduasa enum ne ahanan (35,400).<verse eid="NUM 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 2:24"/>Na mmarima a wɔwɔ Efraim atenaeɛ ne sɛdeɛ wɔn nkyekyɛmu teɛ no ano si mpem ɔha ne nnwɔtwe ne ɔha baako (108,100). Na sɛ Israelfoɔ tu a, wɔn na wɔtɔ so mmiɛnsa.<verse eid="NUM 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 2:25"/>Dan abusuakuo bɛfa atifi fam adi wɔn abusua frankaa akyi. Wɔn ntuanoni ne Amisadai babarima Ahieser. <verse eid="NUM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 2:26"/>Ne dɔm ano si mpem aduosia mmienu ne ahanson (62,700).<verse eid="NUM 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 2:27"/>Aser abusuakuo no bɛdi so. Wɔn ntuanoni ne Okran babarima Pagiel. <verse eid="NUM 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 2:28"/>Ne dɔm ano si mpem aduanan baako ne ahanum (41,500).<verse eid="NUM 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 2:29"/>Naftali abusuakuo no bɛdi so. Wɔn ntuanoni ne Enan ba Ahira. <verse eid="NUM 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 2:30"/>Ne dɔm ano si mpem aduonum mmiɛnsa ne ahanan (53,400).<verse eid="NUM 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 2:31"/>Mmarima a wɔwɔ Dan atenaeɛ no ano si mpem ɔha aduonum nson ne ahansia (157,600).<verse eid="NUM 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 2:32"/>Sei na Israelfoɔ a wɔkan wɔn mmusuakuo mmusuakuo no teɛ. Wɔn a wɔwɔ atenaeɛ hɔ nyinaa, sɛdeɛ wɔn nkyekyɛmu teɛ no ano si mpem ahansia ne mmiɛnsa ahanum ne aduonum (603,550). <verse eid="NUM 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 2:33"/>Sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ Mose no, wɔankan Lewifoɔ no anka Israelfoɔ no ho.<verse eid="NUM 2:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 2:34"/>Enti Israelfoɔ yɛɛ biribiara sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ Mose no. Wɔbobɔɔ wɔn atenaeɛ, tenatenaa wɔn frankaa ahodoɔ ase, na wɔnantee nnidisoɔ nnidisoɔ sɛdeɛ wɔn mmusua ne wɔn afie teɛ.<verse eid="NUM 2:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NUM 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Lewifoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 3:1"/>Ɛberɛ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kasa kyerɛɛ Mose wɔ Sinai Bepɔ so no.<verse eid="NUM 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 3:2"/>Na yeinom ne Aaron ne Mose abusua. Aaron mmammarima edin na ɛdidi soɔ yi: Nadab, nʼabakan, Abihu, Eleasa ne Itamar. <verse eid="NUM 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 3:3"/>Yeinom ne Aaron mma a wɔasra wɔn ngo na wɔayi wɔn asi hɔ sɛ asɔfoɔ. <verse eid="NUM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 3:4"/>Nadab ne Abihu deɛ, wɔwuwuu wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim ɛberɛ a wɔhyee afɔrebɔdeɛ wɔ ogya a ɛmfata so wɔ Sinai ɛserɛ so. Na wɔnni mma enti, Eleasa ne Itamar nko ara na wɔsomm sɛ asɔfoɔ, ɛberɛ a wɔn agya Aaron te ase.<verse eid="NUM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 3:5"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ: <verse eid="NUM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 3:6"/>“Frɛ Lewifoɔ no, na fa wɔn ma ɔsɔfoɔ Aaron sɛ nʼaboafoɔ. <verse eid="NUM 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 3:7"/>Wɔbɛyɛ adwuma wɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no mu ama ɔsɔfoɔ Aaron ne nnipa no nyinaa. <verse eid="NUM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 3:8"/>Afei, wɔbɛhwɛ nneɛma a wɔde siesie Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan mu no so, de asi Israelfoɔ no no anan mu ayɛ asodie a wɔyɛ wɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no mu. <verse eid="NUM 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 3:9"/>Fa Lewifoɔ no ma Aaron ne ne mmammarima; wɔn ne Israelfoɔ a wɔde wɔn bɛma no korakora. <verse eid="NUM 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 3:10"/>Ma Aaron ne ne mmammarima no nsom sɛ asɔfoɔ; onipa foforɔ biara a ɔbɛbɛne kronkronbea hɔ no, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔkum no.”<verse eid="NUM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 3:11"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 3:12"/>“Mayi Lewifoɔ no afiri Israelfoɔ no mu de wɔn asi Israel babaa biara abakan a ɔyɛ ɔbarima anan mu. Lewifoɔ no yɛ me dea, <verse eid="NUM 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 3:13"/>ɛfiri sɛ abakan biara wɔ me. Ɛberɛ a mekunkum mmakan wɔ Misraim no, megyaa Israel mmakan, sɛ wɔyɛ nnipa anaa mmoa. Wɔyɛ me dea. Mene <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.”<verse eid="NUM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 3:14"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose wɔ Sinai ɛserɛ so sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 3:15"/>“Kan Lewifoɔ no wɔ wɔn mmusua ne afie mu. Kan ɔbarima biara firi deɛ wadi bosome baako so.” <verse eid="NUM 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 3:16"/>Enti Mose kanee wɔn sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ no no.<verse eid="NUM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 3:17"/>Yeinom ne Lewi mmammarima:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 3:17">Gerson, Kohat ne Merari.<verse eid="NUM 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 3:18"/>Gerson asefoɔ nie:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 3:18">Libni ne Simei.<verse eid="NUM 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 3:19"/>Kohat asefoɔ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 3:19">Amram, Ishar, Hebron ne Usiel.<verse eid="NUM 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 3:20"/>Merari asefoɔ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 3:20">Mahli ne Musi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 3:20"/>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 3:20">Yeinom ne Lewifoɔ sɛdeɛ wɔn mmusua ne wɔn afie teɛ.<verse eid="NUM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 3:21"/>Gerson asefoɔ no na wɔyɛ mmusua a wɔfiri Libni ne Simei ase.<verse eid="NUM 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 3:22"/>Na Gersonfoɔ mmarima a wɔadi bosome ne deɛ ɛboro saa a wɔfiri Gerson mmusua mu no dodoɔ yɛ mpem ahanson ne ahanum (7,500).<verse eid="NUM 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 3:23"/>Wɔn atenaeɛ wɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no akyi wɔ atɔeɛ fam.<verse eid="NUM 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 3:24"/>Na Gersonfoɔ no ntuanoni ne Lael babarima Eliasaf.<verse eid="NUM 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 3:25"/>Saa mmusuakuo mmienu yi na na wɔhwɛ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no ne ne nkataho no ne ɛkwan nsɛnanotam no so. <verse eid="NUM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 3:26"/>Afei, na wɔhwɛ adihɔ nsɛnanotam a ɛtwa Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no ho ne afɔrebukyia ne adihɔ nsɛnanotam, nhoma ne ɛhɔ nneɛma a wɔde di dwuma ahodoɔ no nyinaa so.<verse eid="NUM 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 3:27"/>Kohat asefoɔ yɛ mmusua a wɔfiri Amram, Ishar, Hebron ne Usiel ase.<verse eid="NUM 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 3:28"/>Na Kehat mmusua no mu mmarima a wɔadi bosome ne deɛ ɛboro saa dodoɔ yɛ mpem aha nwɔtwe ne ahansia (8,600).</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 3:28">Wɔn na na wɔhwɛ kronkronbea mu hɔ so.<verse eid="NUM 3:28"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 3:29"/>Wɔmaa wɔn atenaeɛ wɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no anafoɔ fam.<verse eid="NUM 3:29"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 3:30"/>Na Kohatfoɔ ntuanoni no ne Usiel babarima Elisafan.<verse eid="NUM 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 3:31"/>Saa mmusua ɛnan yi na na wɔhwɛ apam adaka, ɛpono, kaneadua, afɔrebukyia hodoɔ, ne deɛ ɛkeka ho a na wɔde di dwuma wɔ kronkronbea hɔ, mfimfini ntwamutam ne nneɛma a wɔde di dwuma ahodoɔ wɔ hɔ nyinaa no so.<verse eid="NUM 3:31"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 3:32"/>Aaron babarima ɔsɔfoɔ Eleasa no na na ɔyɛ ɔpanin wɔ Lewifoɔ no nyinaa so. Ɔyɛɛ no panin wɔ asɔfoɔ a wɔhwɛ kronkronbea no so.<verse eid="NUM 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 3:33"/>Na Merari asefoɔ no yɛ mmusua a wɔfiri Mahli ne Musi ase.<verse eid="NUM 3:33"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 3:34"/>Merarifoɔ mmusua no mu na mmarima a wɔadi bosome ne deɛ ɛboro saa dodoɔ yɛ mpem nsia ne ahanu (6,200).<verse eid="NUM 3:34"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 3:35"/>Merari abusua no ntuanoni ne Abihail babarima Suriel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 3:35">na wɔtenaa Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no atifi fam.<verse eid="NUM 3:35"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 3:36"/>Dwumadie a wɔde hyɛɛ saa mmusuakuo mmienu yi nsa ne sɛ, wɔbɛhwɛ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no nnyinasoɔ so. Afei, wɔbɛhwɛ mmeamu nnua, mpunan, nsisisoɔ ne ɛho nneɛma a wɔde di dwuma nyinaa. <verse eid="NUM 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 3:37"/>Afei, mpunan a ɛwɔ adihɔ hɔ nyinaa ne ne nsisisoɔ, mpɛɛwa, ne ntampehoma nyinaa, wɔbɛhwɛ so.<verse eid="NUM 3:37"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 3:38"/>Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no apueeɛ fam, deɛ owia pue firi no, wɔgya maa Mose ne Aaron ne ne mmammarima sɛ wɔnsisi wɔn ntomadan wɔ hɔ.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 3:38">Saa nnipa yi na na wɔsi Israelfoɔ no anan mu di Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no ho dwuma nyinaa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 3:38">Onipa foforɔ biara a ɔbɛbɛn kronkronbea hɔ no, wɔbɛkum no.<verse eid="NUM 3:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 3:39"/>Lewifoɔ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ Mose ne Aaron sɛ wɔnkan wɔn sɛdeɛ wɔn mmusua teɛ a ɔbarima biara a wɔadi bosome ne deɛ ɛboro saa ka ho no dodoɔ yɛ mpem aduonu mmienu (22,000).<verse eid="NUM 3:39"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 3:40"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, “Kan Israelfoɔ mmakan a wɔyɛ mmarima na wɔadi bosome ne deɛ ɛboro saa no, na twerɛ wɔn edin. <verse eid="NUM 3:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 3:41"/>Lewifoɔ no bɛyɛ me dea. Ma wɔnsi Israelfoɔ mmakan nyinaa anan mu, na Lewifoɔ nyɛmmoa mmakan nsi Israelfoɔ nyɛmmoa mmakan anan mu. Mene <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.”<verse eid="NUM 3:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 3:42"/>Enti Mose kanee Israelfoɔ mmakan nyinaa sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ no no. <verse eid="NUM 3:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 3:43"/>Mmammarima mmakan a wɔadi bosome ne deɛ ɛboro saa no a ɔtwerɛɛ wɔn edin no ano si mpem aduonu mmienu ahanu ne aduɔson mmiɛnsa (22,273).<verse eid="NUM 3:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 3:44"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 3:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 3:45"/>“Ma Lewifoɔ nsi Israelfoɔ mmakan ananmu. Na Lewifoɔ nyɛmmoa mmakan nso nsi Israelfoɔ nyɛmmoa mmakan ananmu. Lewifoɔ yɛ me dea. Mene <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. <verse eid="NUM 3:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 3:46"/>Ansa na mobɛgye Israelfoɔ mmakan ahanu aduɔson mmiɛnsa no a wɔboro Lewifoɔ no dodoɔ so no, <verse eid="NUM 3:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 3:47"/>momma wɔntua tiadeɛ, sɛdeɛ hyiadan mu nnwetɛbena teɛ, a emu duru yɛ gram aduonum nson. <verse eid="NUM 3:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 3:48"/>Fa tiadeɛ sika no ma Aaron ne ne mma.”<verse eid="NUM 3:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 3:49"/>Enti Mose gyegyee Israelfoɔ ahanu aduɔson mmiɛnsa a na wɔboro Lewifoɔ no dodoɔ so no tiadeɛ. <verse eid="NUM 3:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 3:50"/>Sika a wɔgyegyeeɛ no nyinaa ano sii dwetɛ kilogram dunum ne fa. <verse eid="NUM 3:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 3:51"/>Na Mose de maa Aaron ne ne mmammarima sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ no no.<verse eid="NUM 3:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NUM 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Kohar Mmammarima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 4:1"/>Afei <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose ne Aaron sɛ: <verse eid="NUM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 4:2"/>“Kan Kohatfoɔ no dodoɔ a wɔwɔ Lewifoɔ no abusua mu. <verse eid="NUM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 4:3"/>Saa nnipakan yi bɛyɛ mmarima nko ara a wɔadi firi mfeɛ aduasa kɔsi aduonum a wɔbɛtumi ayɛ adwuma wɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan mu.<verse eid="NUM 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 4:4"/>“Kohat mma no dwumadie ne sɛ wɔbɛhwɛ akronkronneɛ no so wɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no mu. <verse eid="NUM 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 4:5"/>Sɛ wɔretu afiri atenaeɛ hɔ a, Aaron ne ne mma mmarima na wɔbɛdi ɛkan akɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no mu akɔfa nkatanimu no de akata adaka no ho. <verse eid="NUM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 4:6"/>Afei, wɔde abirekyie nwoma bɛkata nkatanimu no ho na wɔde ntoma tuntum akata abirekyie nhoma no ho na wɔde nnua a wɔde soa adaka no ahyehyɛ ne nkawa no mu.<verse eid="NUM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 4:7"/>“Afei, wɔmfa ntoma tuntum nsɛ ɛpono a Hyiadan mu Burodo no da so no so, na wɔmfa nyowaa, ntere, dwaresɛn akɛseɛ, nkuruwa ne Burodo no ngu ntoma no so. <verse eid="NUM 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 4:8"/>Wɔde ntoma kɔkɔɔ bɛkata so na wɔasane de abirekyie nhoma akata ntoma kɔkɔɔ no so. Na afei, wɔde nnua a wɔde bɛsoa no ahyehyɛ ɛpono no mu.<verse eid="NUM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 4:9"/>“Afei, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde ntoma tuntum kata kaneadua no, nkanea no, adaawa no, nkukuo apaawa no ne ngo toa no ho. <verse eid="NUM 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 4:10"/>Saa nneɛma yi nyinaa nso, wɔde abirekyie nhoma bɛkata ho na wɔde nkyekyereeɛ yi nyinaa abɛgu ɛpono so.<verse eid="NUM 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 4:11"/>“Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde ntoma tuntum kata sikakɔkɔɔ afɔrebukyia no so na wɔsane de abirekyie nhoma kata so bio na wɔde nnua a wɔde soa no hyehyɛ afɔrebukyia no mu.<verse eid="NUM 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 4:12"/>“Hyiadan no mu som no ho nneɛma a aka no nyinaa, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde ntoma bibire kyekyere ho a wɔde abirekyie nhoma asane akyekyere ho na wɔde to mpata a wɔde soa no so.<verse eid="NUM 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 4:13"/>“Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔtu nsõ no nyinaa firi afɔrebukyia no mu guo, na wɔde ntoma kɔkɔɔ bibire kyekyere ho. <verse eid="NUM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 4:14"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde afɔrebukyia no ho ɔsom nneɛma nyinaa gu ntoma no so. Saa nneɛma no ne nkyɛnsee a wɔnoa mu, nsosɔmu, sofi, kyɛnsee kɛseɛ ne nneɛma a wɔkora mu nneɛma gu ntoma no so na wɔde abirekyie nhoma kata ne nyinaa so. Na afei, wɔde nnua a wɔde soa no gu faako a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde guo.<verse eid="NUM 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 4:15"/>“Sɛ Aaron ne ne mma mmarima no wie kronkronbea hɔ nneɛma no anoboa a, Kohat ne nʼabusuafoɔ bɛba abɛsoa akɔ baabiara a wɔretu nneɛma akɔ. Nanso wɔnni ho kwan sɛ wɔde wɔn nsa ka nneɛma a ɛho te no bi. Wɔyɛ saa a, wɔbɛwuwu. Kohat mma na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔsoa nneɛma a ɛwɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no mu.<verse eid="NUM 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 4:16"/>“Aaron babarima Eleasa na ɔbɛhwɛ ngo a wɔde bɛsɔ kanea, nnuhwam, daa aduane a wɔde bɔ afɔdeɛ, ɔsra ngo ne Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no nyinaa so. Biribibiara a ɛwɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no mu no nso, ɔbɛhwɛ so.”<verse eid="NUM 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 4:17"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose ne Aaron sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 4:18"/>“Monntwa Kohatfoɔ abusuakuo no mfiri Lewifoɔ mu. <verse eid="NUM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 4:19"/>Sɛ wɔresoa nneɛma a ɛho te no a, deɛ ɛsɛ sɛ wɔyɛ a wɔrenwuwu nie: Ɛsɛ sɛ Aaron ne ne mma mmarima no ne wɔn kɔ hɔ kɔkyerɛ wɔn adeɛ a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔn mu biara soa. <verse eid="NUM 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 4:20"/>Sɛ wɔanyɛ saa a, ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔkɔ kronkronbea hɔ koraa. Sɛ wɔyɛ saa a, wɔbɛhunu nneɛma a ɛho te no na ɛrenkyɛre koraa wɔawuwu.”<verse eid="NUM 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gerson Mmammarima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 4:21"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 4:22"/>“Kan Gerson asefoɔ a wɔfra Lewifoɔ abusua mu no, <verse eid="NUM 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 4:23"/>firi mmarima a wɔadi mfeɛ aduasa kɔsi aduonum a wɔbɛtumi ayɛ adwuma kronkron wɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan mu hɔ so.<verse eid="NUM 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 4:24"/>“Gerson mmusua no dwuma a wɔbɛdie nie: <verse eid="NUM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 4:25"/>Wɔbɛsoa ntoma a ɛtwa Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan mu hɔ, Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no ankasa ne deɛ ɛkata ho, abirekyie nhoma nkurusoɔ ne ntoma a ɛsɛn Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no ano no. <verse eid="NUM 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 4:26"/>Afei, wɔbɛsoa nkataho a ɛkata adihɔ hɔ ɔfasuo no ho no. Wɔbɛsoa ntoma a ɛtwa adihɔ hɔ ɛkwan no ano ne afɔrebukyia ne Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no ntam no. Wɔbɛsoa afɔrebukyia no, ntampehoma ne deɛ ɛkeka ho nyinaa. Wɔn na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔhwɛ, twe yeinom nyinaa. <verse eid="NUM 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 4:27"/>Aaron anaa ne mmammarima no bi tumi ma Gerson asefoɔ no bi dwuma di. <verse eid="NUM 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 4:28"/>Nanso Gersonfoɔ no bɛhyɛ Aaron Itamar ase.<verse eid="NUM 4:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Merari Mmammarima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 4:29"/>“Afei, kan Merari asefoɔ a wɔfra Lewifoɔ abusua mu no <verse eid="NUM 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 4:30"/>ɛfiri mmarima a wɔadi mfeɛ aduasa kɔsi aduonum so a wɔbɛtumi ayɛ adwuma wɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan mu hɔ. <verse eid="NUM 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 4:31"/>Sɛ wɔpagya Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no a, wɔn na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔsoa ne nnyinasoɔ, nnua a ɛsisi mu, ne nsisisoɔ <verse eid="NUM 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 4:32"/>mpunan a wɔde yɛɛ adihɔ hɔ afasuo no ne ne nsisisoɔ, mpɛɛwa, ntampehoma ne biribiara a wɔde di ho dwuma. Fa dwumadie ahodoɔ no hyɛ nnipa a wobɛbobɔ wɔn edin nsa. <verse eid="NUM 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 4:33"/>Merari asefoɔ no, Aaron babarima Itamar na ɔbɛhwɛ wɔn so.”<verse eid="NUM 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 4:34"/>Enti Mose ne Aaron ne mpanimfoɔ no bi kɔkan Kohatfoɔ<verse eid="NUM 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 4:35"/>a mmarima a wɔadi mfeɛ aduasa kɔsi aduonum nyinaa a wɔbɛtumi ayɛ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan mu adwuma ka ho, <verse eid="NUM 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 4:36"/>na wɔhunuu sɛ wɔn nyinaa dodoɔ yɛ mpem mmienu ne ahanson aduonum. <verse eid="NUM 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 4:37"/>Wɔyɛɛ yeinom nyinaa de dii <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahyɛdeɛ a ɔhyɛɛ Mose no so.<verse eid="NUM 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 4:38"/>Wɔkan Gersonfoɔ no mmusua ne wɔn mmusuakuo.<verse eid="NUM 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 4:39"/>Wɔkan mmarima a wɔadi mfeɛ aduasa kɔsi aduonum a wɔbɛtumi ayɛ adwuma wɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no mu. <verse eid="NUM 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 4:40"/>Wɔn nyinaa dodoɔ yɛɛ mpem mmienu ahansia ne aduasa. <verse eid="NUM 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 4:41"/>Enti na Gersonfoɔ a wɔfata sɛ wɔsom wɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no mu no nyinaa dodoɔ ne no. Mose ne Aaron na wɔkan wɔn sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ wɔn no.<verse eid="NUM 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 4:42"/>Merarifoɔ no nso, wɔkan wɔn mmusua ne wɔn mmusuakuo.<verse eid="NUM 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 4:43"/>Wɔkan wɔn mmarima a wɔadi mfeɛ aduasa kɔsi aduonum a wɔfata sɛ wɔyɛ adwuma wɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no mu. <verse eid="NUM 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 4:44"/>Wɔn nyinaa dodoɔ yɛɛ mpem mmiɛnsa ne ahanu. <verse eid="NUM 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 4:45"/>Enti Merarifoɔ a wɔfata sɛ wɔsom wɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no mu no nyinaa dodoɔ ne no. Mose ne Aaron na wɔkan wɔn sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ Mose no.<verse eid="NUM 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 4:46"/>Enti Mose ne Aaron ne Israel mpanimfoɔ nam Lewifoɔ no mmusua ne wɔn afie so kan wɔn nyinaa. <verse eid="NUM 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 4:47"/>Mmarima a na wɔadi firi mfeɛ aduasa kɔsi mfeɛ aduonum no nyinaa a na wɔfata sɛ wɔyɛ adwuma wɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no mu hɔ no ne wɔn a wɔbɛsoa akɔ no <verse eid="NUM 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 4:48"/>dodoɔ yɛ mpem aha nwɔtwe ahanum ne aduɔwɔtwe.<verse eid="NUM 4:48"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 4:49"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛ a ɔhyɛɛ Mose no enti na wɔnam so kanee nnipa no.<verse eid="NUM 4:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NUM 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Israelfoɔ Atenaeɛ Kronkronyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 5:1"/>Yei ne mmara a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sane hyɛ maa Mose: <verse eid="NUM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 5:2"/>“Ka kyerɛ Israelfoɔ no sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔpam akwatafoɔ nyinaa firi atenaeɛ hɔ. Wɔn a ekuro atutu wɔn ne wɔn a wɔde wɔn nsa akɔka efunu enti wɔn ho agu fi nyinaa no, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔpam wɔn. <verse eid="NUM 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 5:3"/>Mmarima ne mmaa nyinaa ka ho. Yi wɔn nyinaa firi hɔ sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ na atenaeɛ hɔ a me ne mo bɛtena no ho rengu fi”. <verse eid="NUM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 5:4"/>Wɔdii <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mmara no so.<verse eid="NUM 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 5:5"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 5:6"/>“Ka kyerɛ Israelfoɔ no sɛ, sɛ ɔbarima o, ɔbaa o, ɔdi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hwammɔ a, ɛyɛ bɔne. <verse eid="NUM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 5:7"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ ɔka ne bɔne na adeɛ a ɔwiaeɛ no, ɔtua ho ka nyinaa na ɔsane de ɛho ka no nkyɛmu ɔha mu aduonu ka ho de ma onipa ko a ɔbɔɔ no korɔno no. <verse eid="NUM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 5:8"/>Na sɛ onipa ko a ɔyɛɛ no bɔne no awu na ɔnni obusuani biara a ɔbɛn no a wɔbɛtua ho ka ama no no a, ɛsɛ sɛ, sɛ ɔtua ka no ma ɔsɔfoɔ a, odwennini ka ho sɛ mpatadeɛ. Ɛyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> dea. <verse eid="NUM 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 5:9"/>Akyɛdeɛ kronkron a Israelfoɔ de bɛkyɛ ɔsɔfoɔ no yɛ ne dea. <verse eid="NUM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 5:10"/>Ɔsɔfoɔ biara bɛfa akyɛdeɛ kronkron biara a ne nsa bɛka.”<verse eid="NUM 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 5:11"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 5:12"/>“Ka kyerɛ Israelfoɔ no sɛ, sɛ ɔbarima bi yere kɔbɔ adwaman <verse eid="NUM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 5:13"/>nanso ɔnhunu asɛm no mu nokorɛ na ɔnnya ɔdanseni <verse eid="NUM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 5:14"/>na ɔtwe ho ninkunu na ɔnte ne ho ase a, <verse eid="NUM 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 5:15"/>ɔbarima no de ne yere no bɛkɔ ɔsɔfoɔ anim a ɔbaa no ho afɔrebɔdeɛ a ɛyɛ atokosiam a wɔmfaa ohwam ngo mfraeɛ lita mmienu ka ho. Ɛfiri sɛ, ɛyɛ ninkuntwe afɔrebɔ. Ɛno na ɛbɛma nokorɛ ada adie ama wɔahunu sɛ ɔbaa no di fɔ anaa ɔdi bem.<verse eid="NUM 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 5:16"/>“Ɔsɔfoɔ no de ɔbaa no bɛba <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim, <verse eid="NUM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 5:17"/>na wasa Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no mu mfuturo de afra nsuo kronkron<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nsuo kronkron ne mfuturo a wɔde afra no kyerɛ atɛntenenee a wɔbɛbu nnebɔneyɛfoɔ no.</char></note> a ɛgu asansuo kɛseɛ bi mu no. <verse eid="NUM 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 5:18"/>Ɔbɛsane ne ti a wakyekyere no na ɔde ninkunu afɔrebɔdeɛ no agu ne nsam de ahwɛ sɛ ɔbarima no nsusuiɛ no yɛ nokorɛ ampa ara anaasɛ ɛnyɛ nokorɛ. Ɔsɔfoɔ no bɛgyina nʼanim a ɔkura nsuo nwononwono a ɛde mmusuo ba no. <verse eid="NUM 5:18"/><verse number="19-22" style="v" sid="NUM 5:19-22"/>Ɔbɛma no aka ntam sɛ ɔnnim asɛm no ho hwee na waka akyerɛ no sɛ, sɛ wo ne ɔbarima biara nnaeɛ ka wo kunu nko ara ho deɛ a, ɛnneɛ, wo ho nte mfiri nsuo nwononwono a ɛde mmusuo ba yi ho. Na sɛ woabɔ adwaman a, ɛnneɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛdome wo wɔ wo nkurɔfoɔ mu. Ɔbɛma wo srɛ aporɔ na wo yafunu ahono. Na ɔbaa no bɛka sɛ, ‘Aane, saa na ɛsɛ sɛ ɛba.’<verse eid="NUM 5:19-22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 5:23"/>“Ɔsɔfoɔ no bɛtwerɛ nnome yi nyinaa agu nwoma bi mu na wahohoro agu nsuo nwononwono no mu. <verse eid="NUM 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 5:24"/>Sɛ ɛsɛ sɛ ɔbaa no nom nsuo no na sɛ ɔnom wɔ ɛberɛ a wayɛ bɔne a, ɛyɛ nwononwononwono wɔ ne mu. <verse eid="NUM 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 5:25"/>Afei, ɔsɔfoɔ no bɛgye ninkunu afɔrebɔdeɛ no afiri ɔbaa no nsam na wahinhim no <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim na ɔde akɔ afɔrebukyia no so. <verse eid="NUM 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 5:26"/>Ɔbɛsa ne nsabuo ma de asi ne nyinaa anan na wahye no wɔ afɔrebukyia no so na wama ɔbaa no anom nsuo no. <verse eid="NUM 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 5:27"/>Sɛ ne ho agu fi na wabɔ adwaman no atia ne kunu a, nsuo a wanom no bɛyɛ nwononwononwono wɔ ne mu na ne yafunu ahono na ne srɛ aporɔ na wayɛ nnome wɔ ne nkurɔfoɔ mu. <verse eid="NUM 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 5:28"/>Sɛ ɔyɛ kronn a ɔmmɔɔ adwaman a, wɔrenha no, na ɛrenkyɛre, ɔbɛnyinsɛn.<verse eid="NUM 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 5:29"/>“Yei ne mmara a ɛfa ɔbaa a ne bra nyɛ na ne kunu twe ne ho ninkunu <verse eid="NUM 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 5:30"/>de hwehwɛ mu hunu sɛ ɔdi ne kunu nokorɛ anaa ɔnni no nokorɛ no ho. Ɔde no bɛba <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim na ɔsɔfoɔ no adi dwuma a wɔabobɔ so no nyinaa. <verse eid="NUM 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 5:31"/>Wɔrenni ne kunu no asɛm wɔ baabiara sɛ wama yare bɔne bi aba ne yere so, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛyɛ ɔno ara na ɔma ɛbaa saa.”<verse eid="NUM 5:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NUM 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Ahotuafoɔ Mmara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 6:1"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sane ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ <verse eid="NUM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 6:2"/>ɔnka nkyerɛ Israelfoɔ no sɛ, “Sɛ ɔbarima anaa ɔbaa kɔyɛ Nasareni de te ne ho wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim a, <verse eid="NUM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 6:3"/>ɛno akyi, saa ɛberɛ a ɔwɔ ahoteɛ no mu no, ɔnni ho kwan sɛ ɔnom nsã a ɛyɛ den anaa bobesa anaa nsã a emu ka. <verse eid="NUM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 6:4"/>Saa ɛberɛ no mu no, ɔnni ho kwan sɛ ɔdi biribiara a ɛfiri bobe mu, sɛ ɛyɛ nʼaba anaa ne hono.<verse eid="NUM 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 6:5"/>“Saa ɛberɛ no mu no, ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔyi ne tirinwi, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔyɛ kronkron na wɔate ne ho ama <char style="nd">Awurade</char>; ɛno enti na ɛsɛ sɛ ɔma ne tirinwi fu no.<verse eid="NUM 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 6:6"/>“<char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɔhyɛ no nna no mu no, ɔnni ho kwan sɛ ɔkɔ owufoɔ ho. <verse eid="NUM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 6:7"/>Sɛ owufoɔ no yɛ nʼagya, ne maame, ne nuabarima anaa ne nuabaa koraa a, ɔnnkɔ ne ho, ɛfiri sɛ, ne bɔ a ɔhyɛ de tee ne ho no, ɔda so hyɛ aseɛ, <verse eid="NUM 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 6:8"/>na saa ɛberɛ no mu nyinaa, wɔate ne ho ama <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.<verse eid="NUM 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 6:9"/>“Sɛ obi wu tɔ ne nkyɛn de gu ne ho fi a, nnanson akyi, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔyi ne tirinwi a ɛho agu fi no. Afei, wɔbɛdwira ne ho afiri efi a owufoɔ no de aka no no. <verse eid="NUM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 6:10"/>Nʼadekyeeɛ a ɛyɛ ɛda a ɛtɔ so nwɔtwe no, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔde nturukuku mmienu anaa mmorɔnoma mma mmienu brɛ ɔsɔfoɔ wɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no kwan ano. <verse eid="NUM 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 6:11"/>Ɔsɔfoɔ no de nnomaa no mu baako bɛbɔ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ na ɔde ɔbaako abɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ, na ayɛ mpatadeɛ ama deɛ ne ho agu fi no. Na ɛda no ara, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔti ne bɔhyɛ mu na ɔsane ma ne tirinwi no fu bio. <verse eid="NUM 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 6:12"/>Nna dodoɔ a ɔdii ne bɔhyɛ a ɛdi ɛkan no so no nyinaa ahye agu. Ɔbɛhyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɔ foforɔ de afiri aseɛ, na ɔde odwennini ba a wadi afe bɛba abɛbɔ ɛfɔdie ho afɔdeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 6:13"/>“Ɛda a ne bɔhyɛ a ɛte ɔno ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ntam no wie duru no, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔkɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no ano <verse eid="NUM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 6:14"/>kɔbɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. Ɔde odwan ba a wadi afe a ɔnnii dɛm na ɛbɛbɔ saa afɔdeɛ no. Ɛsɛ sɛ ɔde odwanbereɛ a wadi afe a ɔnnii dɛm bɔ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ na ɔde odwennini a ɔnnii dɛm bɔ asomdwoeɛ afɔdeɛ. <verse eid="NUM 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 6:15"/>Nneɛma a ɔde bɛka ho no ne burodo a mmɔreka mfra mu, asikyiresiam taterɛ a wɔde ngo afra; burodo ntrawa bi a mmɔreka mfra mu a wɔde ngo ayɛ so a aduane ne nsã afɔrebɔdeɛ ka ho.<verse eid="NUM 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 6:16"/>“Ɔsɔfoɔ no de saa afɔrebɔdeɛ yi nyinaa bɛba <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim. Deɛ ɔde bɛdi ɛkan aba no yɛ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ ne ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ, <verse eid="NUM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 6:17"/>afei, odwennini a wɔde no bɛbɔ asomdwoeɛ afɔdeɛ a burodo kɛntɛnma a mmɔreka nni mu nso ka ho. Na deɛ ɛtwa toɔ a ɔde bɛba no ne aduane ne nsã afɔdeɛ a ɔde bɛma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.<verse eid="NUM 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 6:18"/>“Afei, ɔhotuafo no bɛyi ne tirinwi a afu kuhaa no; ɛno ne nsɛnkyerɛnnedeɛ a ɛkyerɛ sɛ, ɔnhyɛ bɔhyɛ no ase bio. Wɔbɛyɛ yei wɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no ano, na wɔde nwi no agu asomdwoeɛ afɔdeɛ a wɔrebɔ no wɔ ogya mu no ahye no.<verse eid="NUM 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 6:19"/>“Wɔayi ɔbarima no tirinwi no awie no, ɔsɔfoɔ no de odwennini no basa a wɔatoto, taterɛ a mmɔreka nni mu no baako ne burodo ntrawa a mmɔreka nni mu bɛhyɛ ɔbarima no nsam. <verse eid="NUM 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 6:20"/>Ɔsɔfoɔ no bɛhim no akɔ nʼanim aba nʼakyi wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim a ɛkyerɛ ma a ɔde rema <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. Ne nyinaa yɛ kyɛfa a ɛho te ma ɔsɔfoɔ no. Wɔbɛyɛ no sɛdeɛ wɔyɛ odwennini no basa mu mfempadeɛ a wɔhim no wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim no. Yei akyi no, ɔhotuafoɔ no tumi nom bobesa a ɛkyerɛ sɛ, wɔayi no afiri ne bɔhyɛ no mu.<verse eid="NUM 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 6:21"/>“Yeinom ne mmara a ɛda hɔ ma Nasareni a wahyɛ nʼahofama ho bɔ awie, na ɔde afɔrebɔ ahodoɔ brɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. Saa afɔrebɔ yi akyi no, ɔtumi de afɔrebɔdeɛ biara a ɔrebɛyɛ Nasareni no, ɔhyɛɛ ho bɔ sɛ ɔde bɛba no ba.”<verse eid="NUM 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 6:22"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 6:23"/>“Ka kyerɛ Aaron ne ne mmammarima no sɛ ɛsɛ sɛ wɔhyira Israelfoɔ yi sononko sɛ:<verse eid="NUM 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 6:24"/>“ ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> nhyira mo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 6:24">na ɔnhwɛ mo so.<verse eid="NUM 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 6:25"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nte nʼanim nkyerɛ mo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 6:25">na ɔnnom mo.<verse eid="NUM 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 6:26"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mma nʼani so nhwɛ mo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 6:26">na ɔmma mo asomdwoeɛ.’<verse eid="NUM 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 6:27"/>“Saa na ɛsɛ sɛ Aaron ne ne mmammarima hyira Israelfoɔ, na mʼankasa nso mɛhyira wɔn.”<verse eid="NUM 6:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NUM 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 7:1"/>Ɛda a Mose wiee Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no hyehyɛ no, ɔsraa ho nyinaa ngo, tee ho nyinaa a afɔrebukyia no ne ɛho nneɛma nyinaa ka ho. <verse eid="NUM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 7:2"/>Afei, Israel mpanimfoɔ ne mmusuakuo no mu mpanin a wɔhwɛɛ nnipakan no so no nyinaa de wɔn afɔrebɔdeɛ baeɛ. <verse eid="NUM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 7:3"/>Wɔde nteaseɛnam nsia a wɔakatakata ho ne anantwie dumienu na wɔde baeɛ. Na nteaseɛnam no baako biara yɛ mpanimfoɔ mmienu dea, a nantwie baako yɛ wɔn mu biara dea. Wɔde ne nyinaa maa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no anim.<verse eid="NUM 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 7:4"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 7:5"/>“Gye wɔn akyɛdeɛ no na fa nteaseɛnam no yɛ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no ho adwuma. Fa ma Lewifoɔ no na wɔmfa nni dwuma biara a ɛho hia wɔn.”<verse eid="NUM 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 7:6"/>Enti Mose de nteaseɛnam no ne anantwie no maa Lewifoɔ no. <verse eid="NUM 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 7:7"/>Ɔmaa Gerson ne ne nkurɔfoɔ nteaseɛnam mmienu ne anantwie ɛnan <verse eid="NUM 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 7:8"/>ɛnna ɔmaa Merari ne ne nkurɔfoɔ nso nteaseɛnam ɛnan ne anantwie nwɔtwe a Aaron babarima Itamar na na ɔdi so panin. <verse eid="NUM 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 7:9"/>Wɔamma Kohat nkurɔfoɔ nteaseɛnam no bi, ɛfiri sɛ, na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔsoa wɔn kyɛfa a ɛfa Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no ho nneɛma no ho no wɔ wɔn mmatire.<verse eid="NUM 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 7:10"/>Ɛda no, mpanimfoɔ a wɔdi anim no nso de atenaseɛbɔ akyɛdeɛ bɛguu afɔrebukyia no anim da a wɔresra afɔrebukyia no ngo no. <verse eid="NUM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 7:11"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, “Kyekyɛ nna a obiara de nʼatenasebɔdeɛ bɛba afɔrebukyia no so.”<verse eid="NUM 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 7:12"/>Aminadab babarima Nahson a ɔfiri Yuda abusuakuo mu na ɔde nʼatenasebɔdeɛ baa ɛda a ɛdi ɛkan no.<verse eid="NUM 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 7:13"/>Nneɛma a ɔde baeɛ no yɛ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 7:13">dwetɛ prɛte baako a emu duru yɛ kilogram baako ne fa, dwetɛ kyɛnsee bi a ɛbɛyɛ kilogram baako a ne nyinaa na wɔde asikyiresiam muhumuhu a wɔde ngo afra ahyɛ no ma ma.<verse eid="NUM 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 7:14"/>Afei, ɔde sikakɔkɔɔ adaka ketewa bi a ɛkari gram ɔha ne dunan (114) a wɔde aduhwam ahyɛ no ma baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 7:15"/>Ɔde nantwinini ba, odwennini ne odwammaa a wadi afe baeɛ sɛ ɔhyeɛ afɔrebɔdeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 7:16"/>Wɔde abirekyie baeɛ sɛ bɔne ho afɔrebɔdeɛ<verse eid="NUM 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 7:17"/>na asomdwoeɛ afɔrebɔdeɛ no deɛ, anantwie mmienu, nnwennini enum, mmirekyie enum ne nnwammaa enum a wɔadi afe na wɔde wɔn baeɛ.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 7:17">Yei ne afɔdeɛ a Nahson babarima Aminadab de baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 7:18"/>Ɛda a ɛtɔ so mmienu no, Suar babarima Netanel a ɔda Isakar abusuakuo ano no de nʼafɔrebɔdeɛ baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 7:19"/>Na nʼafɔrebɔdeɛ no yɛ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 7:19">dwetɛ prɛte a ɛyɛ kilogram baako ne fa ne dwetɛ kyɛnsee a emu duru yɛ kilogram baako a wɔde atokoɔ afɔrebɔdeɛ a ɛyɛ asikyiresiam muhumuhu a wɔde ngo afra ahyehyɛ no ma ma.<verse eid="NUM 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 7:20"/>Ɔde sikakɔkɔɔ akoradeɛ bi a ɛkari gram ɔha ne dunan (114) a wɔde aduhwam ahyɛ no ma nso baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 7:21"/>Ɔde nantwie ba, odwennini ne odwammaa a wadi afe baeɛ sɛ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ,<verse eid="NUM 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 7:22"/>ɔpapo sɛ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ<verse eid="NUM 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 7:23"/>ne anantwie mmienu, nnwennini enum, mpapo enum ne nnwammaa enum a wɔn mu biara adi afe sɛ asomdwoeɛ afɔdeɛ.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 7:23">Yei ne afɔdeɛ a Suar babarima Netanel de baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 7:24"/>Ne nnansa so no, Helon babarima Eliab a ɔda Sebulon abusuakuo ano no de nʼafɔrebɔdeɛ baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 7:25"/>Na nʼafɔrebɔdeɛ no yɛ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 7:25">dwetɛ prɛte a ɛyɛ kilogram baako ne fa ne dwetɛ kyɛnsee a emu duru yɛ kilogram baako. Na wɔde atokoɔ afɔrebɔdeɛ a ɛyɛ asikyiresiam a wɔayam no muhumuhu a wɔde ngo afra ahyɛ no ma ma.<verse eid="NUM 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 7:26"/>Ɔde sikakɔkɔɔ akoradeɛ a emu duru yɛ gram ɔha ne dunan (114) a wɔde aduhwam ahyɛ ma nso baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 7:27"/>Ɔde nantwie ba, odwennini ne odwammaa a wadi afe baeɛ sɛ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ,<verse eid="NUM 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 7:28"/>ɔpapo sɛ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ;<verse eid="NUM 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 7:29"/>ne anantwie mmienu, nnwennini enum ne mmirekyinini enum sɛ asomdwoeɛ afɔdeɛ.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 7:29">Yei ne afɔdeɛ a Helon babarima Eliab de baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 7:30"/>Ne nnanan so no, Sedeur babarima Elisur a ɔda Ruben abusuakuo ano no de nʼafɔrebɔdeɛ baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 7:31"/>Na nʼafɔrebɔdeɛ no yɛ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 7:31">dwetɛ prɛte a ɛyɛ kilogram baako ne fa ne dwetɛ kyɛnsee a emu duru yɛ kilogram baako a wɔde afɔrebɔdeɛ a ɛyɛ asikyiresiam a wɔayam no muhumuhu a wɔde ngo afra ahyɛ no ma ma.<verse eid="NUM 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 7:32"/>Afei, ɔde sikakɔkɔɔ akoradeɛ a emu duru yɛ gram ɔha ne dunan (114) a wɔde aduhwam ahyɛ no ma nso baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 7:33"/>Ɔde nantwie ba, odwennini ne odwammaanini a wadi afe baeɛ sɛ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ,<verse eid="NUM 7:33"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 7:34"/>ɔpapo sɛ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ;<verse eid="NUM 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 7:35"/>ne anantwie mmienu, nnwennini enum, mpapo enum ne nnwammaa enum a wɔn mu biara adi afe.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 7:35">Yei ne afɔdeɛ a Sedeur babarima Elisur de baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 7:36"/>Ne nnanum so no, Surisadai babarima Selumiel a ɔda Simeon abusuakuo ano no de nʼafɔrebɔdeɛ baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 7:37"/>Na nʼafɔrebɔdeɛ no yɛ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 7:37">dwetɛ prɛte a ɛyɛ kilogram baako ne fa ne dwetɛ kyɛnsee a emu duru yɛ kilogram baako na wɔde atokoɔ afɔrebɔdeɛ a ɛyɛ asikyiresiam a wɔayam no muhumuhu a wɔde ngo afra ahyɛ no ma ma.<verse eid="NUM 7:37"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 7:38"/>Afei, ɔde sikakɔkɔɔ akoradeɛ a emu duru bɛyɛ gram ɔha ne dunan (114) a wɔde aduhwam ahyɛ no ma nso baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 7:39"/>Ɔde nantwie ba, odwennini ne odwammaanini a wɔadi afe baeɛ sɛ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ,<verse eid="NUM 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 7:40"/>ɔpapo sɛ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ,<verse eid="NUM 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 7:41"/>ne anantwie mmienu, nnwennini enum, mmirekyinini enum ne nnwammaa enum a wɔn mu biara adi afe sɛ asomdwoeɛ afɔdeɛ.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 7:41">Yei ne afɔdeɛ a Surisadai ba Selumiel de baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:41"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 7:42"/>Ne nna nsia so no, Deguel babarima Eliasaf a ɔda Gad abusuakuo ano no de nʼafɔrebɔdeɛ baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 7:43"/>Na nʼafɔrebɔdeɛ no yɛ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 7:43">dwetɛ prɛte a ɛyɛ kilogram baako ne fa ne dwetɛ kyɛnsee a emu duru yɛ kilogram baako. Na wɔde atokoɔ afɔrebɔdeɛ a ɛyɛ asikyiresiam muhumuhu a wɔde ngo afra ahyehyɛ no ma ma.<verse eid="NUM 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 7:44"/>Ɔde sikakɔkɔɔ akoradeɛ bi a ɛkari gram ɔha ne dunan (114) wɔde aduhwam ahyɛ no ma nso baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 7:45"/>Ɔde nantwie ba, odwennini ne odwammaa a wadi afe baeɛ sɛ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ,<verse eid="NUM 7:45"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 7:46"/>ɔpapo sɛ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ;<verse eid="NUM 7:46"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 7:47"/>ne nantwie mmienu, nnwennini enum, mpapo enum ne nnwammaa enum a wɔn mu biara adi afe sɛ asomdwoeɛ afɔdeɛ.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 7:47">Yei ne afɔdeɛ a Deguel ba Eliasaf de baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 7:48"/>Ne nnanson so no, Amihud babarima Elisama a ɔda Efraim abusuakuo ano no de nʼafɔrebɔdeɛ baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 7:49"/>Na nʼafɔrebɔdeɛ no yɛ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 7:49">dwetɛ prɛte a ɛyɛ kilogram baako ne fa ne dwetɛ kyɛnsee a emu duru yɛ kilogram baako. Na wɔde atokoɔ afɔrebɔdeɛ a ɛyɛ asikyiresiam muhumuhu a wɔde ngo afra ahyehyɛ no ma ma.<verse eid="NUM 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 7:50"/>Ɔde sikakɔkɔɔ akoradeɛ bi a ɛkari gram ɔha ne dunan (114) a wɔde aduhwam ahyɛ no ma nso baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:50"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 7:51"/>Ɔde nantwie ba, odwennini ne odwammaa a wadi afe baeɛ sɛ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ;<verse eid="NUM 7:51"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 7:52"/>ɔpapo sɛ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ;<verse eid="NUM 7:52"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 7:53"/>ne nantwie mmienu, nnwennini enum, mpapo enum ne nnwammaa enum a wɔn mu biara adi afe sɛ asomdwoeɛ afɔdeɛ.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 7:53">Yei ne afɔdeɛ a Amihud babarima Elisama de baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:53"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 7:54"/>Ne nnawɔtwe so no, Pedahsur babarima Gamaliel a ɔda Manase abusuakuo ano no de nʼafɔrebɔdeɛ baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:54"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 7:55"/>Na nʼafɔrebɔdeɛ no yɛ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 7:55">dwetɛ prɛte a ɛyɛ kilogram baako ne fa ne dwetɛ kyɛnsee a emu duru yɛ kilogram baako. Na wɔde atokoɔ afɔrebɔdeɛ a ɛyɛ asikyiresiam muhumuhu a wɔde ngo afra ahyehyɛ no ma ma.<verse eid="NUM 7:55"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 7:56"/>Ɔde sikakɔkɔɔ akoradeɛ bi a ɛkari gram ɔha ne dunan (114) a wɔde aduhwam ahyɛ no ma nso baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:56"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 7:57"/>Ɔde nantwie ba, odwennini ne odwammaa a wadi afe baeɛ sɛ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ,<verse eid="NUM 7:57"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 7:58"/>ɔpapo sɛ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ;<verse eid="NUM 7:58"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 7:59"/>ne nantwie mmienu, nnwennini enum, mpɔnkyenini enum ne nnwammaa enum a wɔn mu biara adi afe sɛ asomdwoeɛ afɔdeɛ.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 7:59">Yei ne afɔdeɛ a Pedahsur ba Gamaliel de baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:59"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 7:60"/>Ne nna nkron so no, Gideoni babarima Abidan a ɔda Benyamin abusuakuo ano no de nʼafɔrebɔdeɛ baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:60"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 7:61"/>Na nʼafɔrebɔdeɛ no yɛ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 7:61">dwetɛ prɛte a ɛyɛ kilogram baako ne fa ne dwetɛ kyɛnsee a emu duru yɛ kilogram baako. Na wɔde atokoɔ afɔrebɔdeɛ a ɛyɛ asikyiresiam muhumuhu a wɔde ngo afra ahyehyɛ no ma ma.<verse eid="NUM 7:61"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 7:62"/>Ɔde sikakɔkɔɔ akoradeɛ bi a ɛkari gram ɔha ne dunan (114) a wɔde aduhwam ahyɛ no ma nso baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:62"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 7:63"/>Ɔde nantwie ba, odwennini ne odwammaa a wadi afe baeɛ sɛ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ,<verse eid="NUM 7:63"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 7:64"/>ɔpapo sɛ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ<verse eid="NUM 7:64"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 7:65"/>ne anantwie mmienu, nnwennini enum, mpapo enum ne nnwammaa enum a wɔn mu biara adi afe sɛ asomdwoeɛ afɔdeɛ.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 7:65">Yei ne afɔdeɛ a Gideoni babarima Abidan de baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:65"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NUM 7:66"/>Ne dadu so no, Amisadai babarima Ahieser a ɔda Dan abusuakuo ano no de nʼafɔrebɔdeɛ baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:66"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="NUM 7:67"/>Na nʼafɔrebɔdeɛ no yɛ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 7:67">dwetɛ prɛte a ɛyɛ kilogram baako ne fa ne dwetɛ kyɛnsee a emu duru yɛ kilogram baako. Na wɔde atokoɔ afɔrebɔdeɛ a ɛyɛ asikyiresiam a wɔayam no muhumuhu a wɔde ngo afra ahyehyɛ no ma ma.<verse eid="NUM 7:67"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="NUM 7:68"/>Afei, ɔde sikakɔkɔɔ akoradeɛ a ɛkari gram ɔha ne dunan (114) a wɔde aduhwam ahyɛ no ma nso baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:68"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="NUM 7:69"/>Ɔde nantwie ba, odwennini ne odwammaanini a wadi afe baeɛ sɛ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ,<verse eid="NUM 7:69"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="NUM 7:70"/>ɔpapo sɛ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ;<verse eid="NUM 7:70"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="NUM 7:71"/>ne anantwie mmienu, nnwennini enum, mmirekyinini enum ne nnwammaa enum a wɔn mu biara adi afe sɛ asomdwoeɛ afɔdeɛ.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 7:71">Yei ne afɔdeɛ a Amisadai babarima Ahieser de baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:71"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="NUM 7:72"/>Ne dadu da baako so no, Okran babarima Pagiel a ɔda Aser abusuakuo ano no de nʼafɔrebɔdeɛ baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:72"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="NUM 7:73"/>Na nʼafɔrebɔdeɛ no yɛ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 7:73">dwetɛ prɛte a ɛyɛ kilogram baako ne fa ne dwetɛ kyɛnsee a emu duru yɛ kilogram baako. Na wɔde atokoɔ afɔrebɔdeɛ a ɛyɛ asikyiresiam a wɔayam no muhumuhu a wɔde ngo afra ahyehyɛ no ma ma.<verse eid="NUM 7:73"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="NUM 7:74"/>Afei, ɔde sikakɔkɔɔ akoradeɛ a ɛkari gram ɔha ne dunan (114) a wɔde aduhwam ahyɛ no ma nso baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:74"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="NUM 7:75"/>Ɔde nantwie ba, odwennini ne odwammaanini a wadi afe baeɛ sɛ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ;<verse eid="NUM 7:75"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="NUM 7:76"/>ɔpapo sɛ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ;<verse eid="NUM 7:76"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="NUM 7:77"/>ne anantwie mmienu, nnwennini enum, mmirekyinini enum ne nnwammaa enum a wɔn mu biara adi afe sɛ asomdwoeɛ afɔdeɛ.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 7:77">Yei ne afɔdeɛ a Okran babarima Pagiel de baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:77"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="NUM 7:78"/>Ne dadu nna mmienu so no, Enan babarima Ahira a ɔda Naftali abusuakuo ano no de nʼafɔrebɔdeɛ baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:78"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="NUM 7:79"/>Na nʼafɔrebɔdeɛ no yɛ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 7:79">dwetɛ prɛte a ɛyɛ kilogram baako ne fa ne dwetɛ kyɛnsee a emu duru yɛ kilogram baako. Na wɔde atokoɔ afɔrebɔdeɛ a ɛyɛ asikyiresiam a wɔayam no muhumuhu a wɔde ngo afra ahyehyɛ no ma ma.<verse eid="NUM 7:79"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="NUM 7:80"/>Afei, ɔde sikakɔkɔɔ akoradeɛ a ɛkari gram ɔha ne dunan (114) a wɔde aduhwam ahyɛ no ma nso baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:80"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="81" style="v" sid="NUM 7:81"/>Ɔde nantwie ba, odwennini ne odwammaanini a wadi afe baeɛ sɛ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ;<verse eid="NUM 7:81"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="82" style="v" sid="NUM 7:82"/>ɔpapo sɛ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ;<verse eid="NUM 7:82"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="83" style="v" sid="NUM 7:83"/>ne anantwie mmienu, nnwennini enum, mpapo enum ne nnwammaa enum a wɔn mu biara adi afe sɛ asomdwoeɛ afɔdeɛ.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 7:83">Yei ne afɔdeɛ a Enan babarima Ahira de baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:83"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="NUM 7:84"/>Enti, yei ne afɔrebukyia no afɔrebɔdeɛ a Israel mpanimfoɔ de ba bɛsraa afɔrebukyia no nam so bɔɔ no atenaseɛ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 7:84">dwetɛ mprɛte dumienu, dwetɛ hweaseammɔ dumienu ne sikakɔkɔɔ aduhwam akoradeɛ dumienu. <verse eid="NUM 7:84"/><verse number="85" style="v" sid="NUM 7:85"/>Ne nyinaa mu, na dwetɛ nneɛma no nyinaa kari bɛyɛ kilogram aduasa. Na prɛte biara kari kilogram baako ne fa, na dwetɛ kyɛnsee no nso kari kilogram baako. <verse eid="NUM 7:85"/><verse number="86" style="v" sid="NUM 7:86"/>Sikakɔkɔɔ a wɔde bɛkyɛeɛ no mu duru yɛɛ bɛyɛ kilogram baako ne fa a ɛkyerɛ sɛ, sikakɔkɔɔ no akoradeɛ no mu biara duru yɛ nnwetɛbena edu a wɔde aduhwam ahyɛ no ma.<verse eid="NUM 7:86"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="87" style="v" sid="NUM 7:87"/>Wɔde anantwie dumienu ne nnwennini a wɔn mu biara adi afe na wɔde bɛbɔɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ no a atokoɔ afɔrebɔ nso ka ho. Wɔde mpapo bɛbɔɔ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:87"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="88" style="v" sid="NUM 7:88"/>Asomdwoeɛ afɔdeɛ nneɛma a wɔde baeɛ nie: anantwinini mma aduonu ɛnan, nnwennini aduosia, mmirekyie aduosia, nnwammaanini a wɔn mu biara adi afe aduosia.<verse eid="NUM 7:88"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="NUM 7:89"/>Ɛberɛ a Mose kɔɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no mu sɛ ɔne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> rekɔkasa no, ɔtee nne bi firi soro a ɛrekasa kyerɛ no firi Mpata Beaeɛ no atifi hɔ, wɔ adaka no ho baabi a Kerubim mmienu no sisi no ntam.<verse eid="NUM 7:89"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NUM 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 8:1"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 8:2"/>“Ka kyerɛ Aaron sɛ, sɛ ɔsɔ nkanea nson a ɛwɔ kaneadua no so no a, ɔnsɔ no sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, ɛbɛto ne hann no akɔ nʼanim.”<verse eid="NUM 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 8:3"/>Enti, Aaron yɛɛ saa. <verse eid="NUM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 8:4"/>Kaneadua no ne nhwiren a wɔde asiesie nʼase ne ne mman no nyinaa, sikakɔkɔɔ a wɔaboro na wɔde yɛeɛ. Wɔyɛɛ no sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ wɔnyɛ no no.<verse eid="NUM 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 8:5"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 8:6"/>“Yi Lewifoɔ no firi Israelfoɔ no mu na te wɔn ho. <verse eid="NUM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 8:7"/>Fa ahodwira nsuo pete wɔn so. Ma wɔnyi wɔn ho nwi nyinaa, na wɔnsi wɔn nneɛma nyinaa, afei wɔn ho bɛte. <verse eid="NUM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 8:8"/>Afei, ma wɔmfa nantwinini ba ne aduane afɔrebɔdeɛ a ɛyɛ asikyiresiam a wɔayam no muhumuhu a wɔde ngo afra a nantwinini ba baako ka ho a wɔde no bɛbɔ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ mmra. <verse eid="NUM 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 8:9"/>Afei, frɛ Israelfoɔ no nyinaa hyia na fa Lewifoɔ no bra Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no ɛpono ano. <verse eid="NUM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 8:10"/>Ɛhɔ, wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim, mpanimfoɔ a wɔtuatua mmusuakuo no ano no de wɔn nsa bɛgu wɔn so <verse eid="NUM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 8:11"/>na Aaron ayɛ nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ bi sɛ ɔde wɔn rema <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛ akyɛdeɛ a ɛfiri Israel manfoɔ nyinaa nkyɛn. Lewifoɔ bɛsi nnipa no nyinaa anan asom <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.<verse eid="NUM 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 8:12"/>“Afei, Lewifoɔ mpanimfoɔ no de wɔn nsa bɛgu nantwie mma no apampam na wɔde wɔn ama <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. Wɔde baako bɛbɔ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ na wɔde baako nso abɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ de ayɛ mpatadeɛ ama Lewifoɔ no. <verse eid="NUM 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 8:13"/>Afei, wɔde Lewifoɔ no bɛma Aaron ne ne mma te sɛ deɛ wɔde afɔrebɔdeɛ biara fa asɔfoɔ so de ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no. <verse eid="NUM 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 8:14"/>Monam saa ɛkwan yi so bɛyi Lewifoɔ no afiri Israelfoɔ no mu ama me, na wɔayɛ me dea.<verse eid="NUM 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 8:15"/>“Sɛ mote wɔn ho na mofa saa ɛkwan yi so de wɔn ma me a, afei, wɔbɛdi ahyɛnfirie wɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no mu, adi wɔn dwuma. <verse eid="NUM 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 8:16"/>Israelfoɔ mu nyinaa, wɔn na wɔyɛ me nkurɔfoɔ, na magye wɔn atom asi Israelfoɔ mmakan nyinaa anan. Mafa Lewifoɔ no sɛ wɔn ananmusifoɔ. <verse eid="NUM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 8:17"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, Israelfoɔ mmakan nyinaa yɛ me dea—nnipa ne mmoa nyinaa. Anadwo a mekumm Misraimfoɔ mmakan nyinaa no ara na mefaa wɔn de wɔn yɛɛ me nkurɔfoɔ. <verse eid="NUM 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 8:18"/>Mafa Lewifoɔ no asi Israelfoɔ mmakan nyinaa anan mu. <verse eid="NUM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 8:19"/>Na mede Lewifoɔ no bɛkyɛ Aaron ne ne mmammarima. Lewifoɔ no na wɔbɛyɛ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no mu nnwuma kronkron a anka ɛsɛ sɛ Israelfoɔ no na wɔyɛ, na wɔn na wɔbɛbɔ afɔdeɛ ama nkurɔfoɔ de ayɛ mpatadeɛ ama wɔn. Ɔyaredɔm biara renka Israelfoɔ no, nanso sɛ nnipa afoforɔ biara kɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no mu a, wɔbɛyareyare.”<verse eid="NUM 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 8:20"/>Enti, Mose ne Aaron ne Israelfoɔ no nyinaa faa ɛkwan a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kyerɛɛ Mose no so pɛpɛɛpɛ de Lewifoɔ no maa Awurade. <verse eid="NUM 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 8:21"/>Lewifoɔ no dwiraa wɔn ho, sii wɔn nneɛma ɛnna Aaron de wɔn hyɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nsa. Ɔyɛɛ wɔn ho mpatadwuma de tee wɔn ho. <verse eid="NUM 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 8:22"/>Ɛno akyi, wɔkɔɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no mu sɛ Aaron ne ne mmammarima aboafoɔ. Wɔyɛɛ biribiara sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ Mose sɛ wɔnyɛ no.<verse eid="NUM 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 8:23"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 8:24"/>“Sɛ Lewini biara di mfeɛ aduonu enum a, ma no mfiri aseɛ nsom wɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan mu, <verse eid="NUM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 8:25"/>na wɔdi mfeɛ aduonum a, wɔapɔn wɔn ho. <verse eid="NUM 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 8:26"/>Sɛ wɔpɔn wɔn ho a, wɔtumi di dwuma nketenkete wɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan mu hɔ. Wɔrenyɛ nnwuma a daa ɛbɛgye wɔn berɛ.”<verse eid="NUM 8:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NUM 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Twam Afahyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 9:1"/>Bosome a ɛdi ɛkan no mu afe a ɛtɔ so mmienu no mu a wɔafiri Misraim no na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kaa saa asɛm yi kyerɛɛ Mose ɛberɛ a ɔne Israelfoɔ wɔ Sinai ɛserɛ no so no sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 9:2"/>“Ɛsɛ sɛ afe biara mu bosome a ɛdi ɛkan no dadu nna ɛnan no, Israelfoɔ di Twam Afahyɛ no. <verse eid="NUM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 9:3"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔhyɛ afahyɛ no ase owiatɔberɛ. Ɛsɛ sɛ modi mmara biara a ɛfa saa afahyɛ yi die ho so.”<verse eid="NUM 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 9:4"/>Enti Mose kaa sɛ, wɔbɛhyɛ Twam Afahyɛ no die ase ɛda a ɛtɔ so dunan no anwummerɛ <verse eid="NUM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 9:5"/>wɔ Sinai asase pɔ no so sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahyɛ no.<verse eid="NUM 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 9:6"/>Na asɛm a ɛsiiɛ ne sɛ, afei na na nnipa no bi firi ayie aba enti, ɛsiane sɛ wɔde wɔn ho aka owufoɔ enti, na wɔn ho agu fi. Yei enti anadwo no, wɔantumi anwe Twam Afahyɛ dwammaa no bi. Wɔbaa Mose ne Aaron nkyɛn <verse eid="NUM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 9:7"/>bɛkyerɛkyerɛɛ nsɛm a ɛha wɔn mu kyerɛɛ wɔn. Wobisaa sɛ, “Yɛde yɛn ho aka funu, nanso ɛdeɛn enti na yɛne Israelfoɔ nyinaa rentumi mfa yɛn afɔrebɔdeɛ mmrɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛdeɛ nhyehyɛeɛ no teɛ no?”<verse eid="NUM 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 9:8"/>Mose kaa sɛ ɔbɛbisa <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.<verse eid="NUM 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 9:9"/>Ɔbisaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no, mmuaeɛ a ɔnyaeɛ nie: <verse eid="NUM 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 9:10"/>“Israelni biara a ɔbɛsɔ efunu mu, sɛ ɔyɛ nnɛmma anaa ɔfiri awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ a ɛreba no mu no, sɛ ɛyɛ Twam Afahyɛberɛ a, ne ho agu fi, ɛfiri sɛ, wasɔ efunu mu. Sɛ wɔnam akwantuo mu enti wɔantumi amma a, wɔtumi di <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Twam Afahyɛ no bosome akyi; <verse eid="NUM 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 9:11"/>bosome a ɛtɔ so mmienu no ɛda a ɛtɔ so dunan no anwummerɛ na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔhyɛ aseɛ. Saa ɛberɛ no na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔwe odwammaa no a burodo a mmɔreka nni mu ka ho a ahahan nwononwono bi ka ho. <verse eid="NUM 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 9:12"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔgya bi ma adeɛ kye so. Ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔbɔ ne dompe mu. Na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔdi Twam Afahyɛ no mmara no nyinaa so pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="NUM 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 9:13"/>Nanso obiara a ne ho nguu fi anaa obi a ɔntuu kwan no nanso wanni Twam Afahyɛ no wɔ ne berɛ ano no, wɔbɛtwa no asuo afiri Israelfoɔ no mu, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔboa pa sɛ ɔremmɔ afɔdeɛ mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɛberɛ a ɛsɛ mu, enti ɛsɛ sɛ ɛho afɔdie ba ne so.<verse eid="NUM 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 9:14"/>“Sɛ ɔhɔhoɔ bi fra mo mu na ɔpɛ sɛ ɔdi Twam Afahyɛ no bi de hyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> animuonyam a, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔdi mmara korɔ no ara so. Mmara baako na ɛwɔ hɔ ma mo nyinaa.”<verse eid="NUM 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Egyamununkum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 9:15"/>Ɛda a wɔmaa Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no so sii hɔ no, omununkum kataa so. Anwummerɛ no ara, omununkum no dane yɛɛ sɛ ogya na ɛyɛɛ saa ara anadwo mu no nyinaa. <verse eid="NUM 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 9:16"/>Saa ara na ɛte ɛberɛ biara, na ɛduru anadwo a, omununkum no dane yɛ sɛ ogya. <verse eid="NUM 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 9:17"/>Omununkum no maa ne ho so no, Israelfoɔ no dii akyire kɔsii baabiara a ɛkɔ kɔgyinaeɛ ma wɔbɔɔ hɔ atenaeɛ. <verse eid="NUM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 9:18"/>Yei kyerɛ sɛ, sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka sɛ wɔnkɔ a, wɔkɔ, na sɛ ɔka sɛ wɔnnyina a, wɔgyina. Na sɛ Omununkum no gyina a, wɔn nso gyina kɔsi mmerɛ dodoɔ a ɛgyina hɔ no nyinaa. <verse eid="NUM 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 9:19"/>Sɛ ɛgyina baabi kyɛ a, wɔn nso gyina hɔ kyɛ. Na sɛ ɛgyina hɔ nna kakra bi a, wɔn nso gyina hɔ nna kakra bi saa ara, ɛfiri sɛ, saa na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahyɛ wɔn sɛ wɔnyɛ. <verse eid="NUM 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 9:20"/>Ɛtɔ da bi a, omununkum no tena Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no so nna kakraa bi. Sɛ ɛba saa a, nnipa no nso tena nna kakraa bi. Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nhyɛ mu, wɔtu firii wɔn atenaeɛ. <verse eid="NUM 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 9:21"/>Ɛtɔ da bi nso a, omununkum no tena anadwo na akɔ adekyeeɛ. Nanso sɛ ɛyɛ awia anaa anadwo na omununkum no ma ne ho so a, nnipa no tu fi atenaeɛ hɔ di akyi. <verse eid="NUM 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 9:22"/>Sɛ omununkum no ba Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no atifi na ɛdi nnanu, bosome anaa afe a, saa nna no ara so na Israelfoɔ no hwɛ de tena hɔ. Nanso ɛnya tu ara pɛ, na wɔn nso atu. <verse eid="NUM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 9:23"/>Yei kyerɛ sɛ, wɔn atenaseɛbɔ ne wɔn akwantuo nyinaa gyina <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mmara a ɔhyɛ ma wɔn so; na biribiara a Awurade ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ wɔnyɛ no, wɔyɛeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 9:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NUM 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Dwetɛ Ntotorobɛnto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 10:1"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 10:2"/>“Fa dwetɛ a wɔaboro yɛ ntotorobɛnto mmienu na wɔahyɛn de afrɛ nnipa no, na watu ntomadan no akɔ. <verse eid="NUM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 10:3"/>Sɛ wɔhyɛn ntotorobɛnto mmienu no a, nnipa no bɛhunu sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔboa wɔn ho ano wɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no ano. <verse eid="NUM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 10:4"/>Na sɛ wɔhyɛn baako pɛ a, na ɛkyerɛ sɛ Israel mmusua no mu mpanimfoɔ na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔba wo nkyɛn. <verse eid="NUM 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 10:5"/>Sɛ mohyɛn de kyerɛ sɛ monkɔ mo anim a, mmusuakuo a wɔwɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan apueeɛ fam no bɛtu wɔn atenaeɛ hɔ na wɔakɔ. <verse eid="NUM 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 10:6"/>Sɛ mohyɛn deɛ ɛtɔ so mmienu no a, mmusuakuo a wɔwɔ anafoɔ fam no bɛdi so. Monhyɛn no ntiantia mu mfa nkyerɛ sɛ wɔnkɔ. <verse eid="NUM 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 10:7"/>Na sɛ mofrɛ nnipa no ma wɔbɛhyia a, momfa ɛkwan foforɔ so nhyɛne ntotorobɛnto no.<verse eid="NUM 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 10:8"/>“Aaron mmammarima asɔfoɔ nko ara na wɔbɛma wɔn ɛkwan ama wɔahyɛn ntotorobɛnto no. Yei yɛ mmara a ɛbɛtena hɔ daa afiri awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ so akɔsi awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ so. <verse eid="NUM 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 10:9"/>Sɛ moduru Bɔhyɛ Asase no so na mo ne mo atamfoɔ ko na mohyɛn ntotorobɛnto no a, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn bɛtie mo na wagye mo afiri mo atamfoɔ nsam. <verse eid="NUM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 10:10"/>Anigyeberɛ mu nso, monhyɛn ntotorobɛnto no. Afe mu dapɔnna nso, monhyɛn. Bosome biara ahyɛaseɛ nso, monhyɛ mfa nnye mo ani wɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ ne asomdwoeɛ afɔdeɛ ho. Sɛ moyɛ saa a, ɛbɛkae Onyankopɔn apam a ɔne mo apam no. Na mene <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn.”<verse eid="NUM 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 10:11"/>Bosome a ɛtɔ so mmienu no ɛda a ɛtɔ so aduonu no a ɛyɛ mfeɛ mmienu a Israelfoɔ firii Misraim no, omununkum no pagyaa ne ho firii Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no so, <verse eid="NUM 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 10:12"/>enti Israelfoɔ no firii Sinai ɛserɛ so hɔ dii omununkum no akyi kɔsii sɛ ɛkɔgyinaa Paran ɛserɛ so. <verse eid="NUM 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 10:13"/>Ɛberɛ a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔtu no duruiɛ no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nam Mose so ka kyerɛɛ wɔn.<verse eid="NUM 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 10:14"/>Akwantuo no mu no, mmusua a wɔhyɛ Yuda abusuakuo no ase, a Aminadab babarima Nahson tua ano na ɔtu wɔn frankaa na wɔdi ɛkan. <verse eid="NUM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 10:15"/>Wɔn a wɔdi so ne Isakar abusuakuo a Suar babarima Netanel na ɔdi wɔn anim. <verse eid="NUM 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 10:16"/>Sebulon abusuakuo na wɔdi hɔ a Helon babarima Eliab na ɔdi wɔn anim. <verse eid="NUM 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 10:17"/>Wɔtutuu Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no, na Gerson ne Merari mmusua a wɔfiri Lewifoɔ mu no soaa Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no dii wɔn afa wɔ santen no mu.<verse eid="NUM 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 10:18"/>Afei, Ruben abusuakuo tuu wɔn frankaa de dii so a Sedeur babarima Elisur na na ɔdi wɔn anim. <verse eid="NUM 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 10:19"/>Wɔn a na wɔdi so ne Simeon abusuakuo a Surisadai babarima Selumiel na na ɔdi wɔn anim; <verse eid="NUM 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 10:20"/>Gad abusuakuo nso, na Deguel babarima Eliasaf na na ɔdi wɔn anim. <verse eid="NUM 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 10:21"/>Ɛnna Kohatfoɔ no nso na na wɔdi hɔ a wɔsoso kronkronbea hɔ nneɛma. Wɔduruu hɔ no, na wɔahyehyɛ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no wɔ beaeɛ foforɔ hɔ dada.<verse eid="NUM 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 10:22"/>Wɔn a na wɔdi so ne Efraim abusuakuo a na wɔdi wɔn frankaa akyi a Amihud babarima Elisama na ɔdi wɔn anim; <verse eid="NUM 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 10:23"/>ɛnna wɔn a na wɔdi so ne Manase abusuakuo a Pedahsur babarima Gamaliel na na ɔdi wɔn anim; <verse eid="NUM 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 10:24"/>afei, Benyamin abusuakuo na na wɔdi so a Gideoni babarima Abidan na na ɔdi wɔn anim.<verse eid="NUM 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 10:25"/>Wɔn a na wɔtwa toɔ koraa no ne abusuakuo a na Dan abusuakuo frankaa di wɔn anim a na wɔn panin ne Amisadai babarima Ahieser no. <verse eid="NUM 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 10:26"/>Okran babarima Pagiel na na ɔdi Aser abusuakuo anim. <verse eid="NUM 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 10:27"/>Ɛnna na Enan babarima Ahira nso di Naftali abusuakuo anim. <verse eid="NUM 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 10:28"/>Saa nhyehyɛeɛ yi na mmusuakuo yi faa so tuu wɔn kwan no.<verse eid="NUM 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 10:29"/>Ɛda bi, Mose ka kyerɛɛ nʼakonta Hobab, Midiani Reuel ba sɛ, “Yei nyinaa akyi no, yɛrekɔ Bɔhyɛ Asase no so. Bra na yɛnkɔ na yɛbɛhwɛ wo so yie; ɛfiri sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahyɛ Israelfoɔ bɔ a emu yɛ den!”<verse eid="NUM 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 10:30"/>Nanso nʼakonta no buaa no sɛ, “Dabi, ɛsɛ sɛ mekɔ mʼasase so ne mʼabusuafoɔ nkyɛn.”<verse eid="NUM 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 10:31"/>Mose srɛɛ sɛ, “Tena yɛn nkyɛn, ɛfiri sɛ, wo na wonim sɛdeɛ ɛserɛ so asetena teɛ enti wo ho bɛba mfasoɔ ama yɛn. <verse eid="NUM 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 10:32"/>Sɛ woba a, nneɛma pa a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de bɛma yɛn no nyinaa, wobɛnya bi.”<verse eid="NUM 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 10:33"/>Wɔfiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Bepɔ so no, wɔnantee nnansa a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Adaka no di wɔn anim sɛ wɔrekɔpɛ baabi a wɔbɛsoeɛ. <verse eid="NUM 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 10:34"/>Wɔfirii wɔn akwantuo no ase awia a wɔrekɔ no nyinaa na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> omununkum no di wɔn anim.<verse eid="NUM 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 10:35"/>Wɔmaa adaka no so kɔɔ wɔn anim kakra no, Mose teaam sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 10:35">“Ao, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, sɔre!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 10:35">Na hwete wʼatamfoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 10:35">ma wɔn nyinaa nnwane mfiri wʼanim.”<verse eid="NUM 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 10:36"/>Wɔsoɛɛ adaka no, ɔkaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 10:36">“Ao, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, sane bra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 10:36">Israelfoɔ ɔpepe no mu.”<verse eid="NUM 10:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NUM 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Israelfoɔ Anwiinwii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 11:1"/>Ankyɛre biara na nnipa no firii aseɛ nwiinwii sɛ nneɛma nkɔ yie mma wɔn, na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> teeɛ. Nʼabufuhyeɛ kɔɔ wɔn so wɔ wɔn anwiinwii no ho. Yei enti, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> maa ogya bɛhyee beaeɛ a na wɔte hɔ no mfikyire. <verse eid="NUM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 11:2"/>Wɔteateaam frɛɛ Mose sɛ ɔmmɛgye wɔn. Mose bɔɔ mpaeɛ srɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> maa wɔn na ogya no dumiiɛ. <verse eid="NUM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 11:3"/>Ɛfiri saa ɛberɛ no, wɔtoo beaeɛ hɔ edin sɛ Tabera a asekyerɛ ne “Ahyeɛ”, ɛfiri sɛ, ogya a ɛfiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn no hyee wɔn atenaeɛ hɔ.<verse eid="NUM 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 11:4"/>Misraimfoɔ a na wɔwɔ wɔn ntam no kɔn dɔɔ nneɛma pa a na ɛwɔ Misraim no. Yei amma Israelfoɔ no ani ansɔ baabi a na wɔwɔ hɔ no, enti wɔsuu sɛ, “Hwan na ɔbɛma yɛn aduane adi? <verse eid="NUM 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 11:5"/>Ɛberɛ a na yɛwɔ Misraim no, na yɛnya ɛnam ne nsuomnam we. Saa ara nso na na yɛnya kokumba, ɛferɛ, gyeene ne galik nso die. <verse eid="NUM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 11:6"/>Nanso, seesei deɛ, yɛn ahoɔden so ate na ɛda biara yɛnnya biribiara sɛ mana nko ara.”<verse eid="NUM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 11:7"/>Na mana no kɛseɛ te sɛ wisa aba na ɛsɛ ɛhyɛ a awaawae firi dubona ho agu fam. <verse eid="NUM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 11:8"/>Nnipa no tasee firi fam na wɔayam anaa wɔasi no waduro mu ama adane esiam. Wɔwie a, wɔnoa de bi yɛ taterɛ. Woka wʼano a, ɛte sɛ taterɛ a wɔakye wɔ nhahamma ngo mu. <verse eid="NUM 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 11:9"/>Anadwo bosuo mu na mana no tɔ.<verse eid="NUM 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 11:10"/>Mose tee sɛ mmusuakuo no nyinaa gyinagyina, atwa wɔn ntomadan ho ahyia resu. Yei hyɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuo yie. Na anyɛ Mose nso abodwo koraa. <verse eid="NUM 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 11:11"/>Mose bisaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛ, “Adɛn enti na woyɛ me saa na wode saa nnipa a wɔte seyie yi nyinaa adesoa abɛsoa me? <verse eid="NUM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 11:12"/>Wɔyɛ me mma anaasɛ me nso meyɛ wɔn agya? Yei enti na wode wɔn ama me sɛ menhwɛ wɔn sɛ nkɔkoaa kɔsi sɛ yɛbɛduru asase a wohyɛɛ wɔn agyanom ho bɔ no? <verse eid="NUM 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 11:13"/>Ɛhefa na merekɔfa ɛnam abrɛ nnipa yi? Wɔsu kyerɛ me sɛ, ‘Ma yɛn ɛnam!’ <verse eid="NUM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 11:14"/>Mʼankasa merentumi nsoa ɔman yi! Adesoa no mu yɛ duru ma me dodo! <verse eid="NUM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 11:15"/>Na sɛ saa na wo ne me bɛdi no deɛ a, mesrɛ, kum me seesei ara; ɛbɛyɛ adom ama me! Yi me firi saa ahokyere yi mu!”<verse eid="NUM 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 11:16"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, “Frɛ Israelfoɔ mpanimfoɔ no mu aduɔson ma me; fa wɔn bra Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no mu na wo ne wɔn nnyina hɔ. <verse eid="NUM 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 11:17"/>Mɛba hɔ na me ne wo abɛkasa na honhom a ɛwɔ wo so no, mɛfa na mede akɔgu wɔn nso so bi; ɛba saa a, wɔne wo bɛsoa nnipa no adesoa sɛdeɛ ɛrenyɛ wo nko ara wʼadesoa.<verse eid="NUM 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 11:18"/>“Ka kyerɛ nnipa no na wɔnnwira wɔn ho na ɔkyena, wɔbɛnya ɛnam awe. Ka kyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> ate mo sufrɛ a ɛfa nneɛma a mogyaa no Misraim no ho na ɔrebɛma mo ɛnam. Mobɛwe; <verse eid="NUM 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 11:19"/>ɛnyɛ ɛda koro anaa nnanu anaa nnanum anaa dadu anaa adaduonu! <verse eid="NUM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 11:20"/>Na bosome baako mu, mobɛwe ɛnam ara ma apuro mo ama afa mo hwene mu. Ɛfiri sɛ, moapo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> a ɔka mo ho wɔ ha no, na moasu ama Misraim nso.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 11:21"/>Mose kaa sɛ, “Mmarima nko ara mpem ahansia na wɔwɔ ha, ɛnna woahyɛ wɔn bɔ sɛ wobɛma wɔn ɛnam awe ara bosome! <verse eid="NUM 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 11:22"/>Sɛ yɛkum yɛn nnwan ne yɛn anantwie nyinaa koraa a, ɛrenso wɔn so. Ɛsɛ sɛ yɛkyere ɛpo mu ɛnam nyinaa ansa na yɛatumi adi wo bɔhyɛ no so!”<verse eid="NUM 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 11:23"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bisaa Mose sɛ, “Da bɛn na meyɛɛ mmerɛ? Afei wobɛhunu sɛ mʼasɛm yɛ nokorɛ anaa ɛnyɛ nokorɛ.”<verse eid="NUM 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 11:24"/>Enti Mose firii Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no mu hɔ kɔkaa nsɛm a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ no no nyinaa kyerɛɛ nnipa no. Ɔboaboaa mpanimfoɔ aduɔson ano ma wɔtwaa Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no ho hyiaeɛ. <verse eid="NUM 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 11:25"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nam omununkum mu baa fam ne Mose kasaeɛ, na ɔfaa honhom a ɛwɔ Mose so no de guu mpanimfoɔ aduɔson no so. Ɛberɛ a honhom no baa wɔn so kakra no, wɔhyɛɛ nkɔm mmerɛ tiawa bi mu.<verse eid="NUM 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 11:26"/>Nanso na mpanimfoɔ aduɔson no mu baanu a wɔfrɛ wɔn Eldad ne Medad da so wɔ wɔn atenaeɛ hɔ. Na mmerɛ a honhom no baa wɔn so wɔ hɔ no, wɔhyɛɛ nkɔm wɔ hɔ. <verse eid="NUM 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 11:27"/>Mmeranteɛ bi tuu mmirika kɔbɔɔ Mose asɛm a asie no ho amaneɛ <verse eid="NUM 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 11:28"/>na Nun babarima Yosua a na wɔayi no sɛ ɔnyɛ Mose ɔboafoɔ no ampene so, na ɔkaa sɛ, “Owura, ma wɔnnyae!”<verse eid="NUM 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 11:29"/>Mose bisaa no sɛ, “Me ho na woretwe ninkunu yi? Ɛkaa me nko a, na anka <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkurɔfoɔ nyinaa yɛ adiyifoɔ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de ne honhom agu wɔn nyinaa so!” <verse eid="NUM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 11:30"/>Afei, Mose ne Israel mpanimfoɔ no sane kɔɔ wɔn atenaeɛ hɔ.<verse eid="NUM 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 11:31"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɔɔ ahum maa ɛde mmoko firi ɛpo mu bɛguu atenaeɛ hɔ ne ɛho mmaa nyinaa. Baabiara a obi bɛfa no, na nnomaa yi bi atu nenam asase ani bɛyɛ anammɔn ɛnan. <verse eid="NUM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 11:32"/>Enti ɛda mu no nyinaa, nnipa kyekyeree mmoko no bi kunkumm wɔn awia ne anadwo ne nʼadekyeeɛ nso. Deɛ wannya bi no koraa na ɔnyaa susukora ɔha! Mmoko buu so wɔ atenaeɛ hɔ nyinaa. <verse eid="NUM 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 11:33"/>Na nnipa no firii aseɛ wee mmoa no bi. Wɔhyɛɛ aseɛ weeɛ no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bo sane fuu wɔn maa ɔde ɔyaredɔm kumm wɔn mu fa kɛseɛ no ara. <verse eid="NUM 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 11:34"/>Enti wɔtoo beaeɛ hɔ edin sɛ Kibrot-Hataawa a asekyerɛ ne, “Akɔnnɔ damena” ɛfiri sɛ, wɔn a na wɔn ani bere ɛnam na wɔn kɔn adɔ Misraim tena no na wɔsiee wɔn wɔ hɔ.<verse eid="NUM 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 11:35"/>Ɔman no tu firii hɔ kɔtenaa Haserot kakra.<verse eid="NUM 11:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NUM 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Miriam Ne Aaron Tia Mose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 12:1"/>Ɛda koro bi Miriam ne Aaron kasa tiaa Mose sɛ ne yere yɛ Etiopiani. <verse eid="NUM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 12:2"/>Afei, wɔkaa sɛ, “Mose nko ara na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akasa afa ne so? Na yɛn nso ɔnnkasa mfa yɛn so bi anaa?” Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> tee wɔn anwiinwii no.<verse eid="NUM 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 12:3"/>Na Mose yɛ ɔhobrɛaseni sene obiara a ɔte asase yi so.<verse eid="NUM 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 12:4"/>Ntɛm so, ɔfrɛɛ Mose, Aaron ne Miriam kɔɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no mu. Ɔhyɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Mo baasa no mommra ha.” Enti wɔbɛgyinagyinaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim. <verse eid="NUM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 12:5"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nam omununkum no mu siane ba bɛgyinaa Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no kwan ano, na ɔfrɛɛ Aaron ne Miriam. Ɛberɛ a wɔtwe kɔɔ wɔn anim no, <verse eid="NUM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 12:6"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Montie me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 12:6">“Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> odiyifoɔ wɔ mo mu a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:6">menam anisoadehunu so da me ho adi kyerɛ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:6">me kasa kyerɛ no daeɛ mu.<verse eid="NUM 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 12:7"/>Nanso ɛnte saa wɔ me ɔsomfoɔ Mose ho.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:7">Me fie nyinaa mu, ɔyɛ ɔnokwafoɔ.<verse eid="NUM 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 12:8"/>Me ne no kasa animu ne animu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:8">kasa a emu da hɔ na ɛnyɛ abɛbuo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:8">Na ɔhunu <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛdeɛ ɔteɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 12:8">Adɛn enti na moansuro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:8">sɛ mobɛkasa atia me ɔsomfoɔ Mose?”<verse eid="NUM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 12:9"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bo fuu wɔn denden pa ara ɛnna ɔfirii hɔ kɔeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 12:10"/>Ɛberɛ a omununkum no refiri Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no atifi no, amonom hɔ ara, kwata bɛduruu Miriam ho fitaa. Aaron hunuu asɛm a asi no, <verse eid="NUM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 12:11"/>ɔteaam sɛ, “Ao, Owura, nnyina saa bɔne yi so nntwe yɛn aso; yɛyɛ nkwaseafoɔ sɛ yɛyɛɛ adeɛ a ɛte saa. <verse eid="NUM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 12:12"/>Mma no nyɛ sɛ owufoɔ a ne fa aporɔ firi nʼawoɔ mu.”<verse eid="NUM 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 12:13"/>Na Mose teaam frɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛ, “Ao, Onyankopɔn, mesrɛ wo sɛ sa no yadeɛ!”<verse eid="NUM 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 12:14"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, “Sɛ nʼagya tee ntasuo guu nʼanim a, anka ne ho bɛgu fi nnanson. Monyi no mfiri atenaeɛ ha nkɔhyɛ baabi nnanson na akyire no, ɔbɛtumi aba bio.” <verse eid="NUM 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 12:15"/>Enti wɔtwaa Miriam asuo firii atenaeɛ hɔ ma ɔkɔdii nnanson. Nnipa no twɛn kɔsii sɛ wɔsane de no baeɛ ansa na wɔretu kwan no bio.<verse eid="NUM 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 12:16"/>Ɛno akyi, wɔfirii Haserot bɛbɔɔ atenaeɛ wɔ Paran ɛserɛ so.<verse eid="NUM 12:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NUM 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Akwansrafoɔ Kɔ Kanaan Asase So</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 13:1"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 13:2"/>“Soma akwansrafoɔ na wɔnkɔ Kanaan asase so—asase a mede rema; soma mmusuakuo dumienu no mu biara ntuanoni.”<verse eid="NUM 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 13:3"/>Enti Mose yɛɛ sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ no no. Ɔsomaa mmarima dumienu a wɔn nyinaa yɛ mmusuakuo ntuanofoɔ firi wɔn atenaeɛ wɔ Paran ɛserɛ so.<verse eid="NUM 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 13:4"/>Saa mmusuakuo no ne wɔn mpanimfoɔ no edin na ɛdidi so yi:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 13:4"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 13:4">Ruben abusuakuo no ntuanoni ne Sakur babarima Samua;<verse eid="NUM 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 13:5"/>Simeon abusuakuo no ntuanoni ne Hori babarima Safat;<verse eid="NUM 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 13:6"/>Yuda abusuakuo no ntuanoni ne Yefune babarima Kaleb;<verse eid="NUM 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 13:7"/>Isakar abusuakuo no ntuanoni ne Yosef babarima Igal;<verse eid="NUM 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 13:8"/>Efraim abusuakuo no ntuanoni ne Nun babarima Hosea;<verse eid="NUM 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 13:9"/>Benyamin abusuakuo no ntuanoni ne Rafu babarima Palti;<verse eid="NUM 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 13:10"/>Sebulon abusuakuo no ntuanoni ne Sodi babarima Gadiel;<verse eid="NUM 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 13:11"/>Manase abusuakuo (a ɛyɛ Yosef abusuakuo no mu fa) no ntuanoni ne Susi babarima Gadi;<verse eid="NUM 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 13:12"/>Dan abusuakuo no ntuanoni ne Gemali babarima Amiel;<verse eid="NUM 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 13:13"/>Aser abusuakuo no ntuanoni ne Mikael babarima Setur;<verse eid="NUM 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 13:14"/>Naftali abusuakuo no ntuanoni ne Wofsi babarima Nahbi<verse eid="NUM 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 13:15"/>Gad abusuakuo no ntuanoni ne Maki babarima Geuel.<verse eid="NUM 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 13:16"/>Nnipa yi na Mose somaa wɔn ma wɔkɔsraa Kanaan asase no. Mose na ɔmaa Nun ba Hosea edin Yosua.<verse eid="NUM 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 13:17"/>Mose ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Monkɔ atifi fam wɔ Negeb bepɔ no so <verse eid="NUM 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 13:18"/>na monhwɛ sɛdeɛ ɛhɔ asase no te; afei, monhwɛ wɔn a wɔte hɔ no nso tebea mu sɛ wɔwɔ ahoɔden anaa wɔyɛ mmerɛ, sɛ wɔdɔɔso anaa wɔsua <verse eid="NUM 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 13:19"/>anaasɛ asase no mu wɔ sradeɛ anaasɛ nso sradeɛ nni mu, ne nkuro a ɛwɔ hɔ, sɛ ɛyɛ nkuraa anaa wɔabɔ ho ban, <verse eid="NUM 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 13:20"/>sɛ asase no yɛ asasebereɛ anaa asasenini anaasɛ nnua pii wɔ so. Monnsuro na momfa ɛhɔ nnɔbaeɛ no bi mmra.” Saa ɛberɛ no na wɔrete bobe atekane.<verse eid="NUM 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 13:21"/>Enti wɔkɔsraa asase no firi Sin ɛserɛ so kɔsii Rehob a ɛbɛn Hamat no. <verse eid="NUM 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 13:22"/>Wɔrekɔ atifi fam no, wɔdii ɛkan faa Negeb bɛduruu Hebron. Ɛhɔ na wɔhunuu Anak asefoɔ a wɔfrɛ wɔn Ahiman, Sesai ne Talmai. Hebron yɛ kuro dada. Wɔkyekyeree saa kuro no ansa na wɔrekyekyere Soan a ɛwɔ Misraim no. <verse eid="NUM 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 13:23"/>Afei, wɔbaa baabi a seesei wɔfrɛ hɔ “Eskol” a aseɛ ne “Siaka”, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔhunuu bobe siaka bebree wɔ hɔ! Wɔtwaa siaka baako a nnipa baanu na wɔwuraa no dua soaeɛ. Ɛnna wɔfaa ateaa ne borɔdɔma aba sɛ adekyerɛdeɛ de kɔeɛ. <verse eid="NUM 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 13:24"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, Israelfoɔ no too subɔnhwa hɔ edin sɛ “Eskol” a asekyerɛ ne “Siaka”, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔhunuu bobe no siaka pii wɔ hɔ. <verse eid="NUM 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 13:25"/>Adaduanan akyi, wɔfirii wɔn akwantuo no mu baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 13:26"/>Wɔkaa deɛ wɔkɔhunuiɛ nyinaa kyerɛɛ Mose ne Aaron ne nnipa a wɔwɔ Israel nyinaa ne wɔn a wɔwɔ Paran ɛserɛ so wɔ Kades na wɔde aduaba a wɔde baeɛ no kyerɛeɛ. <verse eid="NUM 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 13:27"/>Asɛm a wɔbɛkaeɛ ne sɛ, “Yɛduruu asase a wosomaa yɛn sɛ yɛnkɔsra so no so, na nokwasɛm, ɛyɛ ɔman a ɛyɛ fɛ—asase a ɛwoɔ ne nufosuo sen wɔ so. Aduaba a yɛde baeɛ yi di ho adanseɛ. <verse eid="NUM 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 13:28"/>Nanso na nnipa a wɔtete hɔ no yɛ den. Wɔn nkuro no soso na wɔabɔ ho ban nso. Yɛhunuu Anak asefoɔ akantinka nso wɔ hɔ. <verse eid="NUM 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 13:29"/>Amalekfoɔ te anafoɔ ɛnna Hetifoɔ, Yebusifoɔ ne Amorifoɔ nso tete mmepɔ so. Ɛnna Kanaanfoɔ nso tete ntam ɛpo no ne Yordan subɔnhwa ntam.”<verse eid="NUM 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 13:30"/>Na ɛberɛ a nnipa no gyina Mose anim no, Kaleb sane hyɛɛ wɔn nkuran sɛ, “Momma yɛmforo nkɔ hɔ prɛko pɛ na yɛnkɔgye wɔn nsam, ɛfiri sɛ, yɛbɛtumi adi wɔn so nkonim.”<verse eid="NUM 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 13:31"/>Akwansrafoɔ no bi kaa sɛ, “Nanso ɛnyɛ ahoɔdenfoɔ sei na ɛsɛ sɛ yɛne wɔn di asie. Wɔbɛtɔre yɛn ase!” <verse eid="NUM 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 13:32"/>Akwansrafoɔ no mu fa kɛseɛ no ara asɛm a wɔkaeɛ no maa Israelfoɔ no aba mu buiɛ. Wɔkaa sɛ, “Akofoɔ bebree wɔ asase no so na ɛhɔ nnipa nso yɛ ahoɔdenfoɔ, <verse eid="NUM 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 13:33"/>na yɛhunuu Anakfoɔ no bi a ɛfiri awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ mu wɔyɛ abrane no. Sɛ yɛne wɔn gyina hɔ a, na yɛayɛ te sɛ mmɛbɛ wɔ yɛn ani so. Na saa nso na yɛyɛɛ wɔ wɔn ani soɔ.”<verse eid="NUM 13:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="NUM 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Nnipa No Tee Atua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 14:1"/>Afei, nnipa no nyinaa firii aseɛ suu dendeenden anadwo no nyinaa. <verse eid="NUM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 14:2"/>Wɔde nne korɔ kasa tiaa Mose ne Aaron. Wɔsuu sɛ, “Sɛ yɛwuwuu wɔ Misraim anaa ɛserɛ so ha a, anka yɛpɛ no saa ara <verse eid="NUM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 14:3"/>sen sɛ wɔde yɛn bɛkɔ kuro a ɛwɔ yɛn anim no so. <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛkum yɛn wɔ hɔ na yɛn yerenom ne yɛn mma ayɛ nkoa wɔ hɔ. Momma yɛmfiri ha na yɛnkɔ Misraim!” <verse eid="NUM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 14:4"/>Saa asɛm yi dii wɔn nyinaa tirim dɛm. Enti wɔteaam sɛ, “Momma yɛnyi ɔpanin bi na ɔnni yɛn anim nsane mfa yɛn nkɔ Misraim.”<verse eid="NUM 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 14:5"/>Afei, Mose ne Aaron de wɔn anim butubutuu fam wɔ Israelfoɔ no anim. <verse eid="NUM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 14:6"/>Akwansrafoɔ baanu, a wɔn ne Nun babarima Yosua ne Yefune babarima Kaleb sunsuanee wɔn ntadeɛ mu <verse eid="NUM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 14:7"/>na wɔka kyerɛɛ nnipa no nyinaa sɛ, “Asase a ɛda yɛn anim no yɛ asase pa. <verse eid="NUM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 14:8"/>Na sɛ yɛsɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani a, ɔde yɛn bɛduru asase no so dwoodwoo na ɔde hɔ ahyɛ yɛn nsa. Ɛyɛ asase bereɛ, asase a nufosuo ne ɛwoɔ sen wɔ soɔ, na ɔde bɛma yɛn. <verse eid="NUM 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 14:9"/>Ao, monnyɛ dɔm ntia <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na monnsuro nnipa a wɔwɔ asase no so no nso. Na wɔte sɛ burodo bi a yɛdie ma yɛn! <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne yɛn wɔ hɔ na wɔn deɛ, wayi ne nsa afiri wɔn so! Monnsuro wɔn!”<verse eid="NUM 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 14:10"/>Nanso mmuaeɛ a nnipa no maeɛ ara ne sɛ, wɔbɛsi wɔn aboɔ. Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> animuonyam baeɛ <verse eid="NUM 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 14:11"/>na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bisaa Mose sɛ, “Nnipa yi bɛbu me animtia akɔsi da bɛn? Anwanwadeɛ dodoɔ a mayɛ akyerɛ wɔn yi nyinaa akyi no, wɔnnye me nni? <verse eid="NUM 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 14:12"/>Mɛgye wɔn nsam nneɛma a mede ama wɔn nyinaa na mama ɔyaredɔm asɛe wɔn na mayɛ mo ɔman kɛseɛ a ɛso sene wɔn!”<verse eid="NUM 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 14:13"/>Mose srɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛ, “Na sɛ Misraimfoɔ yi te a, ɛdeɛn asɛm na wɔbɛdwene? Wɔn nyinaa hunuu tumi a wonam so de gyee wo nkurɔfoɔ. <verse eid="NUM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 14:14"/>Wɔaka saa asɛm yi akyerɛ wɔn a wɔte asase yi so a wɔnim, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, sɛ wowɔ Israel afa, na wo ne wɔn kasa anim ne anim. Wɔhunu omununkum dum ne ogya sɛ ɛgyina yɛn atifi, na wɔnim sɛ wodi yɛn anim bɔ yɛn ho ban awia ne anadwo. <verse eid="NUM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 14:15"/>Na sɛ wokum wo nkurɔfoɔ nyinaa a, aman a wɔate wo din no bɛka sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 14:16"/>‘ɛsɛ sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kum wɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, wantumi anhwɛ wɔn so wɔ ɛserɛ so hɔ. Ɔnni ahoɔden a ɔnam so bɛtumi de wɔn aba asase a ɔkaa ho ntam sɛ ɔde bɛma wɔn no so.’<verse eid="NUM 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 14:17"/>“Ao, mesrɛ wo, fa wo tumi kɛseɛ a ntoboaseɛ wɔ mu no so fa yɛn bɔne kyɛ yɛn, na dɔ yɛn yie. Ɛwom sɛ woaka sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 14:18"/>‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> bo kyɛre fu na nʼadɔeɛ dɔɔso. Nanso ɔbɔnefoɔ remfa ne ho nni a wɔntwe nʼaso; nanso, fa yɛn bɔne kyɛ yɛn. Yɛnim sɛ wonam agyanom bɔne so twee wɔn mma a wɔwɔ awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ mmiɛnsa ne nan mu no aso.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 14:19"/>Ao, mesrɛ wo, fa saa nnipa yi bɔne kyɛ wɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, wo dɔ enti, wode wɔn bɔne akyɛ wɔn firi Misraim abɛsi saa ɛberɛ yi.”<verse eid="NUM 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 14:20"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kaa sɛ, “Ɛyɛ, mede bɛkyɛ wɔn sɛdeɛ woabisa no. <verse eid="NUM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 14:21"/>Nanso, sɛ mete ase yi, na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> animuonyam ahyɛ asase nyinaa ma yi, <verse eid="NUM 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 14:22"/>saa nnipa yi mu biara rensi asase no so ɛda biara da. Wɔahunu mʼanimuonyam ne anwanwadeɛ a meyɛɛ wɔ Misraim ne ɛserɛ so no, nanso ɛberɛ biara wɔyɛ asoɔden de sɔ me hwɛ. <verse eid="NUM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 14:23"/>Wɔrenhunu asase a mede hyɛɛ wɔn agyanom bɔ no. Wɔn a wɔyɛɛ asoɔden kyerɛɛ me no mu biara rensi hɔ. <verse eid="NUM 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 14:24"/>Nanso, mʼakoa Kaleb yɛ onipa sononko. Wadi me nsɛm so pɛpɛɛpɛ. Mede no bɛkɔ asase a ɔkɔɔ so sɛ ɔkwansrafoɔ no, na nʼasefoɔ anya ɛhɔ mu kyɛfa. <verse eid="NUM 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 14:25"/>Nanso, ɛsiane sɛ Israelfoɔ suro Amalekfoɔ na Kanaanfoɔ tete bɔnhwa mu no enti, ɔkyena, ɛsɛ sɛ mosane de mo ani kyerɛ Po Kɔkɔɔ no kɔ ɛserɛ so.”<verse eid="NUM 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 14:26"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bisaa Mose ne Aaron sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 14:27"/>“Da bɛn na saa nnipa bɔnefoɔ yi bɛgyae me ho nkɔmmɔdie? Na mate nsɛm a wɔka fa me ho nyinaa. <verse eid="NUM 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 14:28"/>Ka kyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka ntam sɛ ɔbɛyɛ deɛ mosuro. <verse eid="NUM 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 14:29"/>Mo nyinaa mobɛwuwu wɔ ɛserɛ so ha: Ɛfiri wɔn a wɔadi mfeɛ aduonu rekorɔ no a wɔadi me ho nkɔmmɔ no, <verse eid="NUM 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 14:30"/>wɔn mu biara renkɔ Bɔhyɛ Asase no so. Wɔn a wɔbɛkɔ hɔ ara ne Yefune babarima Kaleb ne Nun babarima Yosua. <verse eid="NUM 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 14:31"/>Moka sɛ mo mma bɛyɛ nnipa a wɔte asase no so no nkoa. Ɛyɛ, mede wɔn bɛkɔ asase no so dwoodwoo ama wɔakɔfa deɛ mose mompɛ no. <verse eid="NUM 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 14:32"/>Na mo deɛ, mo amu na ɛbɛka ɛserɛ so ha. <verse eid="NUM 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 14:33"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ mokyini ɛserɛ so ha sɛ atutenafoɔ mfeɛ aduanan. Saa ɛkwan yi so na mobɛfa atua mo gyidie a monni ho ka kɔsi sɛ onipa a ɔtwa toɔ no bɛwu atɔ ɛserɛ so ha. <verse eid="NUM 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 14:34"/>Esiane sɛ akwansrafoɔ no tenaa asase no so adaduanan no enti, ɛsɛ sɛ mo nso mokyinkyini ɛserɛ no so mfeɛ aduanan a afe biara gyina hɔ ma ɛda koro a ɛyɛ mo bɔne so akatua. Sɛ meyɛ obi ɔtamfoɔ a mobɛhunu sɛdeɛ ɛteɛ.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 14:35"/>Me, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na makasa. Mo mu biara a wayɛ dɔm atia me no bɛwu wɔ ɛserɛ so ha.”<verse eid="NUM 14:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 14:36"/>Akwansrafoɔ edu no a wɔbɔɔ nnipa no hu ma wɔyɛɛ dɔm tiaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no, <verse eid="NUM 14:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 14:37"/>wɔkunkumm wɔn wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim. <verse eid="NUM 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 14:38"/>Akwansrafoɔ no nyinaa, Kaleb ne Yosua nko ara na wɔtenaa ase.<verse eid="NUM 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 14:39"/>Mose kɔkaa nsɛm a Onyankopɔn ka kyerɛɛ no no kyerɛɛ nnipa no no, wɔn nyinaa werɛ hoeɛ. <verse eid="NUM 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 14:40"/>Wɔsɔree anɔpahema sɛ wɔrekɔ Bɔhyɛ Asase no so. Wɔkaa sɛ, “Yɛahunu sɛ yɛayɛ bɔne, nanso, yɛasiesie yɛn ho sɛ yɛbɛkɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ yɛn ho bɔ no so.”<verse eid="NUM 14:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 14:41"/>Nanso, Mose kaa sɛ, “Aka akyi. Afei, morebu <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm a ɔkaa sɛ monsane nkɔ ɛserɛ so no so. <verse eid="NUM 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 14:42"/>Monnkɔ sɛdeɛ moasusu no, anyɛ saa a, atamfoɔ no bɛdi mo so, ɛfiri sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nni mo afa. <verse eid="NUM 14:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 14:43"/>Mo werɛ afiri sɛ Amalekfoɔ ne Kanaanfoɔ wɔ hɔ? Moapa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> enti ɔno nso bɛpa mo.”<verse eid="NUM 14:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 14:44"/>Nanso, wɔtoaa so foro kɔɔ bepɔ no so a ɛmfa wɔn ho sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> adaka no ne Mose mu biara amfiri atenaeɛ hɔ. <verse eid="NUM 14:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 14:45"/>Afei, Amalekfoɔ ne Kanaanfoɔ a wɔte bepɔ no so no siane baa fam bɛto hyɛɛ wɔn so boroo wɔn ara kɔsii Horma.<verse eid="NUM 14:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="NUM 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Afɔrebɔ Ahodoɔ Ho Mmara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 15:1"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 15:2"/>“Ka kyerɛ Israelfoɔ no sɛ, ‘Sɛ mokɔtena asase a mede ama mo no so <verse eid="NUM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 15:3"/>na mopɛ sɛ mobɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ anaa afɔdeɛ biara a wɔbɔ no ogya so ma ɛsɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani a, ɛsɛ sɛ afɔrebɔdeɛ no yɛ aboa a ɔfiri mo nnwankuo anaa anantwibuo mu. Sɛ ɛyɛ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ, anaa afɔrebɔ a wɔde hyɛ bɔ, anaa afɔrebɔ a ɛfiri ɔpɛ mu, anaa afɔrebɔ a wɔbɔ no afirinhyia mu nnapɔnna bi mu no a, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde aduane afɔrebɔdeɛ ka ho. <verse eid="NUM 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 15:4"/>Deɛ ɔde ba no, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔde aduane afɔrebɔdeɛ a ɛyɛ esiam kilogram mmienu a wɔde ngo lita baako afra ka ho ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. <verse eid="NUM 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 15:5"/>Odwammaa biara a wɔde bɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ no, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde nsã afɔrebɔdeɛ a ɛyɛ bobesa lita baako ka ho.<verse eid="NUM 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 15:6"/>“ ‘Sɛ odwennini na wode rebɔ afɔdeɛ a, fa esiam lita mmiɛnsa fra ngo lita baako, <verse eid="NUM 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 15:7"/>ne bobesa lita baako sɛ ɔnom afɔrebɔdeɛ. Yei ne afɔrebɔ a ɛbɛsɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani.<verse eid="NUM 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 15:8"/>“ ‘Sɛ wosiesie nantwie ba ma ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ anaa afɔrebɔdeɛ de hyɛ bɔ sononko bi anaa ayɔnkofa asikyiresiam afɔdeɛ a worebɔ ama <char style="nd">Awurade</char> a, <verse eid="NUM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 15:9"/>fa atokoɔ afɔrebɔdeɛ a ɛyɛ asikyiresiam a wɔayam no muhumuhu lita nsia ne fa ne ngo lita mmienu ka nantwie no ho <verse eid="NUM 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 15:10"/>a bobesa lita mmienu ka ho sɛ ɔnom afɔrebɔdeɛ. Egya na wɔde bɛbɔ saa afɔdeɛ yi na asɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani. <verse eid="NUM 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 15:11"/>Yei ne mmara a ɛka nantwie, odwennini, odwammaa anaa abirekyie ba a wɔde bɔ afɔdeɛ ho. <verse eid="NUM 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 15:12"/>Afɔrebɔdeɛ biara a mo mu biara de bɛkɔ no, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔfa saa ɛkwan yi so.<verse eid="NUM 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 15:13"/>“ ‘Ɛsɛ sɛ Israelfoɔ ne ahɔhoɔ a wɔne mo teɛ a wɔpɛ sɛ wɔfa ogya afɔrebɔ so sɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani no nyinaa di saa mmara yi so. <verse eid="NUM 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 15:14"/>Na sɛ ahɔhoɔ a wɔte mo mu no pɛ sɛ wɔbɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ ma ɛsɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani a, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔfa saa ɛkwan korɔ no ara so. <verse eid="NUM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 15:15"/>Mmara no wɔ hɔ ma mo nyinaa—ɔmanfoɔ ne ahɔhoɔ; na ɛyɛ nokorɛ a ɛtim hɔ daa firi awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ so kɔsi awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ so sɛ wɔn nyinaa yɛ pɛ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim. <verse eid="NUM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 15:16"/>Mmara baako na ɛwɔ hɔ ma mo nyinaa.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 15:17"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose saa ɛberɛ no sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 15:18"/>“Ka kyerɛ Israelfoɔ no sɛ, sɛ wɔduru asase a mede rebɛma wɔn no so <verse eid="NUM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 15:19"/>na wɔdi asase no so aduane a, wɔmfa bi mmɔ afɔdeɛ mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. <verse eid="NUM 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 15:20"/>Atokoɔ a mobɛyam a ɛdi ɛkan no, momfa nto ɔfam nto nkyɛn sɛ akyɛdeɛ sɛdeɛ moyɛ atokoɔ otwakane no wɔ ayuporobea no. <verse eid="NUM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 15:21"/>Ɛfiri awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ a ɛbɛba no, ɛsɛ sɛ mode saa afɔdeɛ a ɛfiri mo aduane a ɛdi ɛkan a moanya mu yi ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.<verse eid="NUM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɔne A Wɔanhyɛ Da Anyɛ Afɔrebɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 15:22"/>“ ‘Sɛ mo mu bi firi awerɛfirie mu bu saa mmara a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nam Mose so de ama mo yi so, <verse eid="NUM 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 15:23"/>na sɛ daakye mo asefoɔ bu mmara ahodoɔ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nam Mose so de ama mo yi so, <verse eid="NUM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 15:24"/>na sɛ wɔfom awerɛfirie mu a nnipa no nnim a, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde aduane afɔrebɔdeɛ ne ɔnom afɔrebɔdeɛ ne ɔpapo a wɔde no bɛbɔ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ ka ho ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. <verse eid="NUM 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 15:25"/>Na ɔsɔfoɔ no ayɛ mpatadeɛ ama Israelfoɔ nyinaa na wɔde wɔn bɔne akyɛ wɔn; ɛfiri sɛ, ɛyɛ mfomsoɔ, na wɔnam ɔhyeɛ afɔrebɔ so abɔ afɔdeɛ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim a wɔn bɔne afɔrebɔdeɛ ka ho. <verse eid="NUM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 15:26"/>Wɔde nnipa no nyinaa a ahɔhoɔ a wɔte wɔn mu ka ho no bɔne bɛkyɛ wɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔmanfoɔ no nyinaa na wɔyɛɛ mfomsoɔ a wɔanhyɛ da; na wɔde akyɛ wɔn nyinaa.<verse eid="NUM 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 15:27"/>“ ‘Sɛ obi yɛ mfomsoɔ awerɛfirie mu a, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔde abirekyibereɛ ba a wadi afe bɛbɔ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ <verse eid="NUM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 15:28"/>na ɔsɔfoɔ no ayɛ mpatadeɛ ama no wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim na wɔde ne bɔne akyɛ no. <verse eid="NUM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 15:29"/>Saa mmara yi wɔ hɔ ma Israelfoɔ ne ananafoɔ a wɔte mu mu no.<verse eid="NUM 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 15:30"/>“ ‘Na sɛ obi boapa yɛ mfomsoɔ a, sɛ ɔyɛ Israelni anaa ɔnanani no, ɔgu <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din ho fi, enti wɔbɛyi no afiri nnipa no mu. <verse eid="NUM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 15:31"/>Mperɛ dodoɔ a wɔabu <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm animtiaa na wɔboapa abu <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mmara so no, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔyi no firi nnipa no mu na ne bɔne gu ne tiri so.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Homeda Sobu, Ɛho Asotwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 15:32"/>Ɛda bi a Israelfoɔ no wɔ ɛserɛ so no, wɔkyeree wɔn mu baako sɛ ɔrebubu mmabaa homeda. <verse eid="NUM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 15:33"/>Wɔkyeree no de no kɔɔ Mose ne Aaron ne atemmufoɔ bi anim. <verse eid="NUM 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 15:34"/>Wɔde no too afiase kɔsii sɛ wɔhunuu Awurade adwene a ɔwɔ wɔ saa onipa no ho. <verse eid="NUM 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 15:35"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, “Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔkum saa onipa no. Nnipa no nyinaa nsi no aboɔ wɔ atenaeɛ no akyi baabi.” <verse eid="NUM 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 15:36"/>Enti wɔde no kɔɔ atenaeɛ no akyi baabi kɔsii no aboɔ sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛeɛ no.<verse eid="NUM 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 15:37"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 15:38"/>“Ka kyerɛ Israelfoɔ na wɔmma biribi nsensɛne wɔn ntadeɛ ano mfiri awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ so nkɔsi awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ so a ɛbɛyɛ mmara a ɛtim hɔ daa na wɔmfa ahoma tuntum nkyekyere sɛ nkaeɛ adeɛ mfam ntadeɛ ano. <verse eid="NUM 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 15:39"/>Saa mmara yi botaeɛ ne sɛ, ɛberɛ biara a mobɛhunu saa adeɛ yi no, mobɛkae <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mmara a wɔahyɛ mo no, na moadi nʼapɛdeɛ so, na moamfa mo ankasa mo akwan sɛdeɛ na moyɛ de som anyame afoforɔ no. <verse eid="NUM 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 15:40"/>Ɛbɛkae mo ama moayɛ kronkron ama Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="NUM 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 15:41"/>Mene <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn a mede mo firi Misraim asase so baeɛ no. Aane, mene <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn.”<verse eid="NUM 15:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="NUM 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Kora Atuateɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 16:1"/>Ɛda koro bi Kora, Ishar a ɔyɛ Lewi babarima Kohat aseni ne Datan ne Abiram a wɔyɛ Eliab mmammarima ne On a ɔyɛ Pelet babarima a wɔn baasa no firi Ruben abusuakuo mu bɔɔ pɔ <verse eid="NUM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 16:2"/>tiaa Mose. Na mpanimfoɔ atitire ahanu aduonum a wɔn nyinaa fra agyinatukuo no mu no ka ho. <verse eid="NUM 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 16:3"/>Wɔkɔɔ Mose ne Aaron hɔ kɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ. “Mo ahomasoɔ no amee yɛn; monnyɛ kronn nsene obiara. <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na wayi obiara a ɔwɔ Israel ha na ɔka yɛn nyinaa ho. Adɛn enti na moma mo ho so sene obiara wɔ ɛberɛ a yɛn nyinaa yɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mma?”<verse eid="NUM 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 16:4"/>Mose tee saa asɛm yi no, ɔde nʼanim butuu fam. <verse eid="NUM 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 16:5"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ Kora ne wɔn a wɔka ne ho no sɛ, “Anɔpa, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛkyerɛ mo wɔn a wɔyɛ ne dea ne deɛ ɔyɛ kronkron ne deɛ wɔayi no sɛ ne ɔsɔfoɔ. <verse eid="NUM 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 16:6"/>Deɛ ɛsɛ sɛ moyɛ nie: Wo, Kora, ne wɔn a wɔka wo ho, ɔkyena momfa aduhwamhyeɛ nkukuo <verse eid="NUM 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 16:7"/>na monhye aduhwam wɔ mu wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim. Na yɛbɛhunu deɛ Awurade ayi no sɛ ne kronkronni. Afei deɛ, Lewifoɔ moayɛ ama aboro so.”<verse eid="NUM 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 16:8"/>Mose sane bisaa Kora sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 16:9"/>“Yi a Israel Onyankopɔn ayi wo afiri nnipa bebree mu ama woabɛn no pɛɛ no, a woyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan mu adwuma, na wotumi gyina nnipa anim yɛ asɔfodwuma no yɛ wo ade kumaa? <verse eid="NUM 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 16:10"/>Ɛnyɛ wo anisɔ sɛ ɔde saa adwuma yi ahyɛ Lewifoɔ nko ara nsa? Afei deɛ, woagyina pintinn sɛ woregye asɔfodwuma no ayɛ? <verse eid="NUM 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 16:11"/>Deɛ worehwehwɛ ara ne no! Ɛno enti na woreyɛ dɔm atia <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. Na ɛdeɛn na Aaron ayɛ a wompɛ?”<verse eid="NUM 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 16:12"/>Afei Mose frɛɛ Eliab mmammarima Datan ne Abiram, nanso wɔankɔ. <verse eid="NUM 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 16:13"/>Wɔkaa sɛ, “Wosusu sɛ ɛyɛ asɛnketewa sɛ wode yɛn firi yɛn asase pa Misraim so de yɛn aba ɛserɛ so sɛ worebɛkum yɛn, na afei, wopɛ sɛ wodi yɛn so ɔhene? <verse eid="NUM 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 16:14"/>Afei, womfaa yɛn mmaa asase pa a wohyɛɛ yɛn ho bɔ no so, ɛnna nso wommaa yɛn asase biara a yɛnyɛ so adwuma. Hwan na worepɛ no abu no kwasea? Yɛremma”.<verse eid="NUM 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 16:15"/>Mose bo fuiɛ na ɔka kyerɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛ, “Nnye wɔn afɔrebɔdeɛ biara! Menwiaa wɔn afunumu baako mpo na menyɛɛ wɔn mu biara bɔne bi.”<verse eid="NUM 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 16:16"/>Mose ka kyerɛɛ Kora sɛ, “Ɔkyena wo ne wo nnamfonom nyinaa mmra <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim wɔ ha. Aaron nso bɛba ha bi. <verse eid="NUM 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 16:17"/>Monkae na momfa mo aduhwamhyeɛ nkukuo a aduhwam gu so mmra. Obiara mfa aduhwamhyeɛ kukuo mmra. Ne nyinaa dodoɔ yɛ ahanu aduonum, na momfa mmrɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. Na Aaron nso de ne deɛ bɛba ha bi.” <verse eid="NUM 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 16:18"/>Enti wɔyɛɛ saa. Wɔde wɔn aduhwamhyeɛ nkukuo baeɛ. Wɔsɔɔ ano de aduhwam guu so na wɔne Mose ne Aaron bɛgyinagyinaa Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no ano. <verse eid="NUM 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 16:19"/>Na Kora ahwanyane ɔman no nyinaa atia Mose ne Aaron enti, na wɔn nyinaa aboa wɔn ho ano rehwɛ. Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de animuonyam baa nnipa no nyinaa so <verse eid="NUM 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 16:20"/>na Awurade ka kyerɛɛ Mose ne Aaron sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 16:21"/>“Montwe mo ho mfiri saa nnipa yi ho na manya ɛkwan asɛe wɔn ntɛm.”<verse eid="NUM 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 16:22"/>Nanso, Mose ne Aaron de wɔn anim butubutuu fam wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim. Wɔsrɛɛ sɛ, “Ao, Onyankopɔn, amansan nyinaa Onyankopɔn, sɛ onipa baako yɛ bɔne a, na ɛsɛ sɛ wo bo fu nnipa no nyinaa?”<verse eid="NUM 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 16:23"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 16:24"/>“Ɛnneɛ ka kyerɛ nnipa no na wɔmfiri Kora, Datan ne Abiram ntomadan no mu.”<verse eid="NUM 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 16:25"/>Enti, Mose yɛɛ ntɛm kɔɔ Datan ne Abiram ntomadan no mu a Israel mpanimfoɔ ahanu aduonum di nʼakyi. Ɔka kyerɛɛ nnipa no sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 16:26"/>“Ntɛm, momfiri saa nnipabɔnefoɔ yi ntomadan mu na mommfa mo nsa nka wɔn biribiara. Sɛ moyɛ saa a, wɔde mo bɛka wɔn bɔne a wɔayɛ no ho na wɔbɛsɛe mo ne wɔn nyinaa.” <verse eid="NUM 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 16:27"/>Enti, nnipa no firii Kora, Datan ne Abiram ntomadan no mu kɔgyinagyinaa akyire. Ɛnna Datan ne Abiram nso ne wɔn yerenom ne wɔn mma bɛgyinagyinaa wɔn ntomadan no akwan ano.<verse eid="NUM 16:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 16:28"/>Mose kaa sɛ, “Ɛnam yei so bɛma moahunu sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔsomaa me sɛ menyɛ deɛ mayɛ yi nyinaa. Ɛnyɛ me ara me tumi mu na mefiri yɛɛ saa. <verse eid="NUM 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 16:29"/>Sɛ owuo nko ara na ɛbɛto saa nnipa yi, anaa sɛ wɔhunu deɛ ɛtaa ba nnipa so nko ara a, na ɛnyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na wasoma me. <verse eid="NUM 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 16:30"/>Na sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nam anwanwakwan so pae asase mu ma emu bue na ɛmene wɔn ne wɔn ahodeɛ na sɛ wɔkɔ asamando anikann a, ɛbɛma moahunu sɛ, saa nnipa yi bu Awurade animtia.”<verse eid="NUM 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 16:31"/>Wankasa anwie koraa, asase a ɛwɔ wɔn ase no mu paee prɛko pɛ, <verse eid="NUM 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 16:32"/>na ɛmenee wɔn ne wɔn ntomadan, wɔn abusuafoɔ, wɔn nnamfonom a na wɔgyinagyina wɔn ho ne wɔn agyapadeɛ nyinaa. <verse eid="NUM 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 16:33"/>Enti, wɔwuraa asase mu anikann kɔɔ asamando na asase no sane ka too mu ma wɔyeraeɛ. <verse eid="NUM 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 16:34"/>Israelfoɔ nyinaa de nteateamu dwaneeɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, “Nna wɔsuro sɛ asase no bɛmene wɔn nso!”<verse eid="NUM 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 16:35"/>Afei, ogya firi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn bɛhyee nnipa ahanu aduonum a na wɔrehye aduhwam no nyinaa.<verse eid="NUM 16:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 16:36"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 16:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 16:37"/>“Ka kyerɛ ɔsɔfoɔ Aaron babarima Eleasa sɛ ɔnyi aduhwamhyeɛ nkukuo no mfiri ogya no mu, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛyɛ kronkron, na ɔnyi gyasramma no <verse eid="NUM 16:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 16:38"/>mfiri saa nnipa a wɔayɛ bɔne awu no aduhwamhyeɛ nkukuo no aseɛ. Ɔbɛboro aduhwamhyeɛ nkukuo no ama ayɛ trawa na ɔde akata afɔrebukyia no so. Saa aduhwamhyeɛ nkukuo yi yɛ kronkron, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔde adi dwuma wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim. Na afɔrebukyia no nkatasoɔ yi bɛyɛ kɔkɔbɔ ama Israelfoɔ.”<verse eid="NUM 16:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 16:39"/>Enti, ɔsɔfoɔ Eleasa faa aduhwamhyeɛ nkukuo ahanu aduonum no na ɔboro ma ɛyɛɛ ntrawa na ɔde kataa afɔrebukyia no so, <verse eid="NUM 16:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 16:40"/>na Israelfoɔ no nam so akae sɛ obiara a wɔmmaa no ho kwan anaa ɔmfiri Aaron ase no, ɔnni ho kwan sɛ ɔba <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim bɛhye aduhwam. Sɛ ɔyɛ saa a, asɛm a ɛtoo Kora ne nʼahokafoɔ no bi bɛto no. Sei na Mose yɛɛ deɛ Awurade ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ ɔnyɛ no.<verse eid="NUM 16:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 16:41"/>Adeɛ kyee anɔpa no, nnipa no nyinaa firii aseɛ nwiinwii tiaa Mose ne Aaron sɛ, “Moakum <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkurɔfoɔ.”<verse eid="NUM 16:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 16:42"/>Ankyɛre koraa, nnipa no nyinaa boaa wɔn ho ano. Wɔgu so rehwɛ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no, prɛko pɛ, omununkum no pueeɛ ma wɔhunuu <char style="nd">Awurade</char> animuonyam nwanwaso no. <verse eid="NUM 16:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 16:43"/>Mose ne Aaron bɛgyinaa Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no kwan ano, <verse eid="NUM 16:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 16:44"/>na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 16:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 16:45"/>“Twe wo ho firi saa nnipa yi mu na matumi asɛe wɔn prɛko pɛ.” Nanso, Mose ne Aaron de wɔn anim butubutuu fam wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim.<verse eid="NUM 16:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 16:46"/>Na Mose ka kyerɛɛ Aaron sɛ, “Ntɛm, fa aduhwamhyeɛ kukuo no na yi ogya firi afɔrebukyia no so gu mu. Fa aduhwam gu so na fa fa nnipa no mu ntɛm so fa kɔyɛ mpatadeɛ ma wɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuo aduru wɔn so. Ɔyaredɔm no afiri aseɛ.” <verse eid="NUM 16:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 16:47"/>Aaron yɛɛ deɛ Mose hyɛɛ no sɛ ɔnyɛ no, na ɔtuu mmirika faa nnipa no mu. Na ɔyaredɔm no aba ampa, na ɔhyee aduhwam no de yɛɛ mpatadeɛ maa wɔn. <verse eid="NUM 16:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 16:48"/>Na ɔgyinaa ateasefoɔ ne awufoɔ ntam, na ɔyaredɔm no gyaeeɛ, <verse eid="NUM 16:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 16:49"/>nanso, na nnipa mpem dunan ne ahanson awuwu dada abɛka wɔn a wɔne Kora wuwuiɛ ɛda a ɛdi animu no ho. <verse eid="NUM 16:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 16:50"/>Ɔyaredɔm no gyaeeɛ no, Aaron sane kɔɔ Mose nkyɛn wɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no ano.<verse eid="NUM 16:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="NUM 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Aaron Poma Fefɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 17:1"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 17:2"/>“Ka kyerɛ Israelfoɔ no sɛ, abusua biara ɔdaanoni no ntwa poma na ɔntwerɛ ne din wɔ ho. <verse eid="NUM 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 17:3"/>Aaron din na wɔbɛtwerɛ agu Lewi abusuakuo poma no ho. <verse eid="NUM 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 17:4"/>Momfa mpoma yi ngu Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no mu ahyiaeɛm wɔ baabi a mehyia mo wɔ adaka no anim hɔ no. <verse eid="NUM 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 17:5"/>Menam mpoma yi so bɛkyerɛ onipa a mɛyi no no, na ne poma no ho bɛfefɛ! Ɛno akyi, anwiinwii a wɔnwiinwii tia wo no nyinaa to bɛtwa.”<verse eid="NUM 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 17:6"/>Enti, Mose hyɛɛ saa mmara yi maa nnipa no maa ahemfo dumienu no a Aaron ka wɔn ho de wɔn mpoma brɛɛ no. <verse eid="NUM 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 17:7"/>Ɔde guu <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim wɔ Adanseɛ Ntomadan no mu hɔ.<verse eid="NUM 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 17:8"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ a ɔkɔɔ mu no, ɔhunuu sɛ Aaron poma a ɛwɔ hɔ ma Lewi abusuakuo no afefɛ ayɛ frɔmm, aso aba a ɛsensɛn so. <verse eid="NUM 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 17:9"/>Ɛberɛ a Mose de firii <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hɔ baeɛ sɛ ɔde rebɛkyerɛ nkurɔfoɔ no, wɔhunuiɛ no, wɔn ho dwirii wɔn. Afei, obiara gyee ne poma, gye Aaron nko.<verse eid="NUM 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 17:10"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ ɔmfa Aaron poma no nto adaka no ho pɛɛ na ɔmfa nkae saa adɔnyɛ no. Na ɛsɛ sɛ ɔde ba bɛkyerɛ nnipa no bio na sɛ anwiinwii bi wɔ hɔ a ɛtia Aaron tumi a, ɛbɛsi amanehunu foforɔ a anka ɛbɛba nnipa no so no ano. <verse eid="NUM 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 17:11"/>Enti, Mose yɛɛ deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ no sɛ ɔnyɛ no.<verse eid="NUM 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 17:12"/>Nanso Israelfoɔ no kɔɔ so nwiinwiiɛ sɛ, “Yɛyɛ teaseawuo. <verse eid="NUM 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 17:13"/>Obiara a ɔbɛbɛn <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no ho no wu. Ɛsɛ sɛ yɛn nyinaa ase hye anaa?”<verse eid="NUM 17:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="NUM 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Asɔfoɔ Ne Lewifoɔ Asɛdeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 18:1"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kasa kyerɛɛ Aaron sɛ, “Wo, wo mmammarima ne wʼabusuafoɔ a wɔfiri Lewi abusuakuo mu no, mfomsoɔ biara a ɛfa kronkronbea hɔ no ho asodie bɛda mo so. Na sɛ biribi ankɔ so yie wɔ asɔfodwuma no mu a, wɔbɛbisa wo ne wo mmammarima ho asɛm. <verse eid="NUM 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 18:2"/>Fa wo nkurɔfoɔ a wɔwɔ Lewi abusuakuo no mu ma wɔmmoa wo mmammarima wɔ dwumadie kronkron no a wɔyɛ no Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no anim. <verse eid="NUM 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 18:3"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ Lewifoɔ no hwɛ yie na wɔansɔ biribiara a ɛyɛ kronkron wɔ afɔrebukyia no so mu. Sɛ wɔyɛ saa a, mɛsɛe wo ne wɔn. <verse eid="NUM 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 18:4"/>Obiara a ɔmfiri Lewi abusua mu nni ho kwan sɛ ɔboa wo ɛkwan biara so.<verse eid="NUM 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 18:5"/>“Kae sɛ asɔfoɔ no nko ara na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔdi dwuma a ɛho te wɔ kronkronbea hɔ ne afɔrebukyia no so. Sɛ wodi saa mmara yi so a, Onyankopɔn abufuo no remma Israelfoɔ no so bio sɛ wɔabu mmara yi so. <verse eid="NUM 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 18:6"/>Meka bio sɛ, Lewifoɔ a wɔyɛ wo nkurɔfoɔ no na wɔmmoa wo wɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no mu dwumadie no. Wɔyɛ akyɛdeɛ firi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hɔ ma wo. <verse eid="NUM 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 18:7"/>Nanso, wo ne wo mmammarima asɔfoɔ no ankasa na mobɛdi dwuma a ɛho te wɔ afɔrebukyia no so ne deɛ ɛwɔ ntwamutam no mu, na asɔfodwuma no deɛ, ɛyɛ mo ara mo dom akyɛdeɛ dwumadie. Onipa foforɔ biara a ɔbɛyɛ nʼadwene sɛ ɔbɛdi dwuma no bi no bɛwu.”<verse eid="NUM 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 18:8"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sane ka kyerɛɛ Aaron sɛ: “Mede akyɛdeɛ a nkurɔfoɔ de abrɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no nyinaa ama asɔfoɔ no; saa akyɛdeɛ yi a wɔhim no Awurade anim nam so de kyɛɛ no wɔ afɔrebukyia no anim no no, daa daa mmara enti, ɛyɛ mo ne mo mmammarima dea. <verse eid="NUM 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 18:9"/>Aduane afɔrebɔ, bɔne afɔrebɔ ne afɔbuo afɔrebɔ nyinaa yɛ mo dea, agye emu bi a wɔhye no wɔ afɔrebukyia so de kyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no nko ara. Yeinom nyinaa yɛ afɔrebɔdeɛ a ɛyɛ kronkron pa ara. <verse eid="NUM 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 18:10"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔdi no baabi a ɛyɛ kronkron pa ara. Na mmarima nko ara na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔdie.<verse eid="NUM 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 18:11"/>“Akyɛdeɛ afoforɔ a wɔnam him a wɔbɛhim wɔ afɔrebukyia no so de bɛkyɛ me no yɛ wo ne wʼabusuafoɔ, wo mmammarima ne wo mmammaa nyinaa dea. Na wʼabusuafoɔ nyinaa tumi di bi, agye obi a saa ɛberɛ no na ne ho nte.<verse eid="NUM 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 18:12"/>“Otwa berɛ a ɛdi ɛkan mu akyɛdeɛ a nnipa no de bɛba sɛ afɔrebɔdeɛ a wɔde rebrɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no a ɛyɛ ngo pa, bobesa pa, aburoo ne afudeɛ biara no, ne nyinaa yɛ mo dea. <verse eid="NUM 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 18:13"/>Sɛ mo abusuafoɔ hwɛ na wɔn ho te a, wɔtumi di yeinom nyinaa bi.<verse eid="NUM 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 18:14"/>“Deɛ wɔde bɛma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> biara yɛ mo dea. <verse eid="NUM 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 18:15"/>Israelfoɔ abakan ne wɔn mmoa nyinaa abakan a wɔde brɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛ mo dea. Nanso mmoa a memmaa mo ɛkwan sɛ wɔnwe wɔn nam no deɛ, monnnye wɔn abakan. Na mmom, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔtua sika kakra de si abakan biara anan. <verse eid="NUM 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 18:16"/>Sɛ abakan no di bosome a, na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde ɔgye boɔ a ɛyɛ dwetɛ gram aduonum nsia sɛdeɛ kronkronbea hɔ nkariboɔ a ɛyɛ gram dubaako ne nkyemu anum mu baako no teɛ no ba.<verse eid="NUM 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 18:17"/>“Nanso anantwie, nnwan ne mpɔnkye mmakan deɛ, ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔgye wɔn. Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde wɔn bɔ afɔdeɛ ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. Wɔn mogya na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde pete afɔrebukyia no so na wɔhye wɔn sradeɛ no sɛ ogya afɔdeɛ. Ɛyɛ adeɛ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani sɔ. <verse eid="NUM 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 18:18"/>Saa mmoa yi nyinaa ɛnam bɛyɛ mo dea. Ne yan ne ne srɛ nifa a wɔbɛhim no afɔrebukyia no anim de akyerɛ sɛ wɔde ama <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no nso, mobɛfa. <verse eid="NUM 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 18:19"/>Mede afɔrebɔdeɛ a Israelfoɔ de bɛbrɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> a wɔbɛhim no no nyinaa ma mo ne mo abusuafoɔ. Mo ne mo abusuafoɔ mfa na monni. Yei yɛ bɔhyɛ a ɛda mo ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne mo asefoɔ ntam daa nyinaa.”<verse eid="NUM 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 18:20"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Aaron sɛ, “Mo asɔfoɔ no nso, ɛnsɛ sɛ mopɛ agyapadeɛ ne akatua foforɔ biara. Na me ara na me ho hia mo.<verse eid="NUM 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 18:21"/>“Na Lewi abusuakuo deɛ, wɔfiri Israel asase so ho adwumadeɛ ntotosoɔ dudu no mu na ɛbɛtua wɔn ka. <verse eid="NUM 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 18:22"/>Ɛfiri ɛnnɛ rekorɔ, Israelfoɔ a wɔnyɛ asɔfoɔ ne Lewifoɔ no nni ho kwan sɛ wɔkɔ kronkron mu kronkron hɔ. Wɔyɛ saa a, wɔbɛbu wɔn fɔ na wɔawuwu. <verse eid="NUM 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 18:23"/>Lewifoɔ no nko ara na wɔbɛyɛ adwuma wɔ hɔ. Sɛ wɔanyɛ a, wɔbɛbu wɔn fɔ. Ɛyɛ mmara a ɛda hɔ afebɔɔ sɛ ɛnsɛ sɛ Lewini biara nya agyapadeɛ wɔ Israelman mu. <verse eid="NUM 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 18:24"/>Mmom, ntotosoɔ dudu a ɔmanfoɔ de ba ma wɔhim no afɔrebukyia no anim de ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no na ɛsɛ sɛ Lewifoɔ no fa. Yei yɛ agyapadeɛ, enti ɛho nhia sɛ wɔpɛ agyapadeɛ foforɔ bi bio.”<verse eid="NUM 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 18:25"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sane ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 18:26"/>“Ka kyerɛ Lewifoɔ no sɛ, ntotosoɔ dudu a wɔnya no, wɔmfa nkyɛmu edu mu baako mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. Ɛbɛyɛ ntotosoɔ dudu mu ntotosoɔ dudu a wɔnam him a wɔbɛhim no afɔrebukyia no anim de ama <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no so. <verse eid="NUM 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 18:27"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛgye no sɛ mo afɔrebɔdeɛ a ɛdi ɛkan a ɛyɛ aduane ne nsã a mode rema no sɛdeɛ ɛfiri mo ara mo agyapadeɛ mu. <verse eid="NUM 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 18:28"/>Saa ntotosoɔ dudu mu ntotosoɔ dudu yi a mobɛnya yi mu na mode bɛma ɔsɔfoɔ Aaron sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kyɛfa. <verse eid="NUM 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 18:29"/>Biribiara a wɔde bɛma mo no, momfa emu deɛ ɛyɛ pa ara na ɛyɛ kronkron no mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.<verse eid="NUM 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 18:30"/>“Na wɔbɛfa no sɛ deɛ ɛfiri mo ankasa mo ayuporobea ne mo nsakyibea hɔ. <verse eid="NUM 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 18:31"/>Aaron ne ne mmammarima ne nʼabusuafoɔ bɛtumi adi no wɔ wɔn fie anaa baabiara a wɔpɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛyɛ wɔn adwuma a wɔyɛ no wɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan mu no ho akatua. <verse eid="NUM 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 18:32"/>Mo Lewifoɔ no, sɛ mogye <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ntotosoɔ dudu no na mode emu nkyɛmu edu a ɛsɔ ani mu baako ma asɔfoɔ no a, monni afɔbuo biara. Nanso, monhwɛ yie na akyɛdeɛ kronkron a Israelfoɔ de aba no, moammu no ade teta bi. Sɛ moyɛ saa a, mobɛwuwu.”<verse eid="NUM 18:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="NUM 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Ahodwira Nsuo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 19:1"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose ne Aaron sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 19:2"/>“Me som ho mmara foforɔ nie: Ka kyerɛ Israelfoɔ sɛ wɔmfa nantwie ba bereɛ kɔkɔɔ a ɔnnii dɛm na ɔntwee nneɛma da mmrɛ me. <verse eid="NUM 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 19:3"/>Momfa no mma ɔsɔfoɔ Eleasa na ɔde no bɛkɔ atenaeɛ no akyi baabi na obi akum no ɛberɛ a ɔno ara nso rehwɛ. <verse eid="NUM 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 19:4"/>Eleasa de ne nsateaa bɛbɔ mogya no mu na ɔde apete Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no anim mprɛnson. <verse eid="NUM 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 19:5"/>Afei, ɔbɛhwɛ ama obi ahye nantwie ba no. Ɔbɛhye ne ho nwoma, ne nam, ne mogya ne nʼagyanan nyinaa. <verse eid="NUM 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 19:6"/>Na ɛgu so rehye no, Eleasa bɛfa odum dua ne hisope mman ne asaawa kɔkɔɔ na wato agu nneɛma a wɔrehye no mu. <verse eid="NUM 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 19:7"/>Yei akyi, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔsi ne ntadeɛ na ɔdware na afei ɔkɔ atenaeɛ hɔ a wɔfa no sɛ ne ho agu fi kɔsi anwummerɛ. <verse eid="NUM 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 19:8"/>Onipa a ɔhyee aboa no nso, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔsi ne ntadeɛ, na ɔdware, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔno nso ho agu fi kɔsi anwummerɛ.<verse eid="NUM 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 19:9"/>“Afei, obi a ne ho nguu fi no bɛsesa aboa a wɔhyee no no nsõ de akɔ atenaeɛ no akyi baabi a ɛhɔ yɛ kronkron na wakɔkora no wɔ hɔ. Israelfoɔ no de bɛgu wɔn nsuo a wɔde dwira wɔn ho de pam wɔn bɔne no mu. <verse eid="NUM 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 19:10"/>Onipa a ɔbɛboaboa nantwie ba no nsõ no ano no nso, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔsi ne ntadeɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, ne ho gu fi kɔsi anwummerɛ; yei yɛ mmara a ɛwɔ hɔ daa a ɛho wɔ mfasoɔ ma Israelfoɔ no ne ahɔhoɔ a wɔte wɔn mu no nyinaa.<verse eid="NUM 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 19:11"/>“Obiara a ɔbɛsɔ efunu mu no ho bɛgu fi nnanson. <verse eid="NUM 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 19:12"/>Na ne nnansa ne ne nnanson so no, ɔde nsuo a wɔde dwira wɔn ho no adwira ne ho ama ne ho ate. Sɛ ne nnansa so wanyɛ yei a, ne nnanson akyi nyinaa na ne ho agu fi. <verse eid="NUM 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 19:13"/>Wɔn a wɔsɔ efunu mu na wɔnnwira wɔn ho sɛdeɛ makyerɛ yi no, wɔgu <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan ho fi, na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔyi saa nnipa no firi Israelfoɔ mu. Esiane sɛ wɔamfa ahodwira nsuo no bi ampete wɔn ho no enti, wɔn ho agu fi ara.<verse eid="NUM 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 19:14"/>“Sɛ obi wu wɔ ntomadan mu a, ɛho mmara nie: Obiara a ɔbɛwura saa ntomadan no mu ne wɔn a wɔwɔ mu dada ansa na onipa no rewuo no nyinaa ho gu fi nnanson. <verse eid="NUM 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 19:15"/>Adeɛ biara a wɔde biribi gu mu a ɛnni mmuasoɔ no nso ho gu fi.<verse eid="NUM 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 19:16"/>“Sɛ obi a ɔwɔ abɔntene de ne nsa ka obi a ɔtɔɔ wɔ akofena ano funu anaa sɛ obi a ɔnyɛ ɔtɔfoɔ funu, anaasɛ obi de ne nsa ka onipa dompe anaa damena a, ne ho bɛgu fi nnanson.<verse eid="NUM 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 19:17"/>“Ansa na ne ho bɛte bio no, gye sɛ wɔde nantwie ba kɔkɔɔ no nsõ a wɔde bɔ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ no fra nsuo a wɔde agu asuhina mu. <verse eid="NUM 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 19:18"/>Na obi a ne ho te afa hisope mman na ɔde abɔ nsuo no mu de apete ntomadan no so ne nkuku ne nkaka a ɛwɔ ntomadan no mu no nso so ne obiara a na ɔwɔ ntomadan no mu a ne ho agu fi no so. Saa ara nso na obi a ɔsɔɔ dompe mu anaa ɔsɔɔ obi a wɔakum no anaa deɛ ɔde ne ho aka damena no nso, wɔdwira ne ho. <verse eid="NUM 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 19:19"/>Wɔyɛ yei ne nnansa ne ne nnanson so. Na deɛ ne ho agu fi no nso, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔsi ne ntadeɛ na ɔdware, na ɛduru anwummerɛ a, afei ne ho ate. <verse eid="NUM 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 19:20"/>Nanso, obiara a ne ho agu fi na wannwira ne ho no, wɔbɛtwa no asuo, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔagu <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kronkronbea hɔ ho fi. Ɛfiri sɛ wɔmfaa nsuo a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde pete ne so no mpetee ne so no enti, ne ho agu fi. <verse eid="NUM 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 19:21"/>Yei yɛ mmara a ɛwɔ hɔ afebɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 19:21">“Onipa a ɔbɛtu nsuo no apete no nso, ɛsɛ sɛ akyire no, ɔsi ne ntadeɛ, na obiara a ɔde ne nsa bɛka nsuo no nso ho gu fi kɔsi anwummerɛ. <verse eid="NUM 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 19:22"/>Na biribiara a obi a ne ho agu fi no bɛsɔ mu no nso ho gu fi kɔsi anwummerɛ.”<verse eid="NUM 19:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="NUM 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Nsuo Firi Ɔbotan Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 20:1"/>Israelfoɔ no duruu Sin ɛserɛ so bosome a ɛdi ɛkan no mu. Wɔsisii wɔn ntomadan wɔ Kades, na ɛhɔ na Miriam wuiɛ ma wɔsiee no.<verse eid="NUM 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 20:2"/>Na nsuo a wɔbɛnom nni hɔ enti, nnipa no sɔre tiaa Mose ne Aaron. <verse eid="NUM 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 20:3"/>Nnipa no bɔɔ Mose soboɔ sɛ, “Sɛ yɛne yɛn nuanom wuwuu wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim a anka yɛpɛ. <verse eid="NUM 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 20:4"/>Mode <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔman ne yɛn nnwan ne yɛn anantwie aba ɛserɛ yi so sɛ yɛmmewuwu? <verse eid="NUM 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 20:5"/>Adɛn enti na moyii yɛn firii Misraim de yɛn baa asase bɔne yi so? Borɔdɔma, atokoɔ, bobe ne ateaa nni asase yi so. Nsuo a yɛbɛnom nso nni ha.”<verse eid="NUM 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 20:6"/>Mose ne Aaron sɔre kɔɔ Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no ano de wɔn anim butubutuu fam wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim; na wɔhunuu <char style="nd">Awurade</char> animuonyam. <verse eid="NUM 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 20:7"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 20:8"/>“Momfa Aaron abaa no na wo ne Aaron mfrɛ nnipa no nyinaa. Wɔrehwɛ mo no, kasa kyerɛ ɔbotan a ɛwɔ nohoa no sɛ nsuo mfiri mu mmra. Mobɛnya wɔn nsuo a ɛbɛso wɔne wɔn anantwie afiri ɔbotan no mu!”<verse eid="NUM 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 20:9"/>Mose yɛɛ deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kaeɛ no. Ɔfaa abaa no firii baabi a wɔde asie wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim, <verse eid="NUM 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 20:10"/>na Mose ne Aaron frɛɛ nnipa no nyinaa ma wɔbɛboaa ɔbotan no ho na wɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Adɔnyɛfoɔ, montie! Yɛmma nsuo mfiri saa ɔbotan yi mu mmra anaa?” <verse eid="NUM 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 20:11"/>Afei Mose maa abaa no so de bɔɔ ɔbotan no mprenu maa nsuo bebree firii mu baeɛ maa nnipa no ne wɔn anantwie nomeeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 20:12"/>Nanso, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose ne Aaron sɛ, “Esiane sɛ moante me ho wɔ Israelfoɔ no anim no enti, moremfa wɔn nkɔ asase a mehyɛɛ wɔn ho bɔ no so!”<verse eid="NUM 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 20:13"/>Wɔfrɛɛ beaeɛ hɔ Meriba a aseɛ ne: Adɔnyɛ Nsuo, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛhɔ ne baabi a Israelfoɔ tee <char style="nd">Awurade</char> atua na, ɛhɔ ara nso na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> daa ne ho adi kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ ɔyɛ kronkron.<verse eid="NUM 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Edom Si Israel Ɛkwan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 20:14"/>Ɛberɛ a Mose wɔ Kades no, ɔsomaa nnipa ma wɔkɔɔ Edomhene nkyɛn sɛ wɔnkɔka nkyerɛ no sɛ:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NUM 20:14">“Saa nkra yi firi wʼabusuafoɔ a wɔyɛ Israelfoɔ nkyɛn. Wonim abɛbrɛsɛ a yɛafa mu, <verse eid="NUM 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 20:15"/>sɛdeɛ yɛn agyanom kɔtenaa Misraim. Yɛtenaa hɔ mfeɛ bebree na yɛhunuu amane sɛ Misraimfoɔ nkoa. <verse eid="NUM 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 20:16"/>Nanso, yɛsu frɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no, ɔtiee yɛn na ɔsomaa ɔbɔfoɔ ma ɔbɛyii yɛn firii Misraim.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NUM 20:16">“Seesei yɛwɔ Kades wɔ mo asase hyeɛ so. <verse eid="NUM 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 20:17"/>Yɛsrɛ mo sɛ, momma yɛntwa mu mfa mo ɔman yi mu. Yɛbɛhwɛ yie sɛ yɛremfa mo mfuo ne mo bobe nturo mu. Na mpo, yɛrennom mo abura mu nsuo. Yɛbɛfa ɔhene kwantempɔn so na yɛremfiri so kɔsi sɛ yɛbɛtra mo hyeɛ a ɛwɔ ɛfa nohoa no.”<verse eid="NUM 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 20:18"/>Nanso, Edomhene kaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NUM 20:18">“Mommfa mʼasase so, anyɛ saa a mede akodɔm bɛhyia mo!”<verse eid="NUM 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 20:19"/>Israelfoɔ no buaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NUM 20:19">“Owura, yɛbɛfa tempɔn no so. Sɛ yɛn ayɛmmoa nom mo nsuo a, yɛbɛtua ka. Yɛpɛ sɛ yɛtwam wɔ mo asase so na yɛnni adwemmɔne bi.”<verse eid="NUM 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 20:20"/>Nanso Edomhene buaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NUM 20:20">“Mommfa yɛn asase so!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 20:20">Ɔboaboaa nʼakodɔm ano de wɔn kɔɔ ɛhyeɛ no so. <verse eid="NUM 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 20:21"/>Esiane sɛ Edom amma wɔn ɛkwan amma Israelfoɔ no amfa wɔn ɔman mu no enti, wɔmane faa nkyɛn.<verse eid="NUM 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aaron Owuo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 20:22"/>Wɔfirii Kades kɔɔ Bepɔ Hor so. <verse eid="NUM 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 20:23"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose ne Aaron wɔ Bepɔ Hor a ɛwɔ Edom hyeɛ so sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 20:24"/>“Ɛberɛ aduru sɛ Aaron wuo, na ɔrenkɔ asase a mede ama Israelfoɔ no so bi, ɛfiri sɛ, mo baanu yɛɛ me dɔm wɔ Meriba nsuo no ho. <verse eid="NUM 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 20:25"/>Afei, fa Aaron ne ne babarima Eleasa kɔ Bepɔ Hor so. <verse eid="NUM 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 20:26"/>Ɛhɔ na wobɛyi Aaron asɔfotadeɛ no de ahyɛ ne babarima Eleasa. Ɛhɔ na Aaron bɛwu na watoa nʼagyanom.”<verse eid="NUM 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 20:27"/>Enti, Mose yɛɛ deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ no sɛ ɔnyɛ no. Wɔn baasa nyinaa kɔɔ bepɔ Hor so a nnipa no nyinaa hwɛ wɔn. <verse eid="NUM 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 20:28"/>Wɔduruu bepɔ no apampam no, Mose yii Aaron asɔfotadeɛ no de hyɛɛ ne babarima Eleasa, na Aaron wuu wɔ bepɔ no apampam. Mose ne Eleasa sane wɔn akyi, <verse eid="NUM 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 20:29"/>na wɔbɔɔ nnipa no wu a Aaron awuo no ho amaneɛ no, wɔsuu no adaduasa.<verse eid="NUM 20:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="NUM 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Kanaanfoɔ So Nkonimdie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 21:1"/>Arad ɔhene a ɔyɛ Kanaanni a ɔte Negeb tee sɛ Israelfoɔ nam Atarim ɛkwan so reba. Ɔboaboaa nʼakodɔm ano kɔto hyɛɛ Israelfoɔ no so kyekyeree binom sɛ nneduafoɔ. <verse eid="NUM 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 21:2"/>Afei, Israelfoɔ no kaa ntam kyerɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛ, sɛ ɔbɛboa wɔn ama wɔadi Arad ɔhene ne de dɔm so a, anka wɔbɛgu nkuro akɛseɛ a ɛwɔ hɔ nyinaa. <verse eid="NUM 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 21:3"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> tiee wɔn abisadeɛ no, enti ɔmaa wɔdii Kanaanfoɔ no so; Israelfoɔ no sɛee wɔn ne wɔn nkuro akɛseɛ pasaa. Wɔtoo hɔ edin Horma a aseɛ ne “Ɔsɛeɛ.”<verse eid="NUM 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kɔbere Mfrafraeɛ Ɔwɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 21:4"/>Afei, Israelfoɔ no sane kɔɔ Bepɔ Hor so. Wɔfiri hɔ no, wɔkɔɔ anafoɔ fam ɛkwan a ɛkɔ Ɛpo Kɔkɔɔ no so no so sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, wɔbɛtumi atwa kanko afa Edom ho. Nnipa no aba mu buiɛ. <verse eid="NUM 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 21:5"/>Wɔhyɛɛ aseɛ nwiinwii tiaa Onyankopɔn enti wɔkaa wɔn ahiasɛm kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, “Adɛn enti na woayi yɛn afiri Misraim de yɛn aba sɛ yɛmmɛwuwu ɛserɛ yi so? Aduane a yɛbɛdie nni ha. Nsuo a yɛbɛnom nso nni ha. Mana yi nso deɛ, afono yɛn.”<verse eid="NUM 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 21:6"/>Enti, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> maa awɔ a wɔn ano wɔ borɔ yie kɔkekaa wɔn mu bebree ma wɔwuwuiɛ. <verse eid="NUM 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 21:7"/>Afei, nnipa no baa Mose nkyɛn bɛsrɛɛ sɛ, “Yɛayɛ bɔne, ɛfiri sɛ, yɛakasa atia <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne wo. Bɔ mpaeɛ kyerɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na awɔ no nkɔ.” Mose bɔɔ mpaeɛ maa nnipa no.<verse eid="NUM 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 21:8"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, “Fa kɔbere yɛ saa awɔ yi mu baako sɛso na fa no sɛn poma bi so, na sɛ awɔ no bi ka obi na onii no hwɛ no kɛkɛ a, ɔrenwu.” <verse eid="NUM 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 21:9"/>Enti, Mose yɛɛ ɔwɔ sɛso no; na obiara a ɔwɔ no bi bɛka no no, sɛ ɔpagya nʼani hwɛ no a, ɔnwu.<verse eid="NUM 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Israelfoɔ Kɔ Moab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 21:10"/>Israelfoɔ no firi hɔ no, wɔtoaa wɔn akwantuo no so kɔɔ Obot kɔtenaa hɔ. <verse eid="NUM 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 21:11"/>Afei, wɔtoaa so kɔɔ Iye-Abarim wɔ ɛserɛ so wɔ Moab apueeɛ fam. <verse eid="NUM 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 21:12"/>Wɔfiri hɔ no, wɔtoaa so kɔɔ asuwa Sered Subɔnhwa mu kɔbɔɔ atenaeɛ wɔ hɔ. <verse eid="NUM 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 21:13"/>Afei, wɔtu kɔɔ akyirikyiri fam wɔ Asubɔnten Arnon nkyɛn hɔ baabi a wɔne Amorifoɔ bɔ hyeɛ. Asubɔnten Arnon na ɛyɛ ɛhyeɛ a ɛda Moabfoɔ ne Amorifoɔ ntam. <verse eid="NUM 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 21:14"/>Enti, wɔkaa saa asɛm yi wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akodie nwoma no mu sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:14">asubɔnten Arnon subɔnhwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:14">ne kuro Waheb <verse eid="NUM 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 21:15"/>da Amorifoɔ ne Moabfoɔ ntam.<verse eid="NUM 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 21:16"/>Afei, Israelfoɔ no toaa wɔn akwantuo no so kɔɔ Beer a aseɛ ne “Abura.” Ɛha na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, “Frɛfrɛ nnipa no nyinaa bra na mɛma wɔn nsuo.”<verse eid="NUM 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 21:17"/>Ɛhɔ na Israelfoɔ too dwom sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:17">“Tue Ao, Abura!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:17">To ho dwom!<verse eid="NUM 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 21:18"/>To abura yi ho dwom, mmapɔmma na wɔtuiɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:18">na akunini titii mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:18">wɔde wɔn ahempoma ne wɔn poma.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="NUM 21:18">Afei, Israelfoɔ no firii ɛserɛ no so kɔfaa Matana, <verse eid="NUM 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 21:19"/>Nahaliel ne Bamot. <verse eid="NUM 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 21:20"/>Afei wɔkɔɔ Pisga atifi a ɛwɔ Moab bɔnhwa no mu, baabi a wogyina a wohunu asase tamaa no.<verse eid="NUM 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sihon Ne Og So Nkonimdie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 21:21"/>Afei, Israelfoɔ tuu abɔfoɔ ma wɔde nkra yi kɔmaa Amorifoɔhene Sihon sɛ:<verse eid="NUM 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 21:22"/>“Momma yɛntwa mu mfa mo ɔman yi mu. Yɛbɛfa ɛkwan tempɔn so, na yɛremfiri so kɔsi sɛ yɛbɛtra mo hyeɛ. Yɛrentiatia mo mfudeɛ so, yɛremfa yɛn nsa nka mo bobe nturo, na yɛrennom mo abura mu nsuo.”<verse eid="NUM 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 21:23"/>Nanso ɔhene Sihon ampene so. Na mmom, ɔboaboaa nʼakodɔm ano kɔto hyɛɛ Israelfoɔ so wɔ ɛserɛ so hɔ ne wɔn koo wɔ Yahas. <verse eid="NUM 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 21:24"/>Nanso Israelfoɔ no kunkumm wɔn faa wɔn asase a ɛfiri Asubɔnten Arnon kɔsi asuo Yabok ho toaa so kɔsii Amorifoɔ ahyeɛ so, nanso wɔkɔhyiaa Amon mma ahoɔdenfoɔ bi a wɔakyere sraban enti wɔantumi anko ankɔ wɔn anim bio. <verse eid="NUM 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 21:25"/>Enti Israelfoɔ no faa Amorifoɔ no nkuro akɛseɛ nyinaa a Hesbon kuropɔn ne ne nkuraase nyinaa ka ho tenaa mu. <verse eid="NUM 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 21:26"/>Na Hesbon yɛ Amorifoɔhene Sihon Kuropɔn. Sihon na ɛda bi ɔko tiaa Moabhene faa ne nsase nyinaa bɛsii Asubɔnten Arnon no.<verse eid="NUM 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 21:27"/>Ne sei enti tete, anwensɛm twerɛfoɔ twerɛɛ yei faa ne ho sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:27">“Bra Hesbon, Sihon kuropɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:27">yɛnkyekyere na ɛnsi ne dada mu.<verse eid="NUM 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 21:28"/>“Egya turi firii Hesbon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:28">Ogyaframa firii Sihon ahenkuro mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:28">Ɛhyee Ar kuropɔn a ɛwɔ Moab;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:28">ɛsɛee sodifoɔ a wɔwɔ Arnon mmepɔ so.<verse eid="NUM 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 21:29"/>Ao Moabfoɔ, mosɛeɛ bɛba mu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:29">Wɔawie mo, mo a mosom Kemos!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:29">Kemos agya ne mmammarima sɛ atutenafoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:29">Ne ne mmammaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:29">sɛ Amorifoɔhene Sihon nnommumfoɔ.<verse eid="NUM 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 21:30"/>“Yɛasɛe wɔn pasaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:30">ɛfiri Hesbon tɔnn kɔsi Dibon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:30">Yɛasɛe wɔn ara akɔsi Nofa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:30">De kɔ ara kɔsi Medeba.”<verse eid="NUM 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 21:31"/>Enti Israelfoɔ no tenaa Amorifoɔ asase so.<verse eid="NUM 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 21:32"/>Mose somaa akwansrafoɔ sɛ wɔnkɔsrasra Yaser fa mu hɔ. Ɔde asraafoɔ toaa wɔn, faa wɔn nkuro nyinaa, pamoo Amorifoɔ no. <verse eid="NUM 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 21:33"/>Afei, wɔde wɔn ani kyerɛɛ kuro kɛseɛ Basan, nanso Basanhene Og de nʼasraafoɔ hyiaa wɔn wɔ Edrei.<verse eid="NUM 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 21:34"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ ɔnnsuro na wadi atamfoɔ no so dada. <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sane hyɛɛ Mose nkuran sɛ asɛm a ɛtoo ɔhene Sihon wɔ Hesbon no, saa asɛm korɔ no ara bi na ɛbɛto no.<verse eid="NUM 21:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 21:35"/>Ampa ara, Israelfoɔ dii nkonim na wɔkumm ɔhene Og ne ne mmammarima ne ne nkurɔfoɔ nyinaa a anka wɔn mu baako mpo. Enti Israelfoɔ no tenaa asase no so.<verse eid="NUM 21:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="NUM 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Balak Frɛ Balaam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 22:1"/>Afei, Israelfoɔ no kɔɔ Moab tata so kɔtenaa Asubɔnten Yordan apueeɛ fam a ɛhɔ ne Yeriko di nhwɛanimu no.<verse eid="NUM 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 22:2"/>Sipor babarima Moabhene Balak hunuu deɛ Israelfoɔ ayɛ Amorifoɔ. <verse eid="NUM 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 22:3"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔhunuu Israelfoɔ dodoɔ a wɔwɔ hɔ no, ɔne ne nkurɔfoɔ bɔɔ huboa.<verse eid="NUM 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 22:4"/>Ntɛm ara, wɔne Midian mpanimfoɔ tuu agyina. Wɔkaa sɛ, “Saa dɔm yi bɛwe biribiara a wɔhunu sɛdeɛ nantwie we serɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 22:4">Enti, Moab ɔhene Balak <verse eid="NUM 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 22:5"/>somaa nnipa ma wɔkɔɔ Beor babarima Balaam nkyɛn wɔ Petor a ɛbɛn Asubɔnten Eufrate ho. Ɔsrɛɛ Balaam sɛ ɔmmɛboa no.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NUM 22:5">Ɔkaa sɛ, “Nnipadɔm bi firi Misraim aba. Wɔkata asase ani nyinaa na wɔrehunahuna me. <verse eid="NUM 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 22:6"/>Mɛsrɛ wo, bra na bɛdome wɔn ma me, ɛfiri sɛ wɔdɔɔso dodo. Ebia metumi adi wɔn so nkonim na mapam wɔn afiri asase no so. Na menim nhyira a ɛba wɔn a wohyira wɔn no so, ɛnna menim musuo a ɛba wɔn a wodome wɔn so.”<verse eid="NUM 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 22:7"/>Nnipa a ɔsomaa wɔn no yɛ atitire a wɔfiri Moab ne Midian. Wɔfaa sika sɛ wɔde rekɔtua Balaam ka ama wadome Israelfoɔ. Enti wɔkɔɔ Balaam nkyɛn kɔkaa deɛ ɛhia Balak kyerɛɛ no.<verse eid="NUM 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 22:8"/>Balaam kaa sɛ, “Monna ma adeɛ nkye mo. Adeɛ kye a, deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛkyerɛ me sɛ menyɛ no, mɛka akyerɛ mo.” Enti wɔdaeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 22:9"/>Anadwo no, Onyankopɔn baa Balaam nkyɛn bɛbisaa no sɛ, “Saa nnipa yi yɛ ɛhefoɔ?”<verse eid="NUM 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 22:10"/>Ɔbuaa sɛ, “Wɔfiri Moabhene Balak nkyɛn. <verse eid="NUM 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 22:11"/>Na nnipadɔm bi firi Misraim aba ne hyeɛ so, na ɔpɛ sɛ mekɔ hɔ ntɛm so na mekɔdome wɔn sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, ɔbɛtumi adi wɔn so.”<verse eid="NUM 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 22:12"/>Onyankopɔn ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Nkɔ. Ɛnsɛ sɛ wodome wɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, mahyira wɔn!”<verse eid="NUM 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 22:13"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, anɔpa, Balaam ka kyerɛɛ nnipa no sɛ, “Monsane nkɔ fie! <char style="nd">Awurade</char> rempene mma mennyɛ saa.”<verse eid="NUM 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 22:14"/>Enti, ɔhene Balak ananmusifoɔ no sane wɔn akyi bɛbɔɔ amaneɛ sɛ ɔse ɔremma.<verse eid="NUM 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 22:15"/>Balak sɔ hwɛɛ bio. Saa ɛberɛ no deɛ, ɔsomaa nnipa dodoɔ pa ara a animuonyamfoɔ a wɔkyɛn kane dɔm no fra wɔn mu. <verse eid="NUM 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 22:16"/>Wɔbaa Balaam nkyɛn bɛka kyerɛɛ no sɛ,</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NUM 22:16">“Ɔhene Balak se ɔsrɛ wo sɛ bra. <verse eid="NUM 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 22:17"/>Ɔbɛhyɛ wo animuonyam na sika biara a wɔbɛgye no no nso, ɔbɛtua. Ka sika a wobɛgye! Ɔse, wo deɛ, bra na bɛdome saa nnipa no ma yɛn.”<verse eid="NUM 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 22:18"/>Nanso, Balaam buaa sɛ, “Sɛ ɔma me ahemfie a wɔde dwetɛ ne sikakɔkɔɔ ahyɛ no ma tɔ koraa a, merentumi nyɛ biribiara mmu saa ahyɛdeɛ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> a ɔyɛ me Onyankopɔn no ahyɛ no so. <verse eid="NUM 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 22:19"/>Nanso, monna ha ma adeɛ nkye na yɛnhwɛ sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛka asɛm foforɔ bi aka deɛ waka dada no ho anaa.”<verse eid="NUM 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 22:20"/>Anadwo no, Onyankopɔn ka kyerɛɛ Balaam sɛ, “Sɔre na wo ne saa nnipa no nkɔ na mmom, hwɛ yie na yɛ deɛ mɛkyerɛ wo sɛ yɛ no nko ara.”<verse eid="NUM 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 22:21"/>Adeɛ kyee anɔpa no, ɔhyehyɛɛ nʼafunumu, tenaa ne so ne wɔn hyɛɛ aseɛ kɔeɛ. <verse eid="NUM 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 22:22"/>Nanso, Onyankopɔn bo fuu Balaam ahopere a ɔde kɔeɛ no; enti ɔsomaa ɔsoro <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ kɔgyinaa akwantemfi sɛ ɔnkum no wɔ hɔ. Ɛberɛ a Balaam ne asomfoɔ baanu rekorɔ no, <verse eid="NUM 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 22:23"/>prɛko pɛ, Balaam afunumu no hunuu <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ no sɛ ɔkura sekan gyina ɛkwan no mfimfini. Aboa no kwae faa wiram nanso Balaam kaa ne so sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, ɔbɛfa ɛkwan mu.<verse eid="NUM 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 22:24"/>Baabi a na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ no gyina hɔ no yɛ bobefuo afasuo mmienu ntam. <verse eid="NUM 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 22:25"/>Ɛberɛ a afunumu no hunuu <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ no, ɔde ne ho twee ɔfasuo no ho maa Balaam nan pɛkyɛeɛ. Nanso, Balaam kɔɔ so hwee aboa no bio.<verse eid="NUM 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 22:26"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ no kɔɔ ɛkwan no anafoɔ kɔgyinaa baabi a ɛhɔ kyere pa ara a na afunumu no nnya baabi mfa. <verse eid="NUM 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 22:27"/>Enti, ɔbutuu ɛkwan no mu. Balaam de abufuo kaa aboa no mmaa. <verse eid="NUM 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 22:28"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ afunumu no ma ɔkasaeɛ! Ɔbisaa ne wura no sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn na mayɛ enti a ɛsɛ sɛ wohwe me mprɛnsa?”<verse eid="NUM 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 22:29"/>Balaam nso buaa no sɛ, “Ɛfiri sɛ, woama masɛ ɔkwasea. Na sɛ mekura sekan a, anka mɛkum wo.”<verse eid="NUM 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 22:30"/>Afunumu no nso bisaa no sɛ, “Me ne wo tenaeɛ yi, mayɛ sei pɛn?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 22:30">Ne wura no buaa sɛ, “Dabi.”<verse eid="NUM 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 22:31"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> buee Balaam ani ma ɔhunuu ɔsoro ɔbɔfoɔ no sɛ watwe sekan gyina ɛkwan no mfimfini enti ɔkɔbutuu nʼanim.<verse eid="NUM 22:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 22:32"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ no bisaa no sɛ, “Adɛn enti na wohwe wʼafunumu no mprɛnsa saa? Maba sɛ merebɛka ama woagyae, ɛfiri sɛ, worepɛ adeɛ asɛe. <verse eid="NUM 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 22:33"/>Afunumu no hunuu me mprɛnsa a emu biara ɔkwae faa baabi; anyɛ saa a, anka mɛkum wo na magyaa no.”<verse eid="NUM 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 22:34"/>Afei, Balaam ka kyerɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ no sɛ, “Mafom. Na mennim sɛ wowɔ hɔ. Sɛ wompɛ sɛ metoa mʼakwantuo no so deɛ a, meresane akɔ efie.”<verse eid="NUM 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 22:35"/>Nanso, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔbɔfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Wo ne nnipa no nkɔ, nanso asɛm a mɛka akyerɛ wo no nko na ka.” Enti Balaam ne wɔn kɔeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 22:36"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔhene Balak tee sɛ Balaam reba no, ɔfirii kuro no mu kɔhyiaa no Asubɔnten Arnon ho wɔ ne hyeɛ so. <verse eid="NUM 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 22:37"/>Ɔbisaa Balaam sɛ, “Adɛn enti na wokyɛɛ saa? Anaasɛ, mehyɛɛ wo bɔ sɛ mɛhyɛ wo animuonyam no na wonnye nni?”<verse eid="NUM 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 22:38"/>Balaam buaa sɛ, “Ɛwom sɛ maba deɛ, nanso menni tumi biara a mɛka asɛm biara agye asɛm a Onyankopɔn bɛka akyerɛ me sɛ menka no nko na mɛka.”<verse eid="NUM 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 22:39"/>Balaam kaa ɔhene no ho ne no kɔɔ Kiria-Husot, <verse eid="NUM 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 22:40"/>baabi a ɔhene Balak de anantwie ne nnwan bɔɔ afɔdeɛ na ɔde mmoa no bi maa Balaam ne ne mpanimfoɔ sɛ wɔmfa mmɔ afɔdeɛ no. <verse eid="NUM 22:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 22:41"/>Adeɛ kyee anɔpa no, Balak faa Balaam de no kɔɔ Bamot-Baal atifi. Ɔfiri hɔ too nʼani hunuu sɛ Israelfoɔ no sam aseɛ hɔ.<verse eid="NUM 22:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="NUM 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Balaam Hyira Israelfoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 23:1"/>Balaam ka kyerɛɛ ɔhene no sɛ, “Si afɔrebukyia nson wɔ ha, na siesie anantwie mma nson ne nnwennini nson fa wɔn bɔ afɔdeɛ.” <verse eid="NUM 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 23:2"/>Balak tiee Balaam asɛm no, enti ɔde nantwie ba ne odwennini ba bɔɔ afɔrebukyia nson no biara so afɔdeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 23:3"/>Afei Balaam ka kyerɛɛ ɔhene no sɛ, “Sɔre gyina wo ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ no ho na mɛhwɛ sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛhyia me, na asɛm a ɔbɛka akyerɛ me no nso, mɛka akyerɛ wo.” Enti, ɔforo kɔɔ apampam baabi.<verse eid="NUM 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 23:4"/>Ɛhɔ na Onyankopɔn hyiaa no. Balaam ka kyerɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛ, “Masiesie afɔrebukyia nson. Mabɔ afɔrebukyia no biara so nantwie ba ne odwennini ba afɔdeɛ.”<verse eid="NUM 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 23:5"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de nkra maa Balaam sɛ ɔnkɔka nkyerɛ ɔhene Balak.<verse eid="NUM 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 23:6"/>Ɛberɛ a Balaam sane baeɛ no, na ɔhene no ne ahenemma a wɔfiri Moab no gyina ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ no ho. <verse eid="NUM 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 23:7"/>Nkɔmhyɛ a Balaam de maaeɛ no nie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:7">“Ɔhene Balak soma bɛfrɛɛ me firii Aram.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:7">Moabhene frɛɛ me firii apueeɛ fam nkokoɔ so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:7">Ɔkaa sɛ, ‘Bra bɛdome Yakob ma me!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:7">Bra bɛka mmusuo a ɛbɛba Israelfoɔ so.’<verse eid="NUM 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 23:8"/>Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na matumi madome</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:8">wɔn a Onyankopɔn nnomee wɔn?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:8">Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na matumi abu wɔn fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:8">nnipa a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mmuu wɔn fɔ?<verse eid="NUM 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 23:9"/>Mehunu wɔn firi abotan atifi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:9">mehwɛ wɔn firi nkokoɔ so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:9">Mehunu nnipa a wɔte wɔn ho ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:9">a wɔayi wɔn afiri amanaman mu.<verse eid="NUM 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 23:10"/>Hwan na ɔbɛtumi akan Yakob asefoɔ, wɔdɔɔso sɛ mfuturo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:10">Hwan na ɔbɛtumi akan Israelfoɔ nkyɛmu ɛnan mu baako?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:10">Ma menwu sɛ ɔteneneeni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:10">na mawieɛ nyɛ sɛ wɔn deɛ.”<verse eid="NUM 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 23:11"/>Ɔhene Balak bisaa Balaam sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn na woayɛ me yi? Mede wo baa sɛ bɛdome mʼatamfoɔ, nanso woahyira wɔn!”<verse eid="NUM 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 23:12"/>Nanso, Balaam buaa sɛ, “Metumi aka biribi a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkaa sɛ menka anaa?”<verse eid="NUM 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Balaam Nkɔmhyɛ A Ɛtɔ So Mmienu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 23:13"/>Afei, Balak ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Bra na yɛnkɔ baabi foforɔ. Yɛduru hɔ a, wobɛhunu ɔman Israel fa bi wɔ hɔ. Dome wɔn a wobɛhu wɔn wɔ hɔ no nyinaa.” <verse eid="NUM 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 23:14"/>Ɔhene Balak faa Balaam de no kɔɔ Sofim bepɔ Pisga atifi. Ɔsii afɔrebukyia nson wɔ hɔ. Ɛnna ɔde nantwie ba ne odwennini bɔɔ afɔrebukyia biara so afɔdeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 23:15"/>Afei, Balaam ka kyerɛɛ ɔhene no sɛ, “Gyina wo ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ no ho wɔ ha na me nso merekɔhyia <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.”<verse eid="NUM 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 23:16"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyiaa Balaam na ɔkaa asɛm a ɔnkɔka kyerɛɛ no.<verse eid="NUM 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 23:17"/>Enti, ɔsane baa baabi a ɔhene no ne Moab ahenemma no wɔ a wɔgyina wɔn ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ no ho. Ɔhene no de ahopere bisaa sɛ, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka sɛn?”<verse eid="NUM 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 23:18"/>Nkɔmhyɛ a Balaam de maaeɛ no nie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:18">“Balak, sɔre na tie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:18">Sipor babarima tie me.<verse eid="NUM 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 23:19"/>Onyankopɔn nnyɛ onipa na wadi atorɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:19">Ɔnyɛ onipa na wasesa nʼadwene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:19">Wakasa a wanyɛ anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:19">Wahyɛ bɔ bi pɛn a wanni so anaa?<verse eid="NUM 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 23:20"/>Wɔhyɛɛ me sɛ menhyira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:20">wahyira, na merentumi nnane no!<verse eid="NUM 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 23:21"/>“Menhunu amanehunu bi a ɛbɛba Yakob so.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:21">Ɔhaw biara nni hɔ mma Israel!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:21">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wɔn Onyankopɔn ka wɔn ho.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:21">Ɔne wɔn ɔhene!<verse eid="NUM 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 23:22"/>Onyankopɔn ayi wɔn afiri Misraim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:22">ɔte sɛ nantwie hoɔdenfoɔ ma wɔn.<verse eid="NUM 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 23:23"/>Nnome biara renka Yakob,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:23">abayisɛm biara nni tumi wɔ Israel so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:23">Na wɔbɛka wɔ Yakob ho sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:23">‘Hwɛ anwanwadeɛ a Onyankopɔn ayɛ ama Israel!’<verse eid="NUM 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 23:24"/>Saa nnipa yi sɔre sɛ gyataburu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:24">Wɔgyina hɔ sɛ gyata hoɔdenfoɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:24">Ɔnnye nʼahome kɔsi sɛ ɔbɛwe nʼahaboa awie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:24">na wanom ne mogya nyinaa!”<verse eid="NUM 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 23:25"/>Ɔhene no ka kyerɛɛ Balaam sɛ, “Sɛ worennome wɔn a, ɛnneɛ nhyira wɔn.”<verse eid="NUM 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 23:26"/>Nanso Balaam buaa no sɛ, “Manka ankyerɛ wo sɛ asɛm a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛka akyerɛ me sɛ menka no na mɛka?”<verse eid="NUM 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Balaam Nkɔmhyɛ A Ɛtɔ So Mmiɛnsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 23:27"/>Afei, ɔhene no ka kyerɛɛ Balaam sɛ, “Mede wo bɛkɔ baabi foforɔ. Ebia, ɛhɔ bɛyɛ anisɔ ama Onyankopɔn sɛ wobɛgyina hɔ adome wɔn.” <verse eid="NUM 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 23:28"/>Enti, ɔhene Balak faa Balaam de no kɔɔ bepɔ Peor a ani kyerɛ anweatam no atifi pɛɛ so.<verse eid="NUM 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 23:29"/>Bio, Balaam ka kyerɛɛ ɔhene no sɛ ɔnsi afɔrebukyia nson na ɔnsiesie nantwie mma nson ne nnwennini mma nson mma afɔrebɔ. <verse eid="NUM 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 23:30"/>Ɔhene no yɛɛ deɛ Balaam kaeɛ no, enti ɔde nantwie ba ne odwennini ba bɔɔ afɔdeɛ wɔ afɔrebukyia nson no biara so.<verse eid="NUM 23:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="NUM 24"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 24:1"/>Afei, Balaam hunuu sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> pɛ sɛ ɔhyira Israel. Yei enti, wankɔ abisa sɛdeɛ ɔtaa yɛ no. Na mmom, ɔtoo nʼani hwɛɛ ɛserɛ no so, <verse eid="NUM 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 24:2"/>hunuu sɛ Israelfoɔ mmusuakuo no abobɔ wɔn atenaeɛ. Afei, Onyankopɔn honhom baa ne so, <verse eid="NUM 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 24:3"/>na yei ne nkɔmhyɛ a ɔmaaeɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:3">“Beor ba Balaam nkɔmhyɛ no nie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:3">nkɔmhyɛ a ɛfiri ɔbarima a nʼani hunu adeɛ yie,<verse eid="NUM 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 24:4"/>deɛ ɔte Onyankopɔn asɛm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:4">deɛ ɔhunu anisoadeɛ a ɛfiri Otumfoɔ hɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:4">na ɔda fam, a nʼani gu so:<verse eid="NUM 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 24:5"/>“Ao Yakob, mo ntomadan yɛ fɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:5">Ao Israel, mo afie yɛ ahomeka.<verse eid="NUM 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 24:6"/>“Ɛsam mʼanim te sɛ mmɛfuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:6">te sɛ nturo frɔmfrɔm wɔ asubɔnten ho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:6">Wɔte sɛ pɛperɛ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> adua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:6">te sɛ ntweneduro a ɛbɛn nsuo ho.<verse eid="NUM 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 24:7"/>Wɔbɛnya nsuo bebree.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:7">Wɔn mma bɛnya deɛ ɛhia wɔn nyinaa.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 24:7"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:7">“Wɔn ɔhene bɛyɛ kɛse akyɛn Agag;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:7">wɔn ahennie bɛkorɔn.<verse eid="NUM 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 24:8"/>“Onyankopɔn de wɔn firi Misraim aba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">ɔtwee wɔn sɛ wiram nantwie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:8">Ɔsɛe amanaman a wɔtia no nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">ɔbubu wɔn nnompe mu asinasini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">ɔto bɛmma wowɔ wɔn.<verse eid="NUM 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 24:9"/>Israel butu hɔ sɛ gyata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:9">ɔte sɛ gyataburu, na hwan na ɔbɛtumi anyane no?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 24:9"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:9">“Ao Israel, nhyira nka obiara a ɔhyira wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:9">na nnome nka obiara a ɔdome wo.”<verse eid="NUM 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 24:10"/>Ɔhene Balak bo fuu Balaam. Ɔde Abufuo bɔɔ ne nsam guu ne so teaam sɛ, “Mefrɛɛ wo sɛ bɛdome, mʼatamfoɔ nanso woahyira wɔn mprɛnsa. <verse eid="NUM 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 24:11"/>Firi me so kɔ! Sane kɔ wo nkyi! Meyɛɛ mʼadwene sɛ anka mɛhyɛ wo animuonyam, nanso, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de akame wo!”<verse eid="NUM 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 24:12"/>Balaam buaa no sɛ, “Wonkae asɛm a meka kyerɛɛ wʼasomafoɔ no? Mekaa sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 24:13"/>‘Sɛ Balak ma me ahemfie a wɔde dwetɛ ne sikakɔkɔɔ ahyɛ hɔ ma koraa a, menni tumi sɛ mɛyɛ biribi atia <char style="nd">Awurade</char> apɛdeɛ.’ Meka kyerɛɛ wo sɛ asɛm a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka no nko ara na mɛka. <verse eid="NUM 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 24:14"/>Afei, meresane akɔ me nkurɔfoɔ nkyɛn. Nanso, deɛ ɛdi ɛkan no, ma menka deɛ Israelfoɔ no bɛyɛ wo nkurɔfoɔ daakye no nkyerɛ wo.”<verse eid="NUM 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Balaam Nkɔmhyɛ A Ɛdi Akyire No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 24:15"/>Yei ne nkɔmhyɛ a Balaam de maeɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:15">“Beor ba Balaam nkɔmhyɛ no nie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:15">nkɔmhyɛ a ɛfiri ɔbarima a nʼani hunu adeɛ yie,<verse eid="NUM 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 24:16"/>deɛ ɔte Onyankopɔn asɛm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:16">deɛ ɔwɔ nyansa a ɛfiri Ɔsorosoroni no</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:16">deɛ ɔhunu anisoadeɛ a ɛfiri Otumfoɔ hɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:16">na ɔda fam, a nʼani gu so:<verse eid="NUM 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 24:17"/>“Mɛhunu no, nanso ɛnyɛ seesei;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">mehwɛ no wɔ daakye akyirikyiri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:17">Nsoromma bɛpue afiri Yakob mu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">Ahempoma bɛfiri Israel mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:17">Ɔbɛyam Moabfoɔ tiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">na wapaapae Moab mma tikwankora.<verse eid="NUM 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 24:18"/>Wɔbɛfa Edom,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edomfoɔ yɛ Esau asefoɔ.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:18">na Seir a ɔyɛ ne ɔtamfoɔ no, wɔbɛdi ne so nkonim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:18">na Israel bɛkɔ so adi nkonim.<verse eid="NUM 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 24:19"/>Ɔhene bi bɛsɔre wɔ Yakob mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:19">ɔno na ɔbɛsɛe Ir nkaeɛfoɔ.”<verse eid="NUM 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Balaam Nkɔmhyɛ A Ɛtɔ So Enum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 24:20"/>Afei, Balaam hwɛɛ Amalekfoɔ fie hyɛɛ nkɔm sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:20">“Amalek na na ɛyɛ aman nyinaa abakan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:20">nanso ne hyɛberɛ ne ɔsɛeɛ!”<verse eid="NUM 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Balaam Nkɔmhyɛ A Ɛtɔ So Nsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 24:21"/>Afei, ɔhwɛɛ Kenifoɔ hyɛɛ nkɔm sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:21">“Mo atenaeɛ yɛ pa ara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:21">wanwono mo pirebuo wɔ abotan mu.<verse eid="NUM 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 24:22"/>Nanso, wɔbɛsɛe Kenifoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:22">ɛberɛ a Asurhene afa mo nnomum.”<verse eid="NUM 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Balaam Nkɔmhyɛ A Ɛtɔ So Nson</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 24:23"/>Nsɛm a ɔde wiee ne nkɔmhyɛ no ne sɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:23">“Aa, sɛ Onyankopɔn yɛ sei a, hwan na ɔbɛtena nkwa mu?<verse eid="NUM 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 24:24"/>Ahyɛn bɛfiri Kipro mpoano aba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:24">Na abɛka Eber<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eber asefoɔ yɛ Hebrifoɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 25-27">1 Be 25–27</ref></char>).</char></note> ne Asur ahyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:24">Nanso wɔn nso, wɔbɛsɛe wɔn pasaa.”<verse eid="NUM 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 24:25"/>Enti, Balaam ne Balak sane kɔɔ wɔn kurom.<verse eid="NUM 24:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="NUM 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Moabfoɔ Daadaa Israelfoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 25:1"/>Ɛberɛ a Israelfoɔ bɔɔ atenaseɛ wɔ Sitim no, wɔn mu mmarima no bi hyɛɛ aseɛ ne Moab mmabaawa no bɔɔ adwaman de guu wɔn ho fi. <verse eid="NUM 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 25:2"/>Saa mmabaawa yi too nsa frɛɛ wɔn sɛ wɔmmra wɔn afɔdeɛ a wɔbɔ ma wɔn anyame no ase. Ankyɛre biara, mmarima no kɔɔ wɔn apontoɔ ase na wɔsomm Moab anyame. <verse eid="NUM 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 25:3"/>Ɛberɛ tiawa bi akyi, Israelfoɔ no nyinaa kɔsom Baal-peor a ɔyɛ Moabfoɔ nyame. Yei maa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bo fuu ne nkurɔfoɔ no yie.<verse eid="NUM 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 25:4"/>Ɔhyɛɛ saa mmara yi maa Mose sɛ, “Kunkum mpanimfoɔ a wɔtuatua Israel mmusuakuo no ano no nyinaa. Sɛn wɔn wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim awia ketee sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, nʼabufuo a ano yɛ den no bɛfiri wɔn so.”<verse eid="NUM 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 25:5"/>Enti, Mose hyɛɛ atemmufoɔ no ma wɔkunkumm wɔn a wɔsomm Baal-peor no nyinaa.<verse eid="NUM 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 25:6"/>Nanso, Israelni ɔhantanni bi de Midiani ababaawa bi baa wɔn atenaeɛ hɔ maa Mose ne nnipa no nyinaa hunuu no ɛberɛ a na wɔn nyinaa gyina Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no ɛpono akyi retwa adwo no. <verse eid="NUM 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 25:7"/>Ɛberɛ a Pinehas a ɔyɛ Eleasa babarima a na ɔyɛ ɔsɔfoɔ Aaron nana hunuu yei no, ɔhuri sɔɔ pea mu <verse eid="NUM 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 25:8"/>taa saa ɔbarima no so de no kɔwuraa ne ntomadan mu baabi a ɔfaa ɔbaa no. Ɔde pea no wowɔɔ ɔbarima no sane de wɔɔ ɔbaa no yafunu mu. Enti, ɔhaw no to twaa wɔ Israelfoɔ no mu, <verse eid="NUM 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 25:9"/>nanso ɛkɔsi saa ɛberɛ no, na nnipa mpem aduonu ɛnan awuwu dada.<verse eid="NUM 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 25:10"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 25:11"/>“Eleasa babarima Pinehas a ɔyɛ ɔsɔfoɔ Aaron nana adwodwo mʼabufuo ano, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔbɔɔ mmɔden te sɛ me ara wɔ mʼanimuonyam ho, enti sɛdeɛ meyɛɛ mʼadwene sɛ mɛsɛe Israelfoɔ nyinaa no, magyae. <verse eid="NUM 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 25:12"/>Enti ka kyerɛ no sɛ, me ne no rebɛyɛ asomdwoeɛ apam. <verse eid="NUM 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 25:13"/>Saa apam yi mu, ɔno ne nʼasefoɔ bɛyɛ asɔfoɔ afebɔɔ, ɛfiri sɛ watwe me, ne Onyankopɔn, ho ninkunu wɔ Israelfoɔ mu de ayɛ mpata ama wɔn.”<verse eid="NUM 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 25:14"/>Ɔbarima a wɔkumm no ne Midiani ababaawa no, na ne din de Simri a na ɔyɛ Salu a ɔtua Simeon abusuakuo ano no babarima. <verse eid="NUM 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 25:15"/>Ɔbaa no nso, na ne din de Kosbi a na ɔyɛ Midianhene babarima Sur babaa.<verse eid="NUM 25:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 25:16"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 25:17"/>“To hyɛ Midianfoɔ no so na sɛe wɔn, <verse eid="NUM 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 25:18"/>ɛfiri sɛ, wɔfaa mo sɛ atamfoɔ, na wɔdaadaa mo ma mosomm Baal-peor, ne Kosbi a ɔyɛ Midian ntuanoni babaa a wɔkumm no wɔ Peor ɔyaredɔm ɛda no.”<verse eid="NUM 25:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="NUM 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Israel Nnipakan A Ɛtɔ So Mmienu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 26:1"/>Ɔyaredɔm no akyi no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose ne ɔsɔfoɔ Aaron babarima Eleasa sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 26:2"/>“Monkan Israelfoɔ mmarima a wɔadi mfeɛ aduonu ne deɛ ɛboro saa nyinaa na monhwɛ dodoɔ a wɔbɛtumi akɔ ɔsa wɔ abusua biara mu.” <verse eid="NUM 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 26:3"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, na Israelman no nyinaa abɔ atenaeɛ wɔ Moab tata so, wɔ Asubɔnten Yordan ho a na wɔne Yeriko di nhwɛanimu. Enti Mose ne ɔsɔfoɔ Eleasa kaa nhyehyɛeɛ a ɛfa nnipakan no ho kyerɛɛ Israelfoɔ ntuanofoɔ no sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 26:4"/>“Monkan mmarima a wɔwɔ Israel a wɔadi mfeɛ aduonu ne deɛ ɛboro saa sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ Mose no.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 26:4"/>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 26:4">Sɛdeɛ nnipakan no a ɛfa Israel mma a wɔfiri Misraim baeɛ no ano kɔsiiɛ nie.<verse eid="NUM 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruben Abusuakuo</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 26:5"/>Yeinom ne mmusua a wɔyɛ Yakob babarima panin Ruben asefoɔ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:5">Hanokfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Hanok;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:5">Palufoɔ abusua, wɔde too a wɔn tete agya Palu;<verse eid="NUM 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 26:6"/>Hesronfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Hesron;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:6">Karmifoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Karmi.<verse eid="NUM 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 26:7"/>Mmarima a na wɔwɔ Ruben mmusua nyinaa mu no dodoɔ yɛ mpem aduanan mmiɛnsa ahanson aduasa (43,730).<verse eid="NUM 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 26:8"/>Na Palu yɛ Eliab aseni, <verse eid="NUM 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 26:9"/>na Nemuel na ɔwoo Eliab, Datan ne Abiram. Saa Datan ne Abiram yi ara na wɔyɛ nnipa no ntuanofoɔ a wɔne Kora yɛɛ adwene tiaa Mose ne Aaron, de buu <char style="nd">Awurade</char> animtia. <verse eid="NUM 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 26:10"/>Na asase mu bue menee wɔn ne Kora. Egya firi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn bɛsɛee wɔn akyidifoɔ ahanu aduonum. Yei yɛɛ kɔkɔbɔ maa Israelman nyinaa. <verse eid="NUM 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 26:11"/>Nanso, Kora mmammarima deɛ, wɔanwuwu da no.<verse eid="NUM 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Simeon Abusuakuo</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 26:12"/>Yeinom ne mmusua a wɔfiri Simeon mmammarima mu:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:12">Nemuelfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Nemuel.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:12">Yaminfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Yamin.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:12">Yakinfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Yakin.<verse eid="NUM 26:12"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 26:13"/>Serafoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Serah;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:13">Saulfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Saulo.<verse eid="NUM 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 26:14"/>Mmarima a na wɔwɔ Simeon mmusua mu nyinaa dodoɔ yɛ mpem aduonu mmienu ne ahanu.<verse eid="NUM 26:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gad Abusuakuo</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 26:15"/>Yeinom ne mmusua a wɔfiri Gad mmammarima mu:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:15">Sefonfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Sefon;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:15">Hagifoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Hagi.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:15">Sunifoɔ abusua no, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Suni.<verse eid="NUM 26:15"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 26:16"/>Osnifoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Osni.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:16">Erifoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Eri;<verse eid="NUM 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 26:17"/>Arodfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn agya Arod.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:17">Arelifoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Areli.<verse eid="NUM 26:17"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 26:18"/>Mmarima a na wɔwɔ Gad mmusua mu no dodoɔ yɛ mpem aduanan ne ahanum (40,500).<verse eid="NUM 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Abusuakuo</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 26:19"/>Na Yuda wɔ mmammarima baanu a wɔn edin de Er ne Onan a na wɔawuwu wɔ Kanaan asase so.<verse eid="NUM 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 26:20"/>Nanso, mmusua a ɛdidi so yi firi Yuda mmammarima a na wɔte ase no ase.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:20">Selafoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Sela.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:20">Peresfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Peres.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:20">Serafoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Serah.<verse eid="NUM 26:20"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 26:21"/>Yeinom ne mmusua nketewa wɔfiri Peresfoɔ ase.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="NUM 26:21">Hesronfoɔ abusua, a wɔde too wɔn tete agya Hesron.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="NUM 26:21">Hamulfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Hamul.<verse eid="NUM 26:21"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 26:22"/>Mmarima a na wɔwɔ Yuda mmusua mu no nyinaa dodoɔ yɛ mpem aduɔson nsia ne ahanum.<verse eid="NUM 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isakar Asefoɔ</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 26:23"/>Yeinom ne mmusua a wɔfiri Isakar mmammarima ase:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:23">Tolafoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Tola.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:23">Puwafoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Puwa.<verse eid="NUM 26:23"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 26:24"/>Yasubfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Yasub.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:24">Simronfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Simron.<verse eid="NUM 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 26:25"/>Mmarima a na wɔwɔ Isakar mmusua no mu no nyinaa dodoɔ yɛ mpem aduosia nan ne ahasa (64,300).<verse eid="NUM 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sebulon Asefoɔ</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 26:26"/>Yeinom ne mmusua a wɔfiri Sebulon mmammarima ase:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:26">Seredfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Sered.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:26">Elonfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Elon.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:26">Yakleefoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Yakleel.<verse eid="NUM 26:26"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 26:27"/>Mmarima a na wɔwɔ Sebulon mmusua no mu no nyinaa dodoɔ yɛ mpem aduosia ne ahanum.<verse eid="NUM 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Manase Abusuakuo</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 26:28"/>Ɛnam Manase ne Efraim so na mmusua mmienu firii Yosef mu baeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 26:28"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 26:29"/>Manase asefoɔ:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:29">Makirfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Makir.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:29">Gileadfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya, Makir babarima, Gilead.<verse eid="NUM 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 26:30"/>Yeinom ne mmusua nketewa a wɔfiri Gileadfoɔ ase:</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="NUM 26:30">Yeserfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Yeser.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="NUM 26:30">Helekfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn agya Helek.<verse eid="NUM 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 26:31"/>Asrielfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Asriel.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="NUM 26:31">Sekemfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Sekem.<verse eid="NUM 26:31"/></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 26:32"/>Semidafoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Semida.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="NUM 26:32">Heferfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Hefer.<verse eid="NUM 26:32"/></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 26:33"/>Na Hefer babarima Selofehad annya mmammarima nanso na ɔwɔ mmammaa a wɔn edin de Mahla, Noa, Hogla, Milka ne Tirsa.<verse eid="NUM 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 26:34"/>Mmarima a na wɔwɔ Manase mmusua no nyinaa mu dodoɔ yɛ mpem aduonum mmienu ne ahanson (52,700).<verse eid="NUM 26:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Efraim Abusuakuo</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 26:35"/>Yeinom ne mmusua a wɔfiri Efraim mmammarima ase:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:35">Sutelafoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Sutela.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:35">Bekerfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Beker.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:35">Tahanfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Tahan.<verse eid="NUM 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 26:36"/>Na yei yɛ abusua nketewa a wɔfiri Sutela ase:</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="NUM 26:36">Eranfoɔ abusua, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Eran.<verse eid="NUM 26:36"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 26:37"/>Mmarima a na wɔwɔ Efraim mmusua nketewa no nyinaa mu dodoɔ yɛ mpem aduasa mmienu ne ahanum (32,500).</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 26:37">Manase ne Efraim mmusua nyinaa yɛ Yosef asefoɔ.<verse eid="NUM 26:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Benyamin Abusuakuo</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 26:38"/>Yeinom ne mmusua a wɔfiri Benyamin mmammarima mu.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:38">Belafoɔ abusua no, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Bela.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:38">Asbelfoɔ abusua no, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Asbel.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:38">Ahiramfoɔ abusua no, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Ahiram.<verse eid="NUM 26:38"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 26:39"/>Sufamfoɔ abusua no, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Sufam.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:39">Hufamfoɔ abusua no, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Hufam.<verse eid="NUM 26:39"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 26:40"/>Yeinom ne mmusua a wɔfiri Belafoɔ mu.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="NUM 26:40">Ardfoɔ a wɔde too wɔn tete agya Ard.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="NUM 26:40">Naamanfoɔ a wɔde too wɔn tete agya Naaman.<verse eid="NUM 26:40"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 26:41"/>Na mmarima a na wɔwɔ Benyamin mmusua no mu nyinaa dodoɔ yɛ mpem aduanan enum ne ahansia (45,600).<verse eid="NUM 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dan Abusuakuo</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 26:42"/>Yei ne abusua a ɛfiri Dan babarima asefoɔ mu.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:42">Suhamfoɔ abusua no, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Suham.</para>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 26:42">Na Dan mmusua no nyinaa yɛ Suhamfoɔ. <verse eid="NUM 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 26:43"/>Mmarima a na wɔwɔ saa mmusua no mu nyinaa dodoɔ yɛ mpem aduosia ɛnan ne ahanan (64,400).<verse eid="NUM 26:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aser Abusuakuo</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 26:44"/>Yeinom ne mmusua a wɔfiri Aser mmammarima mu.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:44">Yimnafoɔ abusua no, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Yimna.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:44">Isuifoɔ abusua no, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Isui.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:44">Beriafoɔ abusua no, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Beria.<verse eid="NUM 26:44"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 26:45"/>Yeinom ne mmusua a wɔfiri Beriafoɔ mu.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="NUM 26:45">Heberfoɔ de wɔn ho too wɔn tete agya Heber.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="NUM 26:45">Malkielfoɔ de wɔn ho too wɔn tete agya Malkiel.<verse eid="NUM 26:45"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 26:46"/>Na Aser wɔ ɔbabaa bi a ne din de Sera.<verse eid="NUM 26:46"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 26:47"/>Mmarima a na wɔwɔ Aser mmusua nyinaa mu no dodoɔ yɛ mpem aduonum mmiɛnsa ne ahanan (53,400).<verse eid="NUM 26:47"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Naftali Abusuakuo</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 26:48"/>Yeinom ne mmusua a wɔfiri Naftali mmammarima mu.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:48">Yakseelfoɔ abusua no, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Yakseel.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:48">Gunifoɔ abusua no, wɔde too wɔn agya Guni.<verse eid="NUM 26:48"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 26:49"/>Yeserfoɔ abusua no, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Yeser.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:49">Silemfoɔ abusua no, wɔde too wɔn tete agya Silem.<verse eid="NUM 26:49"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 26:50"/>Mmarima a na wɔwɔ Naftali mmusua nyinaa mu no dodoɔ yɛ mpem aduanan enum ne ahanan (45,400).<verse eid="NUM 26:50"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnipa Dodoɔ A Wɔkan Wɔn</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 26:51"/>Enti, nnipa dodoɔ a wɔkan wɔn no ano si mpem ahansia ne baako ahanson aduasa (601,730).<verse eid="NUM 26:51"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 26:52"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 26:53"/>“Kyekyɛ asase no ma mmusua no sɛdeɛ wɔn dodoɔ teɛ. <verse eid="NUM 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 26:54"/>Ma abusua a ɛso no asase kɛseɛ na abusua a ɛsua no asase ketewa. <verse eid="NUM 26:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 26:55"/>Hwɛ sɛ wɔnam ntontobɔ so bɛkyekyɛ asase no. Deɛ ɛsɛ sɛ ekuo biara nya no bɛgyina nʼagyanom abusuakuo edin dodoɔ so. <verse eid="NUM 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 26:56"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔbɔ ntonto wɔ agyapadeɛ no kyekyɛ so wɔ akuo akɛseɛ ne nketewa no mu.”<verse eid="NUM 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 26:57"/>Nnipakan no, na Lewifoɔ mmusua no mu nnipa nie:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:57">Wɔde Gersonfoɔ too wɔn tete agya Gerson.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:57">Wɔde Kohatfoɔ too wɔn tete agya Kohat.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:57">Wɔde Merarifoɔ too wɔn tete agya Merari.<verse eid="NUM 26:57"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 26:58"/>Yeinom nso yɛ Lewifoɔ mmusua:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:58">Libnifoɔ,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:58">Hebronfoɔ,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:58">Mahlifoɔ,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:58">Musifoɔ ne</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:58">Korafoɔ.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 26:58">Kohat yɛ Amram tete agya; <verse eid="NUM 26:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 26:59"/>Ɛberɛ a Lewi wɔ Misraim no, wɔwoo ɔbabaa a ne din de Yokebed. Kehat babarima Amram waree no. Wɔn na wɔwoo Aaron, Mose ne Miriam. <verse eid="NUM 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 26:60"/>Aaron woo Nadab, Abihu, Eleasa ne Itamar. <verse eid="NUM 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 26:61"/>Nanso, ɛberɛ a Nadab ne Abihu de ogya a ɛnyɛ kronkron brɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no, wɔwuwuiɛ.<verse eid="NUM 26:61"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 26:62"/>Nnipakan no mu na Lewifoɔ nyinaa dodoɔ yɛ mpem aduonu mmiɛnsa (23,000). Wɔkan mmarima a wɔadi firi bosome kɔsi mpanimfoɔ so. Nanso, wɔammu Lewifoɔ no ano anka Israel nnipakan no ho, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔrekyɛ nsase no ama mmusuakuo no, wɔamma Lewifoɔ no bi.<verse eid="NUM 26:62"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 26:63"/>Enti, sɛdeɛ Mose ne ɔsɔfoɔ Eleasa fa kyerɛɛ nnipa no ano wɔ Moab bepɔ a ɛbɛn Asubɔnten Yordan na ɛne Yeriko di nhwɛanimu no ne no. <verse eid="NUM 26:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 26:64"/>Saa nnipa yi nyinaa, wɔn mu baako mpo nni hɔ a nnipakan a ɛdi ɛkan no, wɔkan no wɔ Sinai ɛserɛ so hɔ, <verse eid="NUM 26:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 26:65"/>ɛfiri sɛ, na mfeɛ aduanan atwam enti na wɔn a wɔkan wɔn kane no nyinaa awuwu sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kaeɛ sɛ. “Wɔbɛwuwu wɔ ɛserɛ so” no. Wɔn a ɛkaa wɔn ara ne Yefune ba Kaleb ne Nun babarima Yosua.<verse eid="NUM 26:65"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="NUM 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Selofehad Mmammaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 27:1"/>Ɛda koro bi, Hefer babarima Selofehad mmammaa a wɔn edin ne Mahla, Noa, Hogla, Milka ne Tirsa baa Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no ano sɛ wɔde adesrɛ bi rebɛto Mose, ɔsɔfoɔ Eleasa ne mmusua panin ne afoforɔ a wɔwɔ hɔ no anim. <verse eid="NUM 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 27:2"/>Na mmaa no yɛ Yosef babarima Manase abusuafoɔ fa bi. Na wɔn ase firi Makir a ɔyɛ Manase babarima no fie. Na Manase babarima Gilead yɛ wɔn nana nkansowa ɛnna ne babarima Hefer nso yɛ wɔn nana ɛnna wɔn babarima Selofehad yɛ wɔn agya. <verse eid="NUM 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 27:3"/>Wɔkaa sɛ, “Yɛn agya wuu ɛserɛ so nanso na ɔnka wɔn a wɔne Kora yɛɛ dɔm tiaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> a enti ɛmaa wɔwuwuiɛ no ho. Ɔno ankasa bɔne enti na ɔwuiɛ. <verse eid="NUM 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 27:4"/>Adɛn enti na ɛsiane sɛ yɛn agya anwo ɔbabarima enti ne din ayera? Yɛgye di sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔma yɛn agyapadeɛ a yɛn agya nuammarimanom anya no bi.”<verse eid="NUM 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 27:5"/>Enti Mose de wɔn asɛm too <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim. <verse eid="NUM 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 27:6"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> buaa Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 27:7"/>“Asɛm a Selofehad mmammaa no ka no yɛ nokorɛ. Ma wɔn ne wɔn agya nuanom no asase. Fa agyapadeɛ a sɛ wɔn agya no te ase a anka ɔbɛnya no ma wɔn.<verse eid="NUM 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 27:8"/>“Deɛ ɛdi hɔ bio ne sɛ, ɛsiane sɛ ɛyɛ mo mmara sɛ, sɛ obi wu na ɔnni mmammarima a wɔbɛdi nʼadeɛ a ɛsɛ sɛ nʼagyapadeɛ kɔ ne mmammaa hɔ enti, monyɛ no saa. <verse eid="NUM 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 27:9"/>Na sɛ ɔnni ɔbabaa nso a, ɛsɛ sɛ agyapadeɛ no kɔ ne nuammarima nkyɛn. <verse eid="NUM 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 27:10"/>Na sɛ ɔnni nuammarima a, ɛkɔ ne wɔfanom nkyɛn. <verse eid="NUM 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 27:11"/>Na sɛ ɔnni wɔn mu biara bi a, ɛkɔ ne busuani bi a ɔbɛn no nkyɛn. Ɛsɛ sɛ Israelfoɔ di saa mmara a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ Mose no so.”<verse eid="NUM 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔyi Yosua Sɛ Mose Abadiakyire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 27:12"/>Ɛda bi, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, “Kɔ bepɔ a ɛwɔ Abarim mmepɔ no so na to wʼani fa asubɔnten a ɛda hɔ no so ma ɛnkɔsi asase a mede maa Israelfoɔ no so. <verse eid="NUM 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 27:13"/>Sɛ wohwɛ wie a, wobɛwu sɛdeɛ wo nua Aaron wuiɛ no, <verse eid="NUM 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 27:14"/>ɛfiri sɛ, wosɔre tiaa me mmara wɔ Sin ɛserɛ so hɔ. Ɛberɛ a Israelfoɔ no sɔre tiaa me no, woamma wɔanhunu me kronkronyɛ wɔ nsuo no ho.” Na ɔretwe nʼadwene aba Meriba nsuo “Akoeɛ” a ɛwɔ Kades a ɛwɔ Sin ɛserɛ so no so.<verse eid="NUM 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 27:15"/>Mose ka kyerɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 27:16"/>“Ao <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Onyankopɔn a woyɛ nnipa nyinaa honhom ti ansa na worebɛfa me no, mesrɛ, yi obi si mʼanan <verse eid="NUM 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 27:17"/>a ɔde wɔn bɛkɔ ɔko na ɔbɛhwɛ wɔn so sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nnipa bɛnya odwanhwɛfoɔ a ɔbɛhwɛ wɔn so.”<verse eid="NUM 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 27:18"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> buaa no sɛ, “Kɔ na kɔfrɛ Nun babarima Yosua a ɔwɔ Honhom no wɔ ne mu no, <verse eid="NUM 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 27:19"/>na fa no kɔ ɔsɔfoɔ Eleasa nkyɛn, na nnipa no nyinaa rehwɛ mo no, fa nnipa no animdie so tumi hyɛ ne nsa. <verse eid="NUM 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 27:20"/>Fa wo tumi ma no wɔ badwam sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, Israelfoɔ nyinaa bɛtie no. <verse eid="NUM 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 27:21"/>Sɛ wɔhia akwankyerɛ a ɛfiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hɔ a, Yosua bɛgyina ɔsɔfoɔ Eleasa anim, na ɔsɔfoɔ Eleasa abɔ ntonto kronkron de abisa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> apɛdeɛ. Saa ɛkwan yi so na Yosua ne Israelfoɔ no bɛfa so ahwehwɛ deɛ ɛsɛ sɛ wɔyɛ.”<verse eid="NUM 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 27:22"/>Enti, Mose yɛɛ deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ no sɛ ɔnyɛ no. Ɔde Yosua kyerɛɛ ɔsɔfoɔ Eleasa ne nnipa no nyinaa. <verse eid="NUM 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 27:23"/>Mose de ne nsa guu no so, de nʼadwuma hyɛɛ ne nsa sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛeɛ no.<verse eid="NUM 27:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="NUM 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Afɔrebɔ Ahodoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 28:1"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 28:2"/>“Ka kyerɛ Israelfoɔ sɛ, afɔrebɔdeɛ a mohye no wɔ afɔrebukyia so no yɛ mʼaduane a mʼani gye ho. ‘Enti, hwɛ na wɔmfa mmra wɔ ɛberɛ-ano-berɛ-ano na wɔmfa mmɔ afɔdeɛ sɛdeɛ mahyɛ no. <verse eid="NUM 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 28:3"/>Sɛ mobɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ a, momfa nnwennini mma a wɔadi afe a wɔnni dɛm biara na ɛmmɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> afɔdeɛ no. Ɛda biara, momfa mmienu mmɔ afɔdeɛ. Mommɔ no wɔ berɛ-ano-berɛ ano. <verse eid="NUM 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 28:4"/>Momfa odwammaa no baako mmɔ afɔdeɛ anɔpa na momfa baako mmɔ anwummerɛ. <verse eid="NUM 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 28:5"/>Sɛ morebɔ saa afɔdeɛ no a, momfa aburoo lita mmienu ne fa a wɔayam no muhumuhu na wɔde ngo afra nka ho. <verse eid="NUM 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 28:6"/>Yei ne ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ a wɔhyɛɛ aseɛ wɔ Sinai Bepɔ so a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔbɔ no wɔ berɛ-ano-berɛ-ano ma ɛyi hwa. Ɛyɛ afɔdeɛ a wɔde ogya bɔ de ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. <verse eid="NUM 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 28:7"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde ɔnom afɔrebɔdeɛ a ɛyɛ nsã a apae lita baako a odwammaa ka ho ka afɔrebɔdeɛ no ho a wɔbɛhwie agu beaeɛ bi a ɛhɔ yɛ kronkron wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim. <verse eid="NUM 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 28:8"/>Momfa odwammaa a ɔtɔ so mmienu no mmɔ afɔdeɛ anwummerɛ a aburoo ne nsã afɔrebɔdeɛ ka ho. Ɛno nso yɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hwam. Ɛyɛ ɔhyeɛ afɔrebɔ.<verse eid="NUM 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 28:9"/>“ ‘Sɛ ɛduru homeda a, momfa nnwammaa a wɔadi afe a wɔnnii dɛm biara ne afɔrebɔdeɛ ahodoɔ a ɛsɛ sɛ mode ka ho no mmɔ afɔdeɛ. Ɛsɛ sɛ aburoo afɔrebɔdeɛ lita ɛnan ne fa a wɔayam no muhumuhu de ngo afra a nsã ka ho saa ara na wɔde bɔ saa afɔdeɛ no. <verse eid="NUM 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 28:10"/>Yei ne ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ a wɔbɔ no homeda biara de ka ɛberɛ ano ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ ne nsã afɔrebɔ ho no.<verse eid="NUM 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 28:11"/>“ ‘Saa ara nso na ɛda a ɛdi ɛkan wɔ bosome biara mu no, ɛsɛ sɛ mobɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ foforɔ bi ka ho de ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. Afɔrebɔdeɛ no bɛyɛ nantwinini mma mmienu, odwennini baako ne nnwammaa nson a wɔadi afe a wɔnnii dɛm biara. <verse eid="NUM 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 28:12"/>Deɛ ɛsɛ sɛ mode ka ho ne asikyiresiam lita nsia ne ɛfa a wɔayam no muhumuhu de ngo afra. Ɛno na mode bɛka nantwie baako biara ho. Afei, mode asikyiresiam a wɔayam no muhumuhu lita ɛnan a wɔde ngo afra bɛbɔ aburoo afɔdeɛ a odwennini no ka ho; <verse eid="NUM 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 28:13"/>na odwammaa biara nso, mode asikyiresiam lita mmienu ne ɛfa. Saa afɔrebɔdeɛ yi wɔde ogya na ɛbɛhye, na ɛbɛsɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani. <verse eid="NUM 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 28:14"/>Afɔrebɔdeɛ biara no, nsã afɔrebɔ ka ho. Nantwie biara, nsã ntoa nsia ka ho. Odwennini biara, nsã ntoa ɛnan ka ho. Odwammaa biara nso, nsã ntoa mmiɛnsa ka ho. Afe mu no nyinaa mu, yei na ɛbɛyɛ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ wɔ bosome biara mu. <verse eid="NUM 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 28:15"/>Afei, bosome biara mu ɛda a ɛdi ɛkan no, mode ɔpapo bɛbɔ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ ama <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. Mobɛbɔ saa afɔdeɛ yi de aka ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ ne nsã afɔdeɛ a mobɔ no wɔ berɛ-ano-berɛ-ano no ho.<verse eid="NUM 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 28:16"/>“ ‘Afe biara bosome a ɛdi ɛkan no ɛda a ɛtɔ so dunan no nso, mobɛdi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Twam Afahyɛ no. <verse eid="NUM 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 28:17"/>Ɛda a ɛdi so no, mobɛfiti aseɛ adi dapɔnna a wɔde anigyeɛ di no nnanson no, nanso, morenni burodo a mmɔreka wɔ mu. <verse eid="NUM 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 28:18"/>Afahyɛ no ɛda a ɛdi ɛkan no, nnipa no nyinaa bɛbɔ ahoteɛ dwa na obiara renyɛ adwuma biara. <verse eid="NUM 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 28:19"/>Mode nantwie mma mmienu, odwennini baako ne nnwammaa a wɔadi afe a wɔnnii dɛm bɛbɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ ama <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. <verse eid="NUM 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 28:20"/>Mode esiam lita nson a mode ngo afra bɛka nantwie baako biara ho. Afei, mode esiam lita enum bɛka odwennini no ho, <verse eid="NUM 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 28:21"/>na nnwan nson no biara nso, mode esiam lita mmiɛnsa aka ho. <verse eid="NUM 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 28:22"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ mode ɔpapo bɔ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ sɛ mpatadeɛ ma mo ho. <verse eid="NUM 28:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 28:23"/>Mode saa afɔrebɔdeɛ yi bɛka deɛ daadaa mobɔ no ho. <verse eid="NUM 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 28:24"/>Nna nson no mu ɛda biara adidie mu no, mobɛbɔ saa afɔdeɛ korɔ yi ara bi. Ɛbɛyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anisɔ yie. <verse eid="NUM 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 28:25"/>Ɛda a ɛtɔ so nson no, ɛbɛyɛ ɛda kronkron bio a nnipa no nyinaa bɛhyia mu na saa ɛda no, obiara renyɛ adwuma biara.<verse eid="NUM 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 28:26"/>“ ‘Aduanekan ɛda no a wɔfrɛ no Nnawɔtwe mu Afahyɛ anaasɛ Pentekoste no, ɛsɛ sɛ nnipa no nyinaa bɔ nhyiamu kronkron ho dawuro de di Otwa berɛ Afahyɛ no. Ɛda no, ɛsɛ sɛ mode mo mfuo mu nnɔbaeɛ foforɔ bɛbɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aduane afɔdeɛ. Ɛnsɛ sɛ mo mu biara yɛ adwuma saa ɛda no. <verse eid="NUM 28:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 28:27"/>Ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ sononko a ɛsɔ ani na ɛsɛ sɛ saa ɛda no, mobɔ ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. Afɔrebɔdeɛ no bɛyɛ anantwie mma mmienu, odwennini baako ne nnwammaa anini a wɔadi mfeɛ nson. <verse eid="NUM 28:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 28:28"/>Mode mo aburoo lita nsia ne fa a wɔayam no muhumuhu a mode ngo afra bɛka nantwie baako ho. Mode lita ɛnan bɛka odwennini no ho; <verse eid="NUM 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 28:29"/>na mode lita mmienu ne fa bɛka nnwammaa nson no biara ho. <verse eid="NUM 28:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 28:30"/>Afei, momfa ɔpapo baako nyɛ mpatadeɛ mma mo ho. <verse eid="NUM 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 28:31"/>Saa afɔdeɛ ahodoɔ sononko yi ka daa ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ, aburoo afɔdeɛ ne nsã afɔdeɛ no ho. Monhwɛ sɛ mmoa a mode wɔn rekɔbɔ saa afɔdeɛ no nnii dɛm biara ansa na mode wɔn abɔ saa afɔdeɛ no.<verse eid="NUM 28:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="NUM 29"/>
  <para style="s1">Totorobɛnto Afahyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 29:1"/>“ ‘Bosome a ɛtɔ so nson no ɛda a ɛdi ɛkan wɔ afe biara mu no, monhyɛ totorobɛnto afahyɛ no. Nnipa no nyinaa de kommyɛ bɛhyia na obiara renyɛ adwuma biara. <verse eid="NUM 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 29:2"/>Saa ɛda no, mode nantwie ba baako, odwennini baako ne nnwammaanini nson a wɔadi afe a wɔnnii dɛm bɛbɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ. Yeinom yɛ afɔrebɔdeɛ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani bɛsɔ na nʼani nso bɛgye ho. <verse eid="NUM 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 29:3"/>Mode aburoo lita nsia ne fa a wɔayam no muhumuhu a wɔde ngo afra bɛbɔ aburoo afɔdeɛ no a nantwie no ka ho. Wɔde lita ɛnan bɛka odwennini no ho <verse eid="NUM 29:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 29:4"/>ɛnna lita mmienu ne fa nso ka nnwammaa no baako biara ho. <verse eid="NUM 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 29:5"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ mosane de ɔpapo bɔ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ de yei yɛ mo mpatadeɛ. <verse eid="NUM 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 29:6"/>Saa afɔrebɔ sononko yi ka ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ a mobɔ no bosome biara ne ɛda no deɛ no ho; afei nso, ɛka daa ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ a mobɔ a aburoo ne nsã afɔrebɔ ka ho no ho sɛdeɛ afɔrebɔ no ho mmara teɛ no. Ɛyɛ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ a ɛsɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani.<verse eid="NUM 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpata Da Afɔrebɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 29:7"/>“ ‘Bosome a ɛtɔ so nson no ɛda a ɛtɔ so edu no, ɛsɛ sɛ nnipa no nyinaa sane hyia bio. Ɛyɛ ɛda a ɛsɛ sɛ nnipa no nyinaa yɛ komm ahobrɛaseɛ mu wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim, na ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔn mu biara yɛ adwuma biara. <verse eid="NUM 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 29:8"/>Saa ɛda no, mobɛbɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ ama <char style="nd">Awurade</char>—nʼani bɛsɔ. Afɔrebɔdeɛ no yɛ nantwie ba baako, odwennini baako, nnwammaanini nson a wɔadi afe a wɔnnii dɛm biara. <verse eid="NUM 29:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 29:9"/>Fa nantwie ba no siesie atokoɔ afɔdeɛ a mode asikyiresiam a wɔayam no muhumuhu ne ngo lita nsia ne fa afra. <verse eid="NUM 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 29:10"/>Lita ɛnan na mode bɛka odwennini no ho ɛnna mode lita mmienu ne fa aka odwammaa baako biara ho. <verse eid="NUM 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 29:11"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ mode ɔpapo baako bɔ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ. Yei ka bɔne afɔrebɔdeɛ a wɔbɔ de pata ne ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ a wɔbɔ no daadaa a aduane afɔrebɔdeɛ ne nsã afɔdeɛ ka ho.<verse eid="NUM 29:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asese Afahyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 29:12"/>“ ‘Bosome a ɛtɔ so nson no ɛda a ɛtɔ so dunum no, ɛsɛ sɛ nnipa no nyinaa sane hyia bio. Ɛnsɛ sɛ ɛda no, obiara yɛ adwuma. Ɛyɛ nnanson afahyɛ ahyɛaseɛ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim. <verse eid="NUM 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 29:13"/>Nneɛma a mode bɛbɔ saa afɔdeɛ sononko yi ama <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani asɔ no bɛyɛ nantwie mma dumiɛnsa, nnwennini mmienu ne nnwammaanini a wɔadi afe a wɔnnii dɛm biara dunan. <verse eid="NUM 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 29:14"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ, sɛdeɛ moyɛ no daa no, mode atokoɔ afɔrebɔdeɛ, asikyiresiam a wɔayam no muhumuhu lita nsia ne fa ka anantwie mma dumiɛnsa no biara ho. Lita ɛnan ka nnwennini no baako biara ho <verse eid="NUM 29:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 29:15"/>ɛnna lita mmienu ne fa aka nnwammaa dunan no baako biara ho. <verse eid="NUM 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 29:16"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ mode ɔpapo bɔ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ ka daa ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ a mobɔ no ho a aburoo ne nsã afɔdeɛ ka ho.<verse eid="NUM 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 29:17"/>“ ‘Ɛda a ɛtɔ so mmienu wɔ saa nnanson afahyɛ no mu no, mode anantwie mma dumienu, nnwennini mmienu ne nnwammaanini a wɔadi afe dunan a wɔnnii dɛm biara bɛbɔ afɔdeɛ. <verse eid="NUM 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 29:18"/>Saa afɔrebɔdeɛ yi mu biara, mode anantwinini, nnwennini ne nnwammaa no ho aduane ne nsã afɔrebɔdeɛ a wɔahyɛ no bɛka ho. <verse eid="NUM 29:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 29:19"/>Ɔhyeɛ afɔrebɔ a mobɔ no daa akyi no, mode ɔpapo bɛka atokoɔ afɔrebɔdeɛ ne nsã afɔrebɔdeɛ no ho abɔ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 29:20"/>“ ‘Afahyɛ ɛda a ɛtɔ so mmiɛnsa no so no, mode anantwie mmaa dubaako, nnwennini mmienu, nnwammaanini a wɔadi afe no dunan a wɔnnii dɛm biara <verse eid="NUM 29:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 29:21"/>a sɛdeɛ moyɛ no daa no, mode anantwie, nnwennini ne nnwammaa no ne aduane ne nsã afɔrebɔdeɛ bɛka afɔrebɔdeɛ biara ho. <verse eid="NUM 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 29:22"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ mode ɔpapo bɔ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ de ka daa ɔhyeɛ afɔrebɔ no ho a atokoɔ afɔrebɔdeɛ ne nsã afɔrebɔdeɛ ka ho.<verse eid="NUM 29:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 29:23"/>“ ‘Afahyɛ a ɛtɔ so nan no, mode anantwie mma edu, nnwennini mmienu, ne nnwammaanini a wɔadi afe no dunan a wɔnnii dɛm biara <verse eid="NUM 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 29:24"/>a mode atokoɔ afɔrebɔdeɛ ne nsã afɔrebɔdeɛ bɛka wɔn mu biara ho. <verse eid="NUM 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 29:25"/>Afei, momfa ɔpapo a sɛdeɛ moyɛ daa no atokoɔ ne nsã afɔrebɔdeɛ ka ho nka afɔrebɔ a mobɔ no daa no ho.<verse eid="NUM 29:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 29:26"/>“ ‘Afahyɛ ɛda a ɛtɔ so enum no, momfa anantwie mma nkron, nnwennini mmienu ne nnwammaanini a wɔadi afe no dunan a wɔnnii dɛm biara. <verse eid="NUM 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 29:27"/>Sɛdeɛ moyɛ no daa no, mode atokoɔ afɔrebɔdeɛ ne nsã afɔrebɔdeɛ bɛka ho. <verse eid="NUM 29:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 29:28"/>Momfa ɔpapo a aburoo afɔrebɔdeɛ ne nsã afɔrebɔdeɛ ka ho mmɔ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ sononko nka afɔdeɛ ahodoɔ a mobɔ no daa no ho.<verse eid="NUM 29:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 29:29"/>“ ‘Afahyɛ ɛda a ɛtɔ so nsia no, mode anantwie mma nwɔtwe, nnwennini mmienu ne nnwammaanini a wɔadi afe a wɔnnii dɛm biara dunan <verse eid="NUM 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 29:30"/>bɛka wɔn atokoɔ ne wɔn nsã afɔrebɔdeɛ no ho sɛdeɛ moyɛ no daa no. <verse eid="NUM 29:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 29:31"/>Momfa ɔpapo a atokoɔ afɔrebɔdeɛ ne nsã afɔrebɔdeɛ ka ho mmɔ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ sɛdeɛ moyɛ no daa no.<verse eid="NUM 29:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 29:32"/>“ ‘Afahyɛ ɛda a ɛtɔ so nson no, mode anantwie mma nson, nnwennini mmienu ne nnwammaanini a wɔadi afe a wɔnnii dɛm biara dunan <verse eid="NUM 29:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 29:33"/>a mode atokoɔ ne nsã afɔrebɔdeɛ bɛka wɔn mu biara ho bɛbɔ afɔdeɛ. <verse eid="NUM 29:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 29:34"/>Afei, mode ɔpapo baako bɛbɔ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ a atokoɔ ne nsã afɔrebɔdeɛ ka ho aka daa afɔrebɔ no ho sɛdeɛ moyɛ no daa no.<verse eid="NUM 29:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 29:35"/>“ ‘Ɛda a ɛtɔ so nwɔtwe no, frɛ nnipa no nyinaa na wɔnhyia kommyɛ so. Ɛnsɛ sɛ moyɛ adwuma biara saa ɛda no. <verse eid="NUM 29:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 29:36"/>Mommɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ. <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani sɔ saa afɔdeɛ no. Momfa nantwie ba baako, odwennini baako, nnwammaanini a wɔadi afe a wɔnnii dɛm nson mmɔ afɔdeɛ. <verse eid="NUM 29:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 29:37"/>Na sɛ morebɔ saa afɔdeɛ no a, momfa atokoɔ ne nsã afɔrebɔdeɛ nka ho. <verse eid="NUM 29:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 29:38"/>Afei, mode ɔpapo baako bɛbɔ bɔne ho afɔdeɛ a atokoɔ ne nsã afɔrebɔdeɛ ka ho a daa afɔdeɛ a mobɔ no nso ka ho.<verse eid="NUM 29:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 29:39"/>“ ‘Sɛ mohyia didi afirinhyia no mu a, twa ara na ɛtwa sɛ mobɔ saa afɔdeɛ yi ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. Na ɛka mo afɔrebɔ a mobɔ fa ɛbɔ a moahyɛ anaa deɛ ɛfiri mo pɛ mu a ɛyɛ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ, atokoɔ afɔdeɛ, nsã afɔdeɛ anaa asomdwoeɛ afɔdeɛ no ho.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 29:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 29:40"/>Mose kaa saa mmara yi nyinaa kyerɛɛ Israelfoɔ no sɛdeɛ Awurade hyɛɛ no no.<verse eid="NUM 29:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="NUM 30"/>
  <para style="s1">Bɔhyɛ Ho Mmara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 30:1"/>Afei, Mose hyiaa Israel mmusua no mu mpanimfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahyɛ sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 30:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 30:2"/>sɛ obi hyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɔ anaa ɔka ntam hyɛ bɔ no, ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔbu so. Ɛsɛ sɛ ɔyɛ deɛ ɔka sɛ ɔbɛyɛ no pɛpɛɛpɛ.<verse eid="NUM 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 30:3"/>“Sɛ ababaawa bi hyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɔ anaa ɔka ntam hyɛ bɔ ɛberɛ a ɔda so te nʼagya fie, <verse eid="NUM 30:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 30:4"/>na nʼagya no te sɛ ne ba no ahyɛ bɔ, na wanka hwee a, ne bɔhyɛ no di mu. <verse eid="NUM 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 30:5"/>Nanso sɛ ɛba sɛ nʼagya no si no bɔhyɛ no ho ɛkwan ɛda a ɔbɛte no a, ɔde sɛe bɔhyɛ no. <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de bɛkyɛ ababaawa no, ɛfiri sɛ, nʼagya ampene sɛ ɔbɛdi so.<verse eid="NUM 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 30:6"/>“Sɛ ɔhyɛ bɔ a ɛnyɛ na akyire no ɔkɔware <verse eid="NUM 30:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 30:7"/>na ne kunu no te saa bɔhyɛ no ho asɛm nanso wanka ho hwee ɛda no ara a, ne bɔhyɛ no di dwuma. <verse eid="NUM 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 30:8"/>Na sɛ ne kunu no po bɔhyɛ bɔne no a, po a ɔpoeɛ no di mu enti, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de bɛkyɛ no.<verse eid="NUM 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 30:9"/>“Sɛ ɔbaa yɛ okunafoɔ anaa wɔagyaa no aware a, ɛkwan biara so, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔdi ne bɔhyɛ nyinaa so.<verse eid="NUM 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 30:10"/>“Sɛ waware na ɔte ne kunu fie a ɛhɔ na ɔhyɛɛ ɛbɔ no, <verse eid="NUM 30:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 30:11"/>na ne kunu no teeɛ na wanka ho hwee a, ne bɔhyɛ no di mu. <verse eid="NUM 30:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 30:12"/>Na sɛ ɛda no ara a ɔteeɛ no, sɛ wampene so a, ne bɔhyɛ no nni mu na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de bɛkyɛ no. <verse eid="NUM 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 30:13"/>Enti, ne kunu na ɔbɛsi so dua anaasɛ ɔbɛkasa atia bɔhyɛ no. <verse eid="NUM 30:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 30:14"/>Sɛ ɛda mu no nyinaa wanka ho hwee deɛ a, na ɛkyerɛ sɛ, ɔpene so. <verse eid="NUM 30:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 30:15"/>Sɛ ɔtwɛn ma ɛda koro fa so na sɛ ɔbɛka sɛ bɔhyɛ no nni mu a, ɛho asotwe biara a ɔbaa no penee so no bɛba ɔbarima no so.”<verse eid="NUM 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 30:16"/>Yei ne mmara a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nam Mose so de maa ɔbarima ne ne yere ne agya ne ne babaa a wɔn nyinaa te efie baako mu no.<verse eid="NUM 30:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="NUM 31"/>
  <para style="s1">Midianfoɔ So Aweretɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 31:1"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 31:2"/>“Esiane sɛ Midianfoɔ daadaa mo de mo kɔɔ abosonsom mu no enti, tɔ wɔn so awere. Yei akyi no wɔbɛwu na wɔakɔ wɔn agyanom nkyɛn.”<verse eid="NUM 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 31:3"/>Mose ka kyerɛɛ nkurɔfoɔ no sɛ, “Monyi mmarima no mu bi na wɔnkɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aweretɔ sa a ɔde tia Midianfoɔ no. <verse eid="NUM 31:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 31:4"/>Momfa Israel abusua biara mu nnipa apem nkɔ ɔsa no.” <verse eid="NUM 31:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 31:5"/>Wɔyɛɛ saa nyaa mmarima mpem dumienu siesie wɔn maa ɔko no. <verse eid="NUM 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 31:6"/>Afei Mose ma wɔkɔeɛ, nnipa apem baako a wɔfiri abusuakuo biara mu. Ɔsɔfoɔ Eleasa babarima Pinehas na ɔdii wɔn anim kɔɔ ɔko no. Wɔrekɔ no, wɔde kronkronneɛ a ɛwɔ kronkronbea hɔ ne totorobɛnto a wɔbɛhyɛn akanyane akodɔm no kɔeɛ.<verse eid="NUM 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 31:7"/>Na sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛeɛ no, wɔkumm Midian mmarima nyinaa wɔ ɔko no mu. <verse eid="NUM 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 31:8"/>Wɔn a wɔkumm wɔn no bi ne Midian ahemfo baanum a wɔn edin de Ewi, Rekem, Sur, Hur ne Reba. Beor babarima Balaam nso, wɔkumm no. <verse eid="NUM 31:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 31:9"/>Afei, Israel asraafoɔ no kyekyeree Midian mmaa ne mmɔfra nyinaa ne wɔn anantwie ne wɔn nnwan fom nneɛma pii kaa ho. <verse eid="NUM 31:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 31:10"/>Wɔtoo Midian nkuro ne nkuraa nyinaa mu ogya, hyee no pasaa. <verse eid="NUM 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 31:11"/>Wɔfaa asadeɛ ne afodeɛ a nnipa no ne mmoa ka ho. <verse eid="NUM 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 31:12"/>Wɔde nneduafoɔ no ne ɔko no mu nneɛma a wɔnyaeɛ no nyinaa brɛɛ Mose, ɔsɔfoɔ Eleasa ne Israelfoɔ a na wɔabɔ wɔn atenaseɛ wɔ Moab bepɔ so baabi a na ɛbɛn Asubɔnten Yordan a wɔtwa firi Yeriko ba hɔ no.<verse eid="NUM 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 31:13"/>Mose ne ɔsɔfoɔ Eleasa ne mpanimfoɔ a wɔtuatua nnipa no ano no kɔhyiaa nkonimdifoɔ no ɛkwan. <verse eid="NUM 31:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 31:14"/>Nanso, Mose bo fuu mpanimfoɔ a wɔtuatua akodɔm no ano no.<verse eid="NUM 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 31:15"/>Ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, “Adɛn enti na moankunkum mmaa no? <verse eid="NUM 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 31:16"/>Yeinom ara ne nnipa no a wɔtie Balaam enti wɔmaa Israelfoɔ gyaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kɔsom abosom wɔ bepɔ Peor so a enti ɛmaa ɔhaw ne abɛbrɛsɛ bebree baa yɛn so bɛsɛee yɛn no. <verse eid="NUM 31:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 31:17"/>Monkunkum mmarimaa no nyinaa. Afei, monkunkum mmaa a wɔne mmarima adeda no nyinaa. <verse eid="NUM 31:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 31:18"/>Mommfa mo nsa nka mmaayewa nketewa no. Wɔn deɛ, momfa wɔn na mo ne wɔn nkɔtena.<verse eid="NUM 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 31:19"/>“Afei, momfiri atenaeɛ ha nkɔtena baabi nnanson, ɛfiri sɛ, mo nyinaa moakum nnipa anaa mode mo nsa aka efunu. Monnwira mo ho ne mo nneduafoɔ ne nnansa ne ne nnanson so. <verse eid="NUM 31:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 31:20"/>Monkae na monnwira mo ntadeɛ ne biribiara a wɔde aboa nwoma, abirekyie nwi anaa dua ayɛ.”<verse eid="NUM 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 31:21"/>Afei, ɔsɔfoɔ Eleasa ka kyerɛɛ mmarima a wɔkɔɔ ɔko no sɛ, “Yei ne mmara a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahyɛ a waka akyerɛ Mose. <verse eid="NUM 31:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 31:22"/>Biribiara a ɛtumi gyinaa ogya ano te sɛ sikakɔkɔɔ, dwetɛ, kɔbere, dadeɛ, sanya anaa sumpii no, <verse eid="NUM 31:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 31:23"/>ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde ka ogya sɛdeɛ ɛho bɛte. Yei akyi, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde ahodwira nsuo dwira ho ma ɛho te. Nanso, biribiara a ɛrentumi nnyina ogya ano no deɛ, wɔmfa nsuo nnwira ho. <verse eid="NUM 31:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 31:24"/>Nnanson so, ɛsɛ sɛ mosi mo ntadeɛ na modwira mo ho ansa na moasane aba atenaeɛ hɔ.”<verse eid="NUM 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔkyekyɛ Afodeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 31:25"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 31:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 31:26"/>“Ɛsɛ sɛ wo ne ɔsɔfoɔ Eleasa ne mmusua no mpanimfoɔ nyinaa twerɛ afodeɛ a nnipa ne mmoa ka ho a monyaa no ɔko no mu. <verse eid="NUM 31:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 31:27"/>Afei, monkyɛ afodeɛ no mu mmienu. Momfa ɛfa mma mmarima a wɔkɔɔ ɔko no na momfa ɛfa a aka no mma nnipa a aka no. <verse eid="NUM 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 31:28"/>Nanso, deɛ ɛdi ɛkan no, ɛsɛ sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nya kyɛfa a ɛyɛ nneduafoɔ, anantwie, mfunumu, ne nnwan a ɛfiri akofoɔ no kyɛfa mu. <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kyɛfa no bɛyɛ ahanum biara mu baako. <verse eid="NUM 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 31:29"/>Fa saa kyɛfa yi ma ɔsɔfoɔ Eleasa na ɔnhim no afɔrebukyia no anim mfa mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. <verse eid="NUM 31:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 31:30"/>Afei Israelfoɔ a wɔaka no kyɛfa no, monyi aduonum biara mu baako. Momfa yei mma Lewifoɔ a wɔhwɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no so no.” <verse eid="NUM 31:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 31:31"/>Enti, Mose ne ɔsɔfoɔ Eleasa yɛɛ deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ wɔn sɛ wɔnyɛ no.<verse eid="NUM 31:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 31:32"/>Afodeɛ a ɛkaeɛ a akofoɔ no faeɛ no dodoɔ yɛ nnwan mpem ahansia aduɔson enum (675,000); <verse eid="NUM 31:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 31:33"/>anantwie mpem aduɔson mmienu (72,000); <verse eid="NUM 31:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 31:34"/>mfunumu mpem aduosia baako (61,000); <verse eid="NUM 31:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 31:35"/>ne mmaayewa mpem aduasa mmienu (32,000).<verse eid="NUM 31:35"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 31:36"/>Nneɛma no fa a wɔde maa asraafoɔ no dodoɔ nie:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 31:36"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 31:36">Nnwan mpem ahasa aduasa nson ne ahanum (337,500) <verse eid="NUM 31:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 31:37"/>a wɔde mu ahansia aduɔson enum (675) maa <char style="nd">Awurade</char>;<verse eid="NUM 31:37"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 31:38"/>Anantwie mpem aduasa nsia (36,000) a wɔde mu aduɔson mmienu (72) maa <char style="nd">Awurade</char>;<verse eid="NUM 31:38"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 31:39"/>mfunumu mpem aduasa ne ahanum (30,500) a emu aduosia baako (61) yɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kyɛfa;<verse eid="NUM 31:39"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 31:40"/>mmaayewa mpem dunsia (16,000); wɔde wɔn mu aduasa mmienu (32) maa <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.<verse eid="NUM 31:40"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 31:41"/>Wɔde <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kyɛfa no nyinaa maa ɔsɔfoɔ Eleasa sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ ɔnyɛ no ara pɛ.<verse eid="NUM 31:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 31:42"/>Afodeɛ no a Israelfoɔ no nyaa no na ɛdidi soɔ yi: <verse eid="NUM 31:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 31:43"/>nnwan mpem ahasa aduasa nson ne ahanum (337,500), <verse eid="NUM 31:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 31:44"/>anantwie mpem aduasa nsia (36,000), <verse eid="NUM 31:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 31:45"/>mfunumu Mpem aduasa ne ahanum (30,500) ne <verse eid="NUM 31:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 31:46"/>mmaayewa mpem dunsia (16,000). <verse eid="NUM 31:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 31:47"/>Nnipa no kyɛfa a wɔnyaeɛ no, Mose yiyii nneduafoɔ ne mmoa aduonum biara mu baako de maa Lewifoɔ a wɔhwɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan so no. Wɔyɛɛ yei nyinaa sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ Mose no.<verse eid="NUM 31:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 31:48"/>Afei, asraafoɔ mpanimfoɔ baa Mose nkyɛn bɛka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 31:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 31:49"/>“Owura yɛabu nnipa a yɛde wɔn kɔɔ ɔko no nyinaa ano akyerɛ wo na yɛn mu baako koraa anyera. <verse eid="NUM 31:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 31:50"/>Ɛno enti, yɛfiri deɛ yɛnyaa no ɔko no mu no bi mu rebɛda <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ase. Yɛn asedadeɛ no yɛ sika adwinneɛ, nkapo, nkawa, nsonkawa ne kɔnmuadeɛ. Yeinom bɛyɛ mpatadeɛ ama yɛn kra wɔ Awurade anim.”<verse eid="NUM 31:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 31:51"/>Mose ne ɔsɔfoɔ Eleasa gyee saa akyɛdeɛ yi a ɛyɛ sikakɔkɔɔ ne adwinneɛ firii asraafoɔ mpanimfoɔ no nkyɛn. <verse eid="NUM 31:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 31:52"/>Ne nyinaa mu sikakɔkɔɔ a asahene no de baeɛ sɛ akyɛdeɛ a wɔde rebrɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no ano si nkariboɔ kilogram ɔha ne aduɔkron. <verse eid="NUM 31:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 31:53"/>Na asraafoɔ no afa ɔko no mu nneɛma a wɔnyaeɛ no bi. <verse eid="NUM 31:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 31:54"/>Enti Mose ne Eleasa gyee akyɛdeɛ no firii asraafoɔ mpanimfoɔ no hɔ, na wɔde sikakɔkɔɔ no baa Ahyiaeɛ Ntomadan no mu sɛ ɛnyɛ nkaeɛ adeɛ mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛ Israelfoɔ yɛ ne dea.<verse eid="NUM 31:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="NUM 32"/>
  <para style="s1">Mmusuakuo A Wɔwɔ Yordan Apueeɛ Fam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 32:1"/>Na Ruben ne Gad mmusuakuo no wɔ nyɛmmoa pii, enti wohunuu sɛ Yaser ne Gilead nsase no bɛyɛ ama wɔn nnwan ne anantwie no, <verse eid="NUM 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 32:2"/>wɔkɔɔ Mose ne ɔsɔfoɔ Eleasa ne nnipa no ntuanofoɔ no nkyɛn. Wɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 32:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 32:3"/>“Atarot, Dibon, Yaser, Nimra, Hesbon, Eleale, Sebam, Nebo ne Beon. <verse eid="NUM 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 32:4"/>Saa nsase yi nyinaa, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ako, agye ama Israelfoɔ. Ɛbɛyɛ ama yɛn nnwan ne yɛn anantwie. <verse eid="NUM 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 32:5"/>Sɛ yɛanya adom wɔ mo anim a, yɛsrɛ mo momfa saa asase yi mma yɛn sɛ yɛn kyɛfa na monnyae Asubɔnten Yordan fa nohoa a mopɛ sɛ mode ma yɛn no.”<verse eid="NUM 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 32:6"/>Mose nso bisaa Rubenfoɔ ne Gadfoɔ no sɛ, “Mokyerɛ sɛ, mopɛ sɛ motena ha wɔ ɛberɛ a mo nuanom atwa mu rekɔko? <verse eid="NUM 32:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 32:7"/>Mopɛ sɛ mobu nnipa a aka no aba mu ma wɔsane sɛ wɔrenkɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de ama wɔn no so no? <verse eid="NUM 32:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 32:8"/>Ade koro yi ara na mo agyanom yɛeɛ. Mesomaa wɔn firii Kades-Barnea sɛ wɔnkɔsra asase no <verse eid="NUM 32:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 32:9"/>nanso ɛberɛ a wɔwiee nsra no na wɔfiri Eskol subɔnhwa mu baeɛ no, wɔbuu nnipa no aba mu sɛ wɔrenkɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Bɔhyɛ Asase no so. <verse eid="NUM 32:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 32:10"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bo fuu wɔn enti ɔkaa ntam sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 32:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 32:11"/>wɔn a wɔayi wɔn afiri Misraim asase so no, wɔn mu biara nni hɔ a wadi boro mfirinhyia aduonu a ɔbɛhunu asase a ɔhyɛɛ Abraham, Isak ne Yakob ho bɔ no, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔanni ne mmara so. <verse eid="NUM 32:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 32:12"/>Agye Kenesini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛdeɛ <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:19">1 Mose 15.19</ref> ne <ref loc="GEN 36:11">36.11</ref></char> kyerɛ no, Kenesifoɔ yɛ Kanaanfoɔ a wɔyɛ Esau asefoɔ.</char></note> Yefune babarima Kaleb ne Nun babarima Yosua na wɔnka ho, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔde wɔn akoma nyinaa dii <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akyi, hyɛɛ nnipa nkuran sɛ wɔnkɔ Bɔhyɛ Asase no so. <verse eid="NUM 32:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 32:13"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> ma yɛkyinkyinii ɛserɛ no so hɔ mfirinhyia aduanan kɔsii sɛ saa awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ amumuyɛfoɔ no nyinaa wuwuiɛ.<verse eid="NUM 32:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 32:14"/>“Nanso, monhwɛ, abɔnefoɔ, moreyɛ saa bɔne koro no ara bi. Esiane sɛ mo dɔɔso enti, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bo a afu Israel no ano bɛyɛ den sen kane no. <verse eid="NUM 32:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 32:15"/>Sɛ motwe mo ho firi Onyankopɔn ho sei a, ɔbɛma nnipa no atena ɛserɛ so hɔ akyɛre na sɛ nnome bi ba wɔn so a, ɛho asodie da mo so.”<verse eid="NUM 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 32:16"/>Wɔteaam sɛ, “Ɛnte saa koraa! Yɛbɛyɛ yɛn nnwammuo na yɛakyekyere nkuro akɛseɛ asi nketewa no anan <verse eid="NUM 32:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 32:17"/>na yɛn ankasa de akodeɛ bɛhyehyɛ yɛn ho adi Israelfoɔ a aka no anim kɔsi sɛ yɛde wɔn bɛba asomdwoeɛ mu ama wɔabɛfa wɔn agyapadeɛ. Na deɛ ɛdi ɛkan no, ɛsɛ sɛ yɛkyekyere nkuro a yɛbɛgye afasuo afa ho ama yɛn nkurɔfoɔ atena mu na ɛhɔfoɔ no ankɔto anhyɛ wɔn so. <verse eid="NUM 32:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 32:18"/>Sɛ Israelfoɔ no nsa nkaa wɔn agyapadeɛ no a, yɛrentena ha. <verse eid="NUM 32:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 32:19"/>Yɛmpɛ Yordan ho asase biara. Mmom, yɛpɛ asase a ɛda apueeɛ fam hɔ no.”<verse eid="NUM 32:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 32:20"/>Mose kaa sɛ, “Ɛyɛ. Sɛ mobɛyɛ sɛdeɛ moaka no, na mode akodeɛ ahyehyɛ mo ho ama <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔko no, <verse eid="NUM 32:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 32:21"/>na mode mo akodɔm no atware Yordan kɔsi sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛpamo nʼatamfoɔ no a, <verse eid="NUM 32:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 32:22"/>ɛnneɛ, sɛ asase no ho asɛm dwo brɛoo wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim a, motumi sane ba. Ɛba saa a, na ɛkyerɛ sɛ, moayɛ mo asɛdeɛ ama <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne Israelfoɔ nyinaa. Na asase a ɛda apueeɛ no nso, Awurade de bɛma mo.<verse eid="NUM 32:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 32:23"/>“Sɛ moanni asɛm a moaka no so a, na moayɛ bɔne atia <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na sɛ ɛba saa a, monhunu sɛ, ɛho asotwe bɛba mo so. <verse eid="NUM 32:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 32:24"/>Monkɔ so nkyekyere nkuro mma mo fiefoɔ na monyɛ nnwammuo mma mo nnwan na monni asɛm a mokaeɛ no nyinaa so.”<verse eid="NUM 32:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 32:25"/>Ruben ne Gad nkurɔfoɔ no kaa sɛ, “Yɛbɛdi wʼahyɛdeɛ no so pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="NUM 32:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 32:26"/>Yɛn mma, yɛn yerenom, yɛn nnwan ne yɛn anantwie bɛtena Gilead nkuropɔn mu. <verse eid="NUM 32:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 32:27"/>Nanso, yɛn a wɔakyere yɛn sɛ asraafoɔ no bɛko ama <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛdeɛ woaka no.”<verse eid="NUM 32:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 32:28"/>Enti, Mose penee so ka kyerɛɛ Eleasa, Yosua ne mpanimfoɔ a wɔtuatua Israel mmusuakuo ano no sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 32:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 32:29"/>“Sɛ Gad ne Ruben abusuakuo mu mmarima nyinaa a wɔakyere wɔn ahyɛ sraa mu sɛ wɔnkɔko mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no ne me kɔ Yordan na sɛ wɔkɔko di nkonim wɔ hɔ a, momfa Gilead asase no mma wɔn; <verse eid="NUM 32:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 32:30"/>na sɛ wɔankɔ a, ɛnneɛ wɔmpene so mfa nsase a mowɔ wɔ Kanaan asase so no bi.”<verse eid="NUM 32:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 32:31"/>Gad ne Ruben abusuafoɔ kaa bio sɛ, “Yɛbɛdi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm so; <verse eid="NUM 32:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 32:32"/>yɛde akodeɛ bɛhyehyɛ yɛn ho adi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akyi akɔ Kanaan nanso, yɛn ara yɛn asase bɛda Yordan fa ha.”<verse eid="NUM 32:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 32:33"/>Enti, Mose maa wɔde Amorifoɔhene Sihon ne Basanhene Og nsasetam ne wɔn nkuro akɛseɛ maa Gad, Ruben ne Yosef babarima Manase mmusuakuo.<verse eid="NUM 32:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 32:34"/>Gad nkurɔfoɔ na wɔkyekyeree saa nkuro yi: Dibon, Atarot, Aroer. <verse eid="NUM 32:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 32:35"/>Atrot-Sofan, Yaser Yogbeha, <verse eid="NUM 32:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 32:36"/>Bet-Nimra ne Betharan. Na ɛyɛ nkuro a nnwan wɔ mu yie. <verse eid="NUM 32:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 32:37"/>Ruben mmammarima na wɔkyekyeree saa nkuro a ɛdidi so yi: Hesbon, Eleale Kiriataim, <verse eid="NUM 32:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 32:38"/>Nebo, Baal-Meon ne Sibma. Wɔtotoo nkuro a wɔakyekyere no edin foforɔ.<verse eid="NUM 32:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 32:39"/>Afei, Makir asefoɔ a wɔfiri Manase abusuakuo mu kɔɔ Gilead kɔko dii hɔ so pamoo Amorifoɔ a saa ɛberɛ no na wɔte hɔ no nyinaa. <verse eid="NUM 32:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 32:40"/>Enti, Mose de Gilead maa Makirfoɔ, Manase asefoɔ, ma wɔtenaa hɔ. <verse eid="NUM 32:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 32:41"/>Manase abusuakuo mu nnipa foforɔ bi a wɔfiri Yair nso tenatenaa Gilead nkuro bebree so, sesaa beaeɛ a wɔwɔ hɔ no din frɛɛ hɔ Hafrotyair. <verse eid="NUM 32:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 32:42"/>Ɔbarima bi a ne din de Noba dii asraafoɔ bi anim de wɔn kɔɔ Kenat ne ne nkuraaseɛ kɔbɔɔ wɔn atenaeɛ wɔ hɔ, enti ɔde ne din Noba too saa beaeɛ hɔ.<verse eid="NUM 32:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="NUM 33"/>
  <para style="s1">Israelfoɔ Akwantuo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 33:1"/>Yei ne akwantuo nhyehyɛeɛ a Israelfoɔ dii so ɛberɛ a Mose ne Aaron de wɔn firi Misraim no. <verse eid="NUM 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 33:2"/>Mose twerɛɛ faako a wɔfaeɛ nyinaa sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kyerɛɛ no sɛ ɔnyɛ no. Yeinom ne mmea mmea a wɔsoɛɛ wɔ wɔn akwantuo no mu.<verse eid="NUM 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 33:3"/>Wɔsiim firii Rameses kuropɔn no mu wɔ Twam Afahyɛ a ɛdi ɛkan no akyi bosome a ɛdi ɛkan ɛda a ɛtɔ so dunum. Wɔde akokoɔduru firii hɔ a Misraimfoɔ no rehwɛ wɔn. <verse eid="NUM 33:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 33:4"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, na Misraimfoɔ no resie wɔn mmakan a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kunkumm wɔn anadwo a adeɛ rebɛkye ama wɔatu ɛkwan no no. <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nam atemmuo nnwuma akɛseɛ yi so dii Misraimfoɔ anyame no nyinaa so nkonim.<verse eid="NUM 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 33:5"/>Wɔfirii Rameses no, wɔbaa Sukot.<verse eid="NUM 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 33:6"/>Wɔfirii Sukot bɛbɔɔ atenaeɛ wɔ Etam, ɛserɛ no ano.<verse eid="NUM 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 33:7"/>Wɔfirii Etam sane wɔn akyi baa Pihahirot a ɛne Baal-Sefon di nhwɛanimu, na wɔbɔɔ atenaeɛ wɔ bepɔ Migdol ho.<verse eid="NUM 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 33:8"/>Wɔfiri Pihahirot, na wɔtwaa Ɛpo Kɔkɔɔ no kɔɔ ɛserɛ so. Wɔde nnansa nante kɔɔ Etam ɛserɛ so kɔbɔɔ atenaeɛ wɔ Mara.<verse eid="NUM 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 33:9"/>Wɔfirii Mara no, wɔbaa Elim; baabi a na nsuwa dumienu ne mmɛdua aduɔson wɔ hɔ.<verse eid="NUM 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 33:10"/>Wɔfirii Elim no, wɔbɔɔ atenaeɛ wɔ Ɛpo Kɔkɔɔ no ho.<verse eid="NUM 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 33:11"/>Wɔfirii Ɛpo Kɔkɔɔ no ho, kɔbɔɔ atenaeɛ wɔ Sin anweatam so.<verse eid="NUM 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 33:12"/>Wɔtu firii Sin kɔɔ Dofka.<verse eid="NUM 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 33:13"/>Wɔfirii Dofka kɔbɔɔ atenaeɛ wɔ Alus.<verse eid="NUM 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 33:14"/>Wɔfirii Alus kɔbɔɔ atenaeɛ wɔ Refidim, baabi a na wɔnnya nsuo mma nnipa no nnom.<verse eid="NUM 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 33:15"/>Wɔfirii Refidim no, wɔkɔɔ Sinai ɛserɛ so.<verse eid="NUM 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 33:16"/>Wɔfirii Sinai ɛserɛ so no, wɔkɔɔ atenaeɛ wɔ Kibrot-Hataawa.<verse eid="NUM 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 33:17"/>Wɔfirii Kibrot-Hataawa kɔɔ Haserot.<verse eid="NUM 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 33:18"/>Wɔfirii Haserot kɔɔ Ritma.<verse eid="NUM 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 33:19"/>Wɔfirii Ritma kɔɔ Rimon Peres.<verse eid="NUM 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 33:20"/>Wɔfirii Rimon Peres kɔɔ Libna.<verse eid="NUM 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 33:21"/>Wɔfirii Libna kɔɔ Risa.<verse eid="NUM 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 33:22"/>Wɔfirii Risa kɔɔ Kahelata.<verse eid="NUM 33:22"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 33:23"/>Wɔfirii Kahelata kɔbɔɔ atenaeɛ wɔ Sefer Bepɔ so.<verse eid="NUM 33:23"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 33:24"/>Wɔfirii Sefer Bepɔ so kɔɔ Harada.<verse eid="NUM 33:24"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 33:25"/>Wɔfirii Harada kɔɔ Makhelot.<verse eid="NUM 33:25"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 33:26"/>Wɔfirii Makhelot kɔɔ Tahat.<verse eid="NUM 33:26"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 33:27"/>Wɔfirii Tahat kɔbɔɔ atenaeɛ wɔ Tera.<verse eid="NUM 33:27"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 33:28"/>Wɔfirii Tera kɔɔ Mitka.<verse eid="NUM 33:28"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 33:29"/>Wɔfirii Mitka kɔɔ Hasmona.<verse eid="NUM 33:29"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 33:30"/>Wɔfirii Hasmona kɔɔ Moserot.<verse eid="NUM 33:30"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 33:31"/>Wɔfirii Moserot kɔɔ Beneyaakan.<verse eid="NUM 33:31"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 33:32"/>Wɔfirii Beneyaakan kɔɔ Horhagidgad.<verse eid="NUM 33:32"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 33:33"/>Wɔfirii Horhagidgad kɔɔ Yotbata.<verse eid="NUM 33:33"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 33:34"/>Wɔfirii Yotbata kɔɔ Abrona.<verse eid="NUM 33:34"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 33:35"/>Wɔfirii Abrona kɔɔ Esion-Geber.<verse eid="NUM 33:35"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 33:36"/>Wɔfirii Esion-Geber kɔbɔɔ atenaeɛ wɔ Kades, wɔ Sin ɛserɛ so.<verse eid="NUM 33:36"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 33:37"/>Wɔfirii Kades kɔbɔɔ atenaeɛ wɔ Bepɔ Hor so, wɔ Edom hyeɛ ano. <verse eid="NUM 33:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 33:38"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔduruu Bepɔ Hor ase no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ ɔsɔfoɔ Aaron sɛ ɔnkɔ bepɔ no atifi, na ɛhɔ na ɔkɔwuiɛ. Asɛm yi sii mfeɛ aduanan so a Israelfoɔ tu firii Misraim no. <verse eid="NUM 33:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 33:39"/>Aaron dii mfeɛ ɔha aduonu mmiɛnsa, na ɔwuiɛ wɔ Bepɔ Hor so.<verse eid="NUM 33:39"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 33:40"/>Saa ɛberɛ no ara mu na Kanaanhene Arad a ɔtenaa Negeb wɔ Kanaan asase so no tee sɛ Israelfoɔ no reba nʼasase so.<verse eid="NUM 33:40"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 33:41"/>Israelfoɔ no toaa wɔn akwantuo no so firi Bepɔ Hor so kɔbɔɔ atenaeɛ wɔ Salmona.<verse eid="NUM 33:41"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 33:42"/>Wɔfirii Salmona kɔtenaa Punon.<verse eid="NUM 33:42"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 33:43"/>Wɔfirii Punon kɔtenaa Obot.<verse eid="NUM 33:43"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 33:44"/>Wɔtoaa so kɔɔ Iye-Abarim, Moab hyeɛ so.<verse eid="NUM 33:44"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 33:45"/>Wɔfirii hɔ no, wɔkɔɔ Dibon Gad.<verse eid="NUM 33:45"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 33:46"/>Wɔfirii Dibon Gad kɔɔ Almon Diblataim.<verse eid="NUM 33:46"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 33:47"/>Wɔfirii Almon Diblataim kɔtenaa Abarim mmepɔ a ɛbɛn Nebo no so.<verse eid="NUM 33:47"/></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 33:48"/>Na akyire no, wɔtu kɔbɔɔ atenaeɛ wɔ Moab tata so a ɛbɛn Asubɔnten Yordan a ɛne Yeriko di nhwɛanimu no. <verse eid="NUM 33:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 33:49"/>Wɔwɔ saa beaeɛ hɔ no, wɔtenaa mmeaeɛ bebree a ɛbɛn Asubɔnten Yordan ho—ɛfiri Bet-Yesimot kɔsi Abel Sitim a ɛwɔ Moab tata so no.<verse eid="NUM 33:49"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 33:50"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔabɔ atenaseɛ hɔ no na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nam Mose so kasa kyerɛɛ Israelfoɔ no sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 33:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 33:51"/>“Sɛ motwam Asubɔnten Yordan kɔduru Kanaan asase so a, <verse eid="NUM 33:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 33:52"/>mompam nnipa a wɔte hɔ no nyinaa na monsɛe wɔn abosom ne ahoni a wɔde aboɔ ayɛ ne asɔreeɛ a wɔasisi no petee mu wɔ mmepɔ so ne beaeɛ a wɔsom wɔn ahoni no nyinaa. <verse eid="NUM 33:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 33:53"/>Mede asase no ama mo. Momfa na montena so. <verse eid="NUM 33:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 33:54"/>Mo mmusua mu nnipa dodoɔ so na wɔbɛhwɛ ama mo asase. Wɔn a wɔdɔɔso no, wɔbɛma wɔn asase kɛseɛ na wɔn a wɔsua no nso bɛnya asase ketewa.<verse eid="NUM 33:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 33:55"/>“Sɛ moampam nnipa a wɔte hɔ no a, wɔbɛyɛ mo ani ase mpe ne mo honam mu nkasɛɛ. Wɔbɛha mo wɔ asase no so. <verse eid="NUM 33:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 33:56"/>Na mede deɛ mahyɛ sɛ mɛyɛ wɔn no bɛyɛ mo.”<verse eid="NUM 33:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="NUM 34"/>
  <para style="s1">Kanaan Ahyeɛ</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 34:1"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 34:2"/>“Ka kyerɛ Israelfoɔ no sɛ, ‘Sɛ mobɛduru Kanaan asase no so a, asase a mede rema mo sɛ mo ankasa asase no a, sɛi na mo ahyeɛ bɛyɛ:<verse eid="NUM 34:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 34:3"/>“ ‘Asase no anafoɔ fam no bɛyɛ Sin ɛserɛ so a ɛda Edom ano. Anafoɔ hyeɛ no ano bɛfiri Nkyene Ɛpo no. <verse eid="NUM 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 34:4"/>Ɛbɛtoa so akɔtra Akrabbim wɔ anafoɔ hɔ a ɛrekɔ Sin no. Nʼanafoɔ pa ara no bɛyɛ Kades-Barnea, na ɛfiri hɔ akɔsi Hasarada de akɔwie Asmon. <verse eid="NUM 34:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 34:5"/>Ɛfiri Asmon a, ɛhyeɛ no bɛkɔ ara akɔsi Misraim asuwa no mu na ano akɔpem Po Kɛseɛ no ano.<verse eid="NUM 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 34:6"/>Mo hyeɛ a ɛwɔ atɔeɛ no bɛyɛ Po Kɛseɛ a ɛda hɔ no.<verse eid="NUM 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 34:7"/>Mo hyeɛ a ɛda atifi no bɛfiti aseɛ wɔ Po Kɛseɛ no ano, na atoa so akɔ apueeɛ fam akɔsi bepɔ Hor, <verse eid="NUM 34:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 34:8"/>de akɔ Lebo Hamat na akɔ Sedad <verse eid="NUM 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 34:9"/>ne Sifron akɔ Hasar-Enan.<verse eid="NUM 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 34:10"/>Apueeɛ hyeɛ no bɛfiri Hasar-Enan anafoɔ akɔ Sefam <verse eid="NUM 34:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 34:11"/>akɔsi Ribla wɔ Ain apueeɛ fam. Ɛfiri hɔ a, ɛbɛkɔ akɔpem Kineret ɛpo no wɔ apueeɛ fam, <verse eid="NUM 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 34:12"/>na asiane afiri Asubɔnten Yordan, na akɔpem Nkyene Ɛpo no.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 34:12"/>
  <para style="li4" vid="NUM 34:12">“ ‘Sɛdeɛ mo asase ahyeɛ teɛ nie.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 34:13"/>Afei Mose ka kyerɛɛ Israelfoɔ no sɛ, “Yei ne asase a mobɛbɔ so ntonto akyekyɛ afa no. <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahyɛ sɛ mmusua nkron ne fa a aka no na wɔbɛkyekyɛ mu afa. <verse eid="NUM 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 34:14"/>Ruben ne Gad mmusuakuo no ne Manase abusua fa no deɛ, wɔama wɔn asase no bi <verse eid="NUM 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 34:15"/>wɔ Yordan apueeɛ fam a ɛne Yeriko di nhwɛanimu no.”<verse eid="NUM 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntuanofoɔ A Wɔbɛkyɛ Asase No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 34:16"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 34:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 34:17"/>“Nnipa a wɔn edin didi so yi na mayi wɔn sɛ wɔnkyekyɛ asase no mu: ɔsɔfoɔ Eleasa, Nun babarima Yosua. <verse eid="NUM 34:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 34:18"/>Yi abusua biara mu ɔpanin baako na ɔmmoa wɔn nni saa dwuma yi.<verse eid="NUM 34:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 34:19"/>“Wɔn edin na ɛdidi soɔ yi:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 34:19"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 34:19">“Yuda abusuakuo ntuanoni, Yefune babarima Kaleb;<verse eid="NUM 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 34:20"/>Simeon abusuakuo ntuanoni, Amihud babarima Semuel;<verse eid="NUM 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 34:21"/>Benyamin abusuakuo ntuanoni, Kislon babarima Elidad;<verse eid="NUM 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 34:22"/>Dan abusuakuo ntuanoni, Yogli babarima Buki;<verse eid="NUM 34:22"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 34:23"/>Yosef babarima Manase abusuakuo ntuanoni, Efod babarima Haniel;<verse eid="NUM 34:23"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 34:24"/>Yosef babarima Efraim abusuakuo ntuanoni, Siftan babarima Kemuel;<verse eid="NUM 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 34:25"/>Parknak babarima Elisafan, Sebulon abusuakuo ntuanoni;<verse eid="NUM 34:25"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 34:26"/>Asan babarima Paltiel, Isakar abusuakuo ntuanoni;<verse eid="NUM 34:26"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 34:27"/>Selomi babarima Ahihud, Aser abusuakuo ntuanoni;<verse eid="NUM 34:27"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 34:28"/>Amihud babarima Pedahel, Naftali abusuakuo ntuanoni.”<verse eid="NUM 34:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 34:29"/>Saa nnipa yi na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yii wɔn sɛ wɔnhwɛ nkyekyɛ Kanaan asase no mu mma Israelfoɔ no.<verse eid="NUM 34:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="NUM 35"/>
  <para style="s1">Lewifoɔ Nkuro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 35:1"/>Ɛberɛ a Israelfoɔ bɔɔ atenaseɛ wɔ Yordan ho, Moab tata so a ɛne Yeriko di nhwɛanimu no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 35:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 35:2"/>“Ka kyerɛ Israelfoɔ no na wɔmfa wɔn agyapadeɛ no mu bi a ɛyɛ nkuro ne ɛho mmoa adidibea mma Lewifoɔ. <verse eid="NUM 35:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 35:3"/>Nkuro no mu na wɔbɛtena na wɔn anantwie, wɔn nnwan ne wɔn mmoa a aka no nso akɔ adidi wɔ adidibea hɔ.<verse eid="NUM 35:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 35:4"/>“Wɔn mmoa adidibea no kɛseɛ bɛfiri kuro no afasuo ho a ne fa biara tɛtrɛtɛ yɛ anammɔn apem ne ahanum. <verse eid="NUM 35:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 35:5"/>Monsusu anammɔn mpensa mfiri kuro no afasuo no ho wɔ nʼafanan nyinaa. Yei bɛyɛ adidibea kɛseɛ ama nkuro no.<verse eid="NUM 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dwanekɔbea Nkuropɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 35:6"/>“Momma Lewifoɔ no dwanekɔbea nkuropɔn nsia, baabi a obi a wafom akum ɔfoforɔ no bɛtumi adwane akɔ. Momfa nkuro aduanan mmienu nka wɔn ho. <verse eid="NUM 35:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 35:7"/>Ne nyinaa bɛyɛ nkuro aduanan nwɔtwe ne ho adidibea. <verse eid="NUM 35:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 35:8"/>Saa nkuro yi bɛfiri Israelfoɔ no agyapadeɛ mu. Mmusuakuo no mu akɛseɛ bɛma Lewifoɔ no nkuro bebree na mmusuakuo nketewa no ama kakraa. Abusuakuo biara bɛma sɛdeɛ nʼagyapadeɛ kɛseɛ teɛ.”<verse eid="NUM 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 35:9"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="NUM 35:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 35:10"/>“Ka kyerɛ nnipa no sɛ, sɛ wɔduru asase no so a, <verse eid="NUM 35:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 35:11"/>wɔnyi Dwanekɔbea Nkuro a wɔde bɛma obiara a wafom akum onipa na ɔpɛ sɛ ɔdwane kɔ hɔ. <verse eid="NUM 35:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 35:12"/>Saa nkuro yi bɛyɛ dwanekɔbea ama owudifoɔ no afiri owufoɔ no abusuafoɔ a wɔpɛ sɛ wɔtɔ owufoɔ no wuo so awere; na ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔkum owudifoɔ no, gye sɛ wɔadi nʼasɛm abu no kumfɔ. <verse eid="NUM 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 35:13"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔsisi Dwanekɔbea Nkuro yi mu mmiɛnsa wɔ Kanaan asase so <verse eid="NUM 35:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 35:14"/>na wɔsisi mmiɛnsa nso wɔ Asubɔnten Yordan apueeɛ fam. <verse eid="NUM 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 35:15"/>Ɛnyɛ Israelfoɔ nko na ɛhɔ bɛyɛ wɔn dwanekɔbea, na mmom, ɛbɛyɛ dwanekɔbea ama ahɔhoɔ ne akwantufoɔ nyinaa.<verse eid="NUM 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 35:16"/>“Nanso, sɛ obi de dadeɛ poma sin bi bɔ obi kum no a, wɔfa no sɛ wadi awu, enti ɛsɛ sɛ wɔkum owudifoɔ no. <verse eid="NUM 35:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 35:17"/>Anaasɛ, sɛ wɔde ɛboɔ kɛseɛ bi bɔɔ owufoɔ no a, ɛyɛ awudie enti ɛsɛ sɛ wɔkum owudifoɔ no. <verse eid="NUM 35:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 35:18"/>Saa ara nso na sɛ wɔde dua na wɔde kumm no a, ɛte ara ne no. <verse eid="NUM 35:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 35:19"/>Sɛ ɔweretɔfoɔ no hyia owudifoɔ no baabiara a, ɔwɔ ho kwan sɛ ɔkum no bi. <verse eid="NUM 35:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 35:20"/>Enti, sɛ obi nam ɔtan so to biribi bɔ obi, anaasɛ ɔtetɛ no, <verse eid="NUM 35:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 35:21"/>anaa ɔde abufuo bɔ no kuturuku na onii no wu a, ɔyɛ owudifoɔ enti ɛsɛ sɛ ɔweretɔfoɔ no kum owudifoɔ no.<verse eid="NUM 35:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 35:22"/>“Na sɛ nkwanhyia no mu, sɛ obi anhyɛ da na ɔtoo biribi anaa ɛboɔ bi a wanto no abufuo so, na ɔnnim sɛ ɛbɛbɔ obi <verse eid="NUM 35:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 35:23"/>anaasɛ ɛnyɛ nʼadwene sɛ ɔbɛha ne ɔtamfoɔ, na sɛ onipa ko no wu a, <verse eid="NUM 35:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 35:24"/>ɛsɛ sɛ wɔdi asɛm no. Wɔbɛhwɛ sɛ ɛyɛ nkwanhyia anaa ɛnyɛ nkwanhyia, anaasɛ ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde saa onipa no hyɛ owufoɔ no weretɔni nsa anaa wɔmmfa no nhyɛ ne sa. <verse eid="NUM 35:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 35:25"/>Sɛ wɔsi gyinaeɛ sɛ ɛyɛ nkwanhyia a, nnipa no bɛgye owudifoɔ no afiri ɔweretɔfoɔ no nsam. Wɔbɛma owudifoɔ no atena Dwanekɔbea Kuro no mu hɔ ara akɔsi sɛ ɔsɔfopanin bɛwu.<verse eid="NUM 35:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 35:26"/>“Sɛ owudifoɔ no firi kuro no mu <verse eid="NUM 35:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 35:27"/>na ɔweretɔni no hyia no na ɔkum no tua ka a, wɔmmfa no sɛ ɛyɛ awudie, <verse eid="NUM 35:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 35:28"/>ɛfiri sɛ, anka ɛsɛ sɛ owudifoɔ no tena kuro no mu kɔsi mmerɛ a ɔsɔfopanin no bɛwu. Ɔsɔfopanin no wuo akyi no, owudifoɔ no tumi kɔ ne kurom.<verse eid="NUM 35:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 35:29"/>“Yei yɛ Israelfoɔ mmara a ɛwɔ hɔ daa firi awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ so kɔsi awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ so.<verse eid="NUM 35:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 35:30"/>“Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔkum awudifoɔ nyinaa. Nanso gye sɛ adansefoɔ boro onipa baako di tia no ansa na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔkum no. Sɛ onipa baako di adanseɛ tia no nso a, ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔkum no.<verse eid="NUM 35:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 35:31"/>“Ɛberɛ biara a wɔbɛbua obi kumfɔ no, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔwuo a wɔnnye mpata biara.<verse eid="NUM 35:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 35:32"/>“Odwanefoɔ bi a ɔhyɛ Dwanekɔbea Kuropɔn no mu no nso nni ho ɛkwan sɛ ɔtua sika ma wɔma no ɛkwan kɔ ne kurom ansa na ɔsɔfopanin no awu.<verse eid="NUM 35:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 35:33"/>“Yei na ɛbɛma awerɛhyɛmu sɛ asase a mote so no ho rengu fi, ɛfiri sɛ, awudie gu asase ho fi. Wɔrentumi nyɛ mpatadeɛ foforɔ biara mma awudie gye sɛ wɔkum owudifoɔ no. <verse eid="NUM 35:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 35:34"/>Monngu asase a morekɔtena so no ho fi, ɛfiri sɛ, Me, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mete hɔ bi. Mene <char style="nd">Awurade</char> a mete Israelfoɔ mu no.”<verse eid="NUM 35:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="NUM 36"/>
  <para style="s1">Mmammaa Bi Agyapadeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 36:1"/>Afei, Gilead abusua no ntuanofoɔ, Makir a ɔyɛ Manase babarima ne Yosef nana asefoɔ kɔɔ Mose ne Israel ntuanofoɔ nkyɛn de adesrɛdeɛ kɔtoo wɔn anim. <verse eid="NUM 36:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 36:2"/>Wɔkaa sɛ, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ wo sɛ bɔ ntonto kronkron na gyina so kyekyɛ asase no ma Israelfoɔ. <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ wo sɛ fa yɛn nuabarima Selofehad agyapadeɛ ma ne mmammaa. <verse eid="NUM 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 36:3"/>Na sɛ ɛba sɛ wɔn mu bi kɔware wɔ abusua foforɔ mu a, ɔde asase a wɔde ama no no bɛkɔ awadeɛ. Sɛ ɛba saa a, yɛn abusua no asase kɛseɛ so bɛte. <verse eid="NUM 36:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 36:4"/>Sɛ Mfirinhyia Aduonum Afahyɛ no duru so a, saa agyapadeɛ no bɛka hɔ ara. Na ɛbɛfiri abusuakuo a anka ɛwɔ no no nsam koraa.”<verse eid="NUM 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 36:5"/>Enti Mose de saa ɔhyɛ nsɛm a ɛfiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yi maa Israelfoɔ no: “Yosef abusuakuo mu nnipa no asɛm no yɛ nokorɛ. <verse eid="NUM 36:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 36:6"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔhyɛ nsɛm a ɛfa Selofehad mmammaa no ho no nie: wɔtumi ware ɔbarima biara a wɔpɛ a ɔfiri wɔn agya abusuakuo mu. <verse eid="NUM 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 36:7"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ agyapadeɛ biara firi abusuakuo bi nsam kɔ abusuakuo foforɔ nsam, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ abusuakuo biara agyapadeɛ tena hɔ sɛdeɛ ɛteɛ firi kane no. <verse eid="NUM 36:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 36:8"/>Mmammaa a wɔwɔ Israel mmusuakuo mu nyinaa a agyapadeɛ tumi kɔ wɔn nsam no, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔwareware wɔ wɔn mmusuakuo mu na wɔn agyapadeɛ amfiri wɔn abusuakuo mu. <verse eid="NUM 36:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 36:9"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ agyapadeɛ biara firi abusuakuo bi nsam kɔdi ɔfoforɔ nsam, ɛsɛ sɛ Israel abusuakuo biara bɔ nʼagyapadeɛ ho ban.”<verse eid="NUM 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 36:10"/>Selofehad mmammaa no yɛɛ sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ Mose no. <verse eid="NUM 36:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 36:11"/>Mahla, Tirsa, Hogla, Milka ne Noa nyinaa warewaree wɔn agyanom nuammarima mma. <verse eid="NUM 36:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 36:12"/>Wɔwarewaree wɔ Yosef babarima Manase mmusua mu enti wɔn agyapadeɛ no kaa wɔn abusuakuo mu.<verse eid="NUM 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 36:13"/>Yei ne mmara ne nhyehyɛeɛ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nam Mose so de maa Israelfoɔ ɛberɛ a wɔbɔɔ atenaeɛ wɔ Moab tata so so, wɔ Asubɔnten Yordan a ɛne Yeriko di nhwɛanimu no ho.<verse eid="NUM 36:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 36"/>
</usx>
